<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Oluku</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɛza Iyeshi Iyi I Ngyi Mu Kwuwo Ungwu OLUKU</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oluku</para>
  <para style="toc3">Olu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɛza Iyeshi Iyi I Ngyi Mu Kwuwo Ungwu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Oluku</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛza Iyeshi iyi i ngyi mu kwuwo ungwu Oluku i zɔ Ɔzhizɔsi tee uwu gba akwu Usama uwu Izirɛ mbala enzu lɛɛbi le uwu bɔkɔ o siso o shimɛzhi mawu awu. Oluku a ka yi ma tee Kundu uwu Ɔkwu a yaa Ɔzhizɔsi ma kaa &lt;&lt;le bo laa ɛza iyeshi la ayirɛwa,&gt;&gt; Ɛza Iyeshi ɛlɛ i shi egbo gyɔɔ mu igɔ ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi enzu. Iso iyi ɔnyɛ iyi i to egbo mo i yi mu kwokpo ungwu Oluku kwɔlɛ tete, iyi gba i yi tee mu iyemo iyi kwokpo kwɔlɛ, o ta anu iyi inyɔma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi mu imbwama ngwu, kwu siso meka iyi isomo moshi wu. Oluku tete gba a ba ɛza iyi ibulɔma mbala ifulama munamuna iyi luzɛ undu ikwidufulo mu Okrasi mbala isomo moshi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi le mu kwokpo ungwu Iwomo iyi Wazilɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu kwokpo ungwu Oluku kwɔlɛ kɛɛkyi gba ɔ fya ɛza matee: kwɔmu ungwu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mbala isomo iyi wapya ilɔ mbaa kɔmba ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi, Ɔzhizɔsi umɛshɛri a ka mu Ɔtɛpu, mbala aba iyi Onzu uwu Osamariya u shari mbala Umɛ uwu e Tomo le. Munamuna mu kwokpo ungwu Ɛza Iyeshi ɛlɛ, o siso iyɛkɔkɔ mu meka iyi Ukpo ilɛma, Kwundu uwu Ukpo, riyi ingyi eko mu ɛduma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, mbala i gba la ingbomo ikpa iyi Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="is">Iso Iyi I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwɔmba ungwu Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima mbala Ɔzhizɔsi mbala iyimo iyi imɛshɛri mba (1.5—2.52)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima (3.1-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Obatisima mbala ipwama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi (3.21—4.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo gedegede mu Ogalili (4.14—9.50)</para>
  <para style="io1">I ye mu Ogalili nzhii ba mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ (9.51—19.27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Afyi imbwambwa mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbala kɛlɛ mbala ɔzhɛrusalɛ (19.28—23.56)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyimo mu kwuvɔ, izɔma mbaa enzu, mbala iso moshi iyi Ɔkwu (24.1-53)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Kambwu Iyemo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Enzu gyɔɔ o wo ekpasu ɔ ka apula iyi bɔkɔ i wo mekeka nzu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />O kya iyi bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ o ma apula ɛlɛ mu eyi mbo ngbaa mu iyemo o so nzu akwɛyi o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Onzu Uwakwu Ɔtiyɔfilɔ, Imi uwu mi mbwalu undu uwu apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi ngbaa miyemo awu gba mi ma tee i shoshi kaa la mi ka ŋa iyi bɔkɔ i wo nɛrinɛri. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Mi wo ɛlɛ kaa la ŋɔ yitu ongbulolo uwu apula lɛɛbi iyi ɔ zɔ ŋɔ awu.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">O Ta Anu Iyi Kwɔmba Ungwu Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Kwuye ungwu Ɛrɔdu akwu ɔsu uwu Ozhudiya awu, obwoshi uwu Ukpo uwufo uwu o ya wu tee Ozakaraya, uwu a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi ebwoshi umba Abizha e yi mɔmɔ. Oko wu ɔ ya wu tee Ɛlizabɛti; uwu a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Ɛrɔnu. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ozakaraya mbala oko wu Ɛlizabɛti wepepo mbo, ɔ kwu enzu umba ototo mu idu iyi Ukpo, ɔ mbwalu ɛrama iyi Ɔkwu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Enzu mbɔlɛ ba o yi ɛmɛ mo kwuwongu Ɛlizabɛti akwu odogyi, wepepo mbo ba ɔ wuma a.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ɔnu uwufo Ozakaraya e yi mu ɛduma iyi ebwoshi umba Ukpo iwomo mu Ɔtɛpu. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Akwɛyi kyamate bɔkɔ ukwu uwu ebwoshi umba Ukpo u zɔ tee lo wo, o nyɛpwu akwɛyi ɔ ŋa Ɔzakariya tee le fye mu Ɔtɛpu kaa le pwu apula iyi umbwɔ ferere mu ɔla. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ e fyemo mu Ɔtɛpu uwu Ɔkwu, <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />riba ingyi enzu ba ri kpala ɛlu mu kwudu mu Ukpo ilɛma kwuyengwu e yi mu apula iyi umbwɔ ferere ipwumo. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Akwɛyi e gele ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ɔkwu mu idu wu, a rima mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu kwubwu ungwu isabɔ mbaa bɔkɔ o pwu apula iyi umbwɔ ferere. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Kwuye ungwu Ozakaraya a ma wu, iyi i wo wu mo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu ba a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ozakaraya, ki wiyi mo! Ukpo a pwa kwoya ŋa-a, oko ŋɔ Ɛlizabɛti a mba ŋa umɛ ɔnzɔnu. Ŋɔ kpo wu ɛnyi tee Ɔzhɔnu. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Umɛ ele aa kwaŋa kiya ingyi ɔnyɛ mbala egbo iruwu, enzu gyɔɔ ɔ mwɔnyɛ kwuwo ungwu kwɔmba wu! <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Ɔzhɔnu aakwu onzu uwakwu mu idu iyi Ɔkwu. E wo atɛ mo ba e wo embyi umba iyimo umbanambana mo. Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mbala wu ngbaa mu ubwu uwu anyi wu, <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />akwɛyi aa gba la Ɛmɛ umba Izirɛ gyɔɔ ma a nya mba mbaa Ɔkwu Ukpo mba. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ee yi mu keyi unga Ɔkwu laa ekpasu kyamate anukenzu Elazha tayi. Aa gba laa umba ada mbala ɛmɛ e lomesu; ee shi enzu umba bɔkɔ o lomo laa Ukpo mo kaa lo mbwalu ɔgwuzɛ uwu enzu umba ototo; ee wo ɛlɛ kaa enzu umba Ɔkwu lo yi ɛnwu ma lo rigbo wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Akwɛyi Ozakaraya e yo ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi wo la mi yitu tee ɛlɛ ii wo mo? Imi mi wuma-a, oko mi tete a wuma-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi kwu Ɔgɛburɛ, mi ri mu idu iyi Ukpo, uwu a lɔ mi tee la mi so ŋɔ iso kaa la mi ba ŋa ɛza iyesheshi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ kwu idu fulo mu iso mi mo awu, kenzu ŋɔ kee kokomo, ŋɔ so iso kego fo nzhii ba kwuyengwu iso ɛlɛ i nyɔlɔma dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Enzu umba ɔ rigbo Ozakaraya mu kwudu awu ba o le mu kenzu iyama iyi ishimo iyi Ozakaraya mu Ɔtɛpu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />kwuyengwu a ba wɔ kwudu, e so iso mbala mba ego fo, akwɛyi ɔ zɔngɔma tee a ma ɛbɛ mu Ɔtɛpu. Akwɛyi akwu mu ewo gba e so iso mbala mba le ŋa.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Kwuye ungwu Ozakaraya a mbwa ɛduma wu ma mu Ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi a ka mogba. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Mizhikembo iyi kwuye bwɛ, akwɛyi oko wu, Ɛlizabɛti e to rifo mo akwɛyi e nvye ɛnwu ma mogba nzhii ba evya ɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Ɛlizabɛti a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu e shɔɔkɔ a mbwa mi ma-a.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;A ma eyembembyi mi akwɛyi e to mi lovya ma mu eyi iyi enzu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Ta Anu Iyi Kwɔmba Ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mu ɔvya uwɔrɛnyi uwu rifo ingyi Ɛlizabɛti, Ukpo a lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ wu, Ɔgɛburɛ mu kwuse ungwu Ɔnazarɛti mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />A lɔ wu ma mbaa umesheko uwu e de yitu iyi ɔnzɔnu dɛ mo, uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhɔsɛfu uwu a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Ɔsu Odevidi awu, e yi mu anu wu ishimo. Umesheko ele o ya wu tee Omeri. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a bo mbaa wu akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi gbɛlɛ ŋɔ ɛnyi loo oko u she la Ukpo! Ɔkwu e yi mbala ŋa looǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Ɛlɛ i shi Omeri e wo ubugyi gyɔɔ akwɛyi e le mu egbo ibyima mekeka iyi iluma iyi ɛnyi igbɛlɛma ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Omeri; ki wiyi mo, ŋɔ fya esheshi ma-a mbaa Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ŋɔ shi rifo ŋɔ mba umɛ ɔnzɔnu, akwɛyi ŋɔ kpowu ɛnyi tee Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Aakwu onzu uwakwu, akwɛyi o ya wu tee Umɛ uwu Ukpo Edego. Ɔkwu Ukpo e shi wu akwu ɔsu kyamate usɔkwu wu Ɔdɛvidi tayi, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />akwɛyi akwu ɔsu uwu ɛdɔ iyi Ɔzhɛkɔbu iyɔkpɔɔ; irɛsu wu i bɔ mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Omeri a za laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo tee, &lt;&lt;Imi ba mi di yitu iyi ɔzɔnu dɛ mo le, ɛlɛ i wo la ba i womo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye ma ŋa akwɛyi ekpasu iyi Ukpo i kpo ŋɔ kwundu. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ umɛ uwu ŋɔ bi mba le, aakwu Ɔkɛrikɛri akwɛyi o ya wu tee Umɛ uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Onzu ŋɔ, Ɛlizabɛti, uwu bɔkɔ enzu o ya wu tee odogyi awu, la iwuma wu lala a ra la rifo ingyi evya ɛrɛnyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Moo kiya ingyi ki ga Ukpo iwomo ki yi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Akwɛyi Omeri a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi kwu umɛgba uwu Ɔkwu, iyi ŋɔ so awu li yi tayi.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a lu wu afyima.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omeri A Ke Gboga Laa Ɛlizabɛti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mu afyi ɛnyi Omeri e yimo efyefya a ka mu kwuse ungufo mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya, ɛzhi iyi lɔwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />E fye mogba uwu Ozakaraya akwɛyi a gbɛlɛ Ɛlizabɛti ɛnyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Tabɔkɔ Ɛlizabɛti a pwa ɛnyi igbɛlɛma iyi Omeri, akwɛyi umɛ mu ubwu wu e wo akpa kwuwongu ɔnyɛ imwuma. Akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye mu Ɛlizabɛti <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />akwɛyi a ta oga kpaa uwu ɔnyɛ, a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Esheshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo ŋɔ le, i ka iyi eko lɛɛbi ma, esheshi ɛlɛ i yi mbala umɛ uwu ŋɔ bi mba le tete! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Mi wo kwuwongumbe iyi bɔkɔ i do tee anyi wu Ɔkwu mi a nyɔ mbaa mi kaa le gbo mi oga? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Moo tabɔkɔ mi pwa ɛnyi igbɛlɛma ŋa, akwɛyi umɛ mu ubwu mi e wo akpa kwuwongu ɔnyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwaŋa kwuwongu bɔkɔ ŋɔ kwu idu fulo tee ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a lɔ minyi ŋɔ awu i nyɔlɔma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omeri E So Kwɔmu Ungu Ukpo Iduma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Akwɛyi Omeri a zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">Kwundu mi kwu du Ɔkwu ma;<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Kwundu mi kwu mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu Ukpo Usama mi,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />moo e lolo mbaa mi, Imi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">umɛgba wu uwu mi kwu kiya kinyinyi mo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Te i na mu kwɔfyi ungwɔnɛ enzu lɛɛbi o ya mi tee onzu uwesheshi,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />kwuwongu Ukpo Uwakwu e wo mi apula iyɛku.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">Ɛnyi wu akwu ɛkɛrikɛri;<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Mu ɔyi uwunawuna a ma eyembembyi iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o wiyi wu.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />E wo apula iyɛku mu ewo wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o to ɛmba o fulo kadu, a kpa mba shaa mbala ikama iyi egbo mbo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />A kala asu umbakwu ma mu ikpa iyi ɛsu mba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ ɔ zhi mba ma awu ba, e wo mbo enzu umbakwu.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Ukpo ee shi enzu umba lonzu apula iyi irimo iyeshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">umba bɔkɔ o yi kwuwo ba a ra mba ma laa ewo iyidɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Ishi iyi bɔkɔ e to laa asɔkwu nzu, a nyɔlɔ yi ma-a, e bo te kaa la mbwama laa umɛgba wu Izirɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />E lolo akwɛyi a ma eyembembyi iyi Aburamu mbala ɛdɔ wu lɛɛbi iyɔkpɔɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Omeri a ŋɔ mbala Ɛlizabɛti nzhii ba evya ɛla dɛ gba a gba a kama mogba wu le.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔmba Ungwu Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Kwuye ungwu kwɔmba ungwu Ɛlizabɛti kwu wo mo akwɛyi a mba umɛ ɔnzɔnu. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Enzu umba ɔ nɔ o kpa wu mbala enzu umba ɛdɔ wu lɛɛbi o pwa iyeshi iyi Ɔkwu e wo wu, akwɛyi o mbwa wu ma mu ɔnyɛ imwuma.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwɔranda, o bo tee lɔ zɛ umɛ awu ɛsɔ ma akwɛyi ɔ gyi tee lo kpo wu ɛnyi iyi ete wu, Ɔzakariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Anyi wu ba a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt; Aayimo! Ɛnyi wu o ya wu tee Ɔzhɔnu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Akwɛyi ɔ za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi ba lu yi onzu uwu o ya ɛnyi ɛlɛ mu ɛdɔ yi mo le kɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Akwɛyi o yo ete wu kwuyo mu ewo iwomo kaa lo pwa ɛnyi iyi a gyi tee le kpo umɛ awu.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Ɔzakariya e wo ewo tee lo shi wu kiya ingyi ɛzu ikama, akwɛyi a ka tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyi wu akwu Ɔzhɔnu.&gt;&gt; Ɛlɛ i shi uwewe kenzu iyama. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Mɔmɔɔmɔ kenzu unga Ozakaraya ka gba laa iwuma akwɛyi e le mu iso isomo, akwɛyi e le mu Ukpo iduma. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Iyi i wo enzu wa nɔ kpamba ma lɛɛbi, akwɛyi munamuna mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya iso ɛlɛ gba enzu o ma mu isomo le. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso ɛlɛ, a byi egbo gyɔɔ akwɛyi o yo tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ ele e be yimo le a ŋa akwu umbe ngyɔ?&gt;&gt; Moo i zɔ gedegede tee ekpasu iyi Ɔkwu i yi mbala wu.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ozakaraya A Du Ukpo Ma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye mu ete wu Ɔzhɔnu, Ɔzakariya akwɛyi a zɔ rɛnu ingyi Ukpo tee:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;Iduma akwiyi Ɔkwu, Ukpo uwu Izirɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">E bo te kaa la mbwama laa enzu wu ma, akwɛyi a wamba ma mu rinye.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />E shi nzu Usama uwakwuu-o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">mu ɛdɔ iyi umɛgba wu, Odevidi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />E to ishi mu lunzu undu anukenzu wu wakɛrikɛri ngbaa mekyi<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />tee a sa nzu ma mu ewo iyi agewa nzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o gyi nzu mo awu.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />A zɔ tee a ma eyembembyi iyi asɔkwu nzu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">akwɛyi e lolo iso iyi ɔkɛrikɛri iyi bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi awu.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />A vungɔma laa usɔkwu nzu Aburamu tee,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />a wa nzu ma mu ewo iyi agewa nzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">kaa la ki fya ekpasu iyi ki gbo wu ɔya laa idu kpu mo,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kaa la ki gbo wu ɔya mu ɔkɛrikɛri mbala ototo nzhii ba lukwu nzu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />&lt;&lt;Umɛ mi, uŋɔ ba enzu o ya ŋa tee anukenzu uwu Ukpo Uwakwuu uwoshi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Ŋɔ to keyi laa Ɔkwu kaa bi nɔngɔ wu ɔgwuzɛ ma,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />kaa za laa enzu wu tee o sa mba ma gba ɔ gbɔ mba ingbomo mba ma.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kuwongwu eyembembyi iyi iyi Ukpo nzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">ee shi ɔnu uwu isama u ngyi moshi u nyɔ munyi nzu,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />kaa lu shi ɛbɛ laa umba o yi mu ipwu iyi kwundu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo ubugyi kwuwongu egbo ibyima iyi lukwu awu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">kaa la pya nzu le so mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu oloto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu a bulɔma a kɔma mu kwundu; a ka ŋɔ mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara nzhii ba kwuye kwu bo ungwu bɔkɔ a zɔ ɛwu ma laa enzu umba Izirɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kwɔmba Ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matthew 1.18-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mu afyi ɛnyi Ɔsu Ɔgɔsitu a ta ɔkpa tee lɔ wa enzu umba Ɛzhi iyi Oroma ma lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu iwama iyi kwonze le mu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwiriniyɔ akwu ogwomina uwu Osiriya awu. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Akwɛyi onzonzu a ka mu kwuse wu kaa lɔ ka ɛnyi wu ma.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Ɔzhɔsɛfu tete e yimo mu kwuse ungwu Ɔnazarɛti mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili a ka mu kwuse ungwu Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ, kwuse ungwu Odevidi mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya kwuwongu a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Odevidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />A ka tee lɔ ka ɛnyi wu ma mbala Omeri uwu bɔkɔ e yewu mu iluma bɛnɛ awu. Kwuye kwɔngu ba Omeri a za laa rifo, <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />akwɛyi tabɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ mu Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ bɛnɛ, akwɛyi afyi iyi kwɔmba wu i gyirima. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Akwɛyi a mba umɛ wu uwu kwonze, umɛ ɔnzɔnu, e wuwumo mu ekpayi akwɛyi e fulo wu mu kwuwoyo - kwuwongu o fya riyoga mo.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wapya Luzhi Mbala Alɔgbulɔ Umba Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Wa pya luzhi o yi kɛlɛ mu kwuko ngwu ɛzhi ɛnyi mɔmɔ, o yi mu luzhi mba igbomo mutu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ɔkwu e bo mbaa mba, akwɛyi inzumbɛku iyi Ɔkwu i lemo mamba kyamate ɛbɛ tayi. Iyi i wo mbo mo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu ba a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu wiyi mo! Mi ka yi laa ɛza iyeshi iyi i ka laa enzu lɛɛbi ɔnyɛ uwakwu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ɔnɛnɛ ɔ mba yi Usama mu kwuse ungwu Odevidi - Okrasi Ɔkwu! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ɛlɛ gba akwa yi kɛzɔ le: lu du umɛ uwelu o wuwumo mu ekpayi akwɛyi o fulo wu mu kwuwoyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Akwɛyi kporo ba uzhi uwu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo o wɔ moshi mbala ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu kwonze awu akwɛyi o le mu Ukpo iduma, o zɔ tee:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;inzumbɛku akwiyi Ukpo moshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ba, oloto lu yi mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a mwɔnyɛ mbala mba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mbamba o lu mba afyima o gba o ka ma moshi, akwɛyi wa pya luzhi mbamba o so esu tee, &lt;&lt;La ki so mu Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ kaa la ki ma kiya ingyi ki wo ingyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu e so nzu ele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Akwɛyi o yimo efyefya ɔ ka, akwɛyi o du Omeri mbala Ɔzhɔsɛfu mbala umɛ awu, uwu o shi wu a nɔma mu kwufolo. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Tabɔkɔ wa pya luzhi mbamba ɔ ma wu, akwɛyi ɔ ba ɛza laa enzu iyi bɔkɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo e so mbo mu reshi ingyi umɛ awu. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Enzu lɛɛbi umba ɔ pwa ɛza iyi bɔkɔ wa pya luzhi mbamba o so mbo, izele i yi mbo mo. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Omeri ba e shi apula ɛlɛ ma lɛɛbi mu egbo wu laa egbo ibyima ma yi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Akwɛyi wapya luzhi mbamba o gba o kama mbaa ɛduma mba, laa Ukpo iduma mbala ɛnyi igbɛlɛma kwuwongu apula iyi bɔkɔ umba o pwa ba o ma i yi kyamate bɔkɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo e so mbo tayi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Kpo Ɔzhizɔsi Ɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ɔnu uwu bɔkɔ umɛ awu e yi afyi ɛranda, akwɛyi ɔ zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma akwɛyi o kpowu ɛnyi tee Ɔzhizɔsi, iyi bɔkɔ akwu ɛnyi iyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo e shi ngbaa kwuyengwu o do shi rifo wu mo.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="ms">O Ka Laa Ɔzhizɔsi Mu Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Tabɔkɔ kwuyengwu iwuluma mbakwu womo, kyamate ɛrama iyi Omosisi i so mbo, akwɛyi Ɔzhɔsɛfu mbala Omeri o to wu o ka wu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa lo ra wu lo shi Ɔkwu, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />kyamate bɔkɔ o ka mu ɛrama iyi Ɔkwu awu tee: &lt;&lt;Umɛ ɔnzɔnu uwu kwonze uwunawuna, akwu mɛga kaa lo ya wu tee Ɔkɛrikɛri uwu Ɔkwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />O kyo o ka kaa lo wo isabɔ iyi agarikwokwo wepo nana atatabiri wepo, kyamate ɛrɛma iyi Ɔkwu i so tee lo wo awu.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Kwuye kwɔngu onzu uwufo o ya wu tee Ɔsamɔ , onzu uwu ototo u bɔ kwuyi mu ɛduma iyi Ukpo, e yi mɔmɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. A rigbo kaa la ma U sa uwu Izirɛ. Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba e yi mbala wu <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />ba e so wu kpeke-e tee a ma Omezaya uwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu e to mbo ishi tee a nyɔ dɛ gba e kpomo le. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Kwundu e yi Ɔsamɔ mo akwɛyi a ka mu Ɔtɛpu. Kwuye ungwu ete wu mbala anyi wu o bo laa Ɔzhizɔsi mu Ɔtɛpu kaa lo wo wu iyi bɔkɔ Ɛrama mba i zɔ tee lo wo, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />akwɛyi Ɔsamɔ e to umɛ awu mu ewo wu akwɛyi a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi a zɔ tee:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu mi, kekelele lafya laa umɛgba ŋa kaa le somo moloto bi ŋa moo iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ so ŋɔ shimɛzhi awu, ŋɔ nyɔlɔ yi ma-a.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Eyi mi i ma isama ŋa,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />iyi ŋɔ nɔngɔ mu eyi iyi enzu lɛɛbi-e tee:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />E shi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, ɛbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">akwɛyi e shi enzu ŋɔ, Izirɛ igba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ete uwu umɛ awu mbala anyi uwu o ya kenzu meka iyi iso iyi Ɔsamɔ e so mu reshi ingyi umɛ ele. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Akwɛyi Ɔsamɔ a ta mba kenzu ungeshi akwɛyi a za laa Omeri, anyi wu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ ele Ukpo a ŋa wu tee kaa lakwu kwuyi ungwu ikpa mɛzhi mbala iyimo iyi enzu gyɔɔ mu Izirɛ, akwu kɛzɔ unga Ukpo unga bɔkɔ enzu riba ba towo ngo mo, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />kwuwongu umɛ ele, egbo iyira iyi enzu gyɔɔ i ta kwudu pepee. Uŋɔ ba ŋɔ wo idu shariri kyamate o la ŋa kepo mu idu tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kwuye kwɔngu, anukenzu okokpayi uwufo e yi mɔmɔ tete, o ya wu tee Ana, uwu bɔkɔ ete wu o ya wu tee Ɔfanuwɛ uwu kenzu unga Asha. Ana ba e yi lɔri gyɔɔ, e wo lɔri lorowo mbala ɔnuwu bi <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />akwɛyi ɔnu wu e kpomo. Kwuye ngwɔlɛ e yi lɔri uwo ekperanda la londo. A ŋɔ mu Ɔtɛpu; mu Ukpo ɔya igbomo,mbala Ukpo ilɛma mbala kenyo irima lutu lɔnu. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔsamɔ e yi mu isisomo laa Omeri mbala Ɔzhɔsɛfu bɛnɛ akwɛyi Ana e le mu Ukpo ɛnyi igbɛlɛma, e so iso gyɔɔ meka iyi umɛ ele laa enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ ɔ rigbo isama iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a ba sa Ɔzhɛrusalɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Igbama Mu Ɔnazarɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhɛsɛfu mbala Omeri ɔ mbwa iyinayina iwomo mate Ɛrama iyi Ɔkwu i zɔ, akwɛyi ɔ gba ɔ kama iyamba mu kwuse mbo ungwu Ɔnazarɛti mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Umɛ ele a bulɔma laa ekpasu, a nyɔlɔma laa ilukwu. Esheshi iyi Ukpo ba iyi mbala wu.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Umɛshɛri Mu Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kari kari ete uwu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala anyi wu ɔ ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbaa Odumudumu uwu Ikalama. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e yi lɔri luwo la lopo akwɛyi ɔ ka mbaa odumudumu iwomo mate bɔkɔ akwu ukwu mbo awu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Tabɔkɔ o mbwa odumudumu iwomo mo, ete wu mbala anyi wu o to ɔgwuzɛ uwu kwogba, Ɔzhizɔsi ba a rima mizhikembo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. Ete wu mbala anyi wu ba o yitu mo; <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />O ma kyamate Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mbala enzu umba ɔ zɛ kya awu ŋa. Ɔ zɛma undu kwɔfyi kwunyi akwɛyi o le wu mu igagyima mbaa ɛmɛza mba mbala enzu umba ɛdɔ mba. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Tabɔkɔ o ma wu mo, akwɛyi o gba kembo o ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa lo gagyi wu. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi ɛla akwɛyi o du wu mu Ɔtɛpu mbala wazɔ ɛzu mu alu ingbɛma mbala eyo iyomo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso wu, a ya kenzu kwuwongu ilukwu wu mbala opwu igbama wu. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Kwuye ungwu ete wu mbala anyi wu ɔ ma wu, akwɛyi izele i yi mbo mo, akwɛyi anyi wu a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ mi, kimbe ki shi ŋɔ wo nzu tee? Ada ŋa mbala mi, egbo nzu i tutumo gyɔɔ kwuwongu ki ma ŋa mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gbamba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lu gagyi mi iyi kwuwongumbe? Lu yitu tee i fate la mi yi mu kwogba ungwu Adami mo re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Umba ba ɔ zɔngɔma iso iyi e so mbo le ma mo.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Akwɛyi a mbwalu mba ɔ gba ɔ kama mu Ɔnazarɛti laa ilomo laa ete wu mbala anyi wu. Anyi wu ba e shi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mu akɔ wu. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu ibulɔma mu ɛnwu mbala ilukwu, a fya inzumbeshi mbaa Ukpo mbala enzu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Anu Itama Iyi Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Omatiyu 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Omaki 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ɔzhɔnu 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu kari unga uwo la ɛlɔ unga ɛsu irimo iyi Ɔsu Ɔtibɛriyɔ; kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔpɔtiyɔ Opaleti akwu ɔsu uwu Ozhudiya, Ɛrɔdu ba akwu ɔsu mu Ogalili, Ofilipu umanyiwu ba akwu ɔsu tete mu ɛzhi iyi Ituriya mbala Otarakuniti; akwɛyi Olisaniya ba akwu ɔsu tete mu Abilɛnɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anasi mbala Okayafasi ba ɔ kwu Ebwoshi umba Ukpo Umbakɔ. Akwɛyi afyi ɛnyi Ukpo e so iso mbala Ɔzhɔnu, umɛ uwu Ozakaraya mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu a kpa ɛvyɛ munamuna mbaa Risu ingyi Ɔzhɔda, laa anu itama tee, &lt;&lt;La lu lafya laa ingbomo yi kaa lo wo yi obatisima akwɛyi Ukpo a gba laa ingbomo yi a kpa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kyamate bɔkɔ ɔ ka mu kwokpo ungwu anukenzu Azaya awu tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Opwu uwu onzu u yi mu iyama mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara tee: &lt;La lu nɔngɔ ɔgwuzɛ ma laa Ɔkwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">la lu bɔ wu watoto ka la zɛ mawu! <verse eid="LUK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kwofo ungwunanguna ɔ nyɔlɔ ngwu ma, kwokyi ungwɔkwu ungwunanguna mbala odudu uwunawuna o shiriyi mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Ɛgwuzɛ iyi bɔkɔ i pulemo, o ndayima o bɔ ya tototo, ɛgwuzɛ ikwakwakya o piya yi ma tɛrɛtɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Enzu lɛɛbi o ma isama iyi Ukpo!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Ɔzhɔnu a za laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o bo tee lo wo mbo obatisima awu tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi agbazhi mbɔlɛ! Uwe a tayi amasa tee la lu rɛnya lu shi inyashi iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu inyɔma awu ŋa? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />La lu wo ɛduma iyi i zɔ tee lu lafya laa ingbomo yi-e. La lu so mu egbo yi tee Aburamu gba akwu eteyi le mo. Moo ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee, Ukpo e do tee a wa la ɛmɛ laa Aburamu mu ekyi ɛlɛ!<verse eid="LUK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Kwukeke kwu yi mɛzhi-e kaa lakwu kpolo akpa iyi uwɛyi ma, uwɛyi uwu bɔkɔ u wa la imwuma iyeshishi mo, o kpolowu mo o ta mu ɔyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Akwɛyi enzu o yo wu tee &lt;&lt;Ba ki wo te kekelele?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Akwɛyi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi ɛriga epo, le to ukpɛnyi le shi onzu uwu bɔkɔ ukpɛnyi lala e yi wu mo awu, onzu uwu e yi kiya ingyirimo ba la kama mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ngyi mo awu tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Enzu wa na oba uwɛzhi o bo munyi wu kaa lo wo mbo obatisima tete. O yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, kinzu kɔ, la ki wo tee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ɔzhɔnu a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu na li pika iyi ɔ za yi tee la lu na le mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Asozha umbafo tete o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kinzu kɔ? La ki wo tee?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:14">Ɔzhɔnu a za mba tee,&lt;&lt;La lu kpa enzu mɛga tee lo shi yi eduwo mo, ba la lu mulo onzu mo. Eduwo iyi ɛduma yi li kpoyekya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Enzu o le mu eyi ifulomo mbala egbo ibyima tee nana Ɔzhɔnu gba akwu Omezaya awu le ŋa. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi wo yi obatisima mu embyi, onzu uwu a ka mi ma ba e yi mu inyɔma, ekyikyi iyi ekpoyata wu lala mi domo tee la mi vuvu yi ma mo. Uwu ee wo yi obatisima mu Kwundu uwu Ukpo mbala ɔyi. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />A za la kwɔta kaa la fya ewiri iyi utu ma kaa le fu eyi iyi ewiri mu kɛnɛ wu; asɛ ba e fu yi mu ɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u pwumo u nyima mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Ɔzhɔnu a tanu iyi Iso Iyesheshi ɛlɛ mu ɛgwuzɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ laa enzu akwɛyi a za mba tee lo kwu ira ɔsu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ɔzhɔnu ba e tu Ogomina Ɛrɔdu mo, kwuwongu e to Ɛrɔdiya oko uwu umanyiwu, mbala apula iyira iyifo iyi bɔkɔ e wo. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Mu imbwama yi Ɛrɔdu e wo iyi bɔkɔ i ka ɛlɛ ira ma- a ta Ɔzhɔnu mu ugu ugyi.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Wo Ɔzhizɔsi Obatisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Omatiyu 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Omaki 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Kwuye ungwu o mbwa enzu lɛɛbi obatisima iwomo, akwɛyi o wo Ɔzhizɔsi tete. Akwɛyi kwuyengwu Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu Ukpo ilɛma, oshi u wuma gboo, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo a wɔ mu oshi e kwu mawu kyamate ogarikwokwo tayi. Akwɛyi opwu u wɔ mu oshi u zɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu idɛnyi mi. Imi mi mwɔnyɛ mbala ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɛdɔ Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Omatiyu 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e gwu laa ɛduma wu iyi ɛzu izɔma awu, e yi lɔri uwekpela. Mu imama iyi enzu, Ɔzhizɔsi akwu umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔsɛfu, umɛ uwu Ɛli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />umɛ uwu Omatati, umɛ uwu Olevi, umɛ uwu Ɔmɛlishi, umɛ uwu Ozhanayi, umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔsɛfu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />umɛ uwu Omatatiya, umɛ uwu Ɛmɔs, umɛ uwu Onahu, umɛ uwu Esili, umɛ uwu Onagayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />umɛ uwu Omati, umɛ uwu Omatatiya, umɛ uwu Osemeyi, umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔsɛshi, umɛ uwu Ozhoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />umɛ uwu Ozhowana, umɛ uwu Oresa, umɛ uwu Ɔzɛrubabɛ, umɛ uwu Ɔshitɛ, umɛ uwu Oneri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />umɛ uwu Ɔmɛlishi, umɛ uwu Adi, umɛ uwu Okosa, umɛ uwu Elemada, umɛ uwu Eru, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />umɛ uwu Ozhoshuwa, umɛ uwu Eliyeza, umɛ uwu Ozhorimu, umɛ uwu Omatati, umɛ uwu Olevi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />umɛ uwu Ɔsamɔ , umɛ uwu Ozhuda, umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔsɛfu, umɛ uwu Ozhonamu, umɛ uwu Eliyaki, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />umɛ uwu Omeli, umɛ uwu Omenna, umɛ uwu Omattata, umɛ uwu Onata, umɛ uwu Odevidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />umɛ uwu Ozhese, umɛ uwu Ɔbɛdi, umɛ uwu Obowazi, umɛ uwu Ɔsalimɔ, umɛ uwu Ɔnashɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />umɛ uwu Aminadabu, umɛ uwu Adimi, umɛ uwu Arini, umɛ uwu, Ɛzɛrɔ, umɛ uwu Ɔpɛrɛzi, umɛ uwu Ozhuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />umɛ uwu Ɔzhɛkɔbu, umɛ uwu Aziki, umɛ uwu Aburamu, umɛ uwu Otera, umɛ uwu Ɔnahɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />umɛ uwu Oserugwu, umɛ uwu Oriwu, umɛ uwu Ɔpɛlɛgwu, umɛ uwu Eba, umɛ uwu Oshela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />umɛ uwu Okeyina, umɛ uwu Afazada, umɛ uwu Ɔshɛmu, umɛ uwu Onowa, umɛ uwu Ɔlamɛshi, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />umɛ uwu Ɔmɛtusɛla, umɛ uwu Ɛnɔki, umɛ uwu Ɔzharɛdi, umɛ uwu Ɔmalalɛ, umɛ uwu Ɔkɛna, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />umɛ uwu Ɛnɔshi, umɛ uwu Ɔsɛti, umɛ uwu Adɛmu, umɛ uwu Ukpo.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Onzu Uwoyi A Pwa Ɔzhizɔsi Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Omatiyu 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Omaki 1.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gbama mu Ɔzhɔda laa inyɔlɔma mu Kwundu uwu Ukpo, akwɛyi Kwundu e to wu a kawa mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />mbaa bɔkɔ onzu uwoyi a pwa wu ma nzhii ba afyi uwekpendo. Mu afyi uwekpendo ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi e ri kiya kinyinyi mo akwɛyi lonzu lu wo wu mo.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Akwɛyi Onzu uwoyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo ngboro de ba za laa kwoki ngwɔlɛ tee la ku vindɔ kiya ingyirimo nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt; Iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee: &lt;Akwu mu kiya ingyirimo kɛɛkyi gba onzu e yi kwunyɔ le mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Onzu uwoyi a gba e to wu a kawa mu ikperembe akwɛyi mu eyipere, a zɔ wu ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Akwɛyi Onzu uwoyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mii shi ŋɔ ɛsu iyi ɛzhi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mbala woshi yi, moo kpɛkpɛyi i yi mu kwuwo mi, onzu uwu mi gyi gba mi shi wu yi le. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Gba ŋɔ lemo ŋɔ gbo mi ɔya, mii shi ŋɔ yi lɛɛbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu tee: &lt;&lt;Iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee, &lt; Ŋɔ gbo ɔya laa Ɔkwu Ukpo ŋɔ kɛɛkyi, uwu kɛɛkyi gba ba ŋɔ gbo wu rinye le tete!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Akwɛyi Onzu uwoyi e to wu a kawa mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ akwɛyi e shi wu a rima mu ikperembe iyi Ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo ngboro de ba yimo piriri munɛ kaa la mɛzhi nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Moo iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee: &lt;Ukpo aa za la alɔgbulɔ wu tee lo gbo ŋɔ mo ɔnyɛ ɔnyɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Ikyo i zɔ tee, &lt;oo ra ŋa mu ewo mbo kaa kwu la kwɔlɛ mu kwokyi mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee: &lt; Ki pwa Ɔkwu Ukpo ŋɔ ma mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Tabɔkɔ onzu uwoyi a mbwa Ɔzhizɔsi ipwama ma akwɛyi a lu wu afyima e gbo la kwuye kwowa.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Ye Laa Ɛduma Wu Mu Ogalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Omatiyu 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Omaki 1.14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gbama a ka mu Ogalili, ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba i yi mbala wu. Ɛza wu i fulama muna muna mu ɛzhi ɛnyi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />A zɔ ɛzu mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama mba akwɛyi onzu uwunawuna a pwɔ wu ma.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="ms">O Towo Ɔzhizɔsi Mo Mu Ɔnazarɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Omatiyu 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Omaki 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi ka mu Ɔnazarɛti mbaa bɔkɔ o yi wu le, akwɛyi ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mbo, e fye mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama kyamate bɔkɔ e koko e wo awu. Akwɛyi e yimo tee la wa ɛzu iyi Iso iyi Ukpo, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />akwɛyi o shi wu kwokpo ungwu anukenzu Azaya. A wungwuma akwɛyi a ma mbaa bɔkɔ ɔ ka tee,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;&lt;Kwundu uwu Ɔkwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">e yi mami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">kwuwongu a ŋa mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">tee la mi ka laa ayirewa ɛza iyi esheshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">A lɔ mi kaa la mi tanu tee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">o wala enye mo mu rinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">epeyi o gba laa ɛbɛ imama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">umba bɔkɔ o nya mba nyanya ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">oo shi mbo ɛnwu igbomo.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />akwɛyi mi tanu tee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:19">kwuye kwu bo-o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a sa enzu wu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Akwɛyi a gba la kwokpo kwongwu ikwumo, a gba ngwu e shi onzu uwu ɛduma uwu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama akwɛyi a ŋɔma. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama mɔmɔ, a bɔ wu eyi ngoo,<verse eid="LUK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔnɛnɛ iso iyi Ukpo iyi o ka munɛ le i nyɔlɔma leyi yi-e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Enzu lɛɛbi o siso iyesheshi mu reshi wu, izele i yi mbo mo kwuwongu iso iyi esheshi iyi i wɔ mu kenzu wu. Akwɛyi o yo tee, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔsɛfu mo re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ee mi yitu lu ba mi kwoba tee, &lt;U lo epu, bo ɛŋɔ ofya ma nɛ.&gt; Mi yitu lu kyo lu za mi tee apula iyi ki pwa tee ŋɔ wo mu Okapanawu awu, wo yi mu kwuse ŋɔ tete ŋa nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za mba tee, ongbulolo gba mi so yi le te, &lt;&lt;anukenzu uwu o na wu mu kwuse wu e yi mo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />La lu ngbɛ alu kaa lu pwa: Te gba i yi le te, kwuye ungwu Elazha, eko wakpanuma o yi gyɔɔ mu Izirɛ, kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e tumo mo nzhii ba lɔri lola la kwurizhi akwɛyi ɔ ya lonzu undɔkwu mu ɛzhi ɛnyi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Tete ɔ lɔ Elazha mbaa ukpukpɛnyi mba mu Izirɛ mo, mba oko ukpɔnuma uwu Ozarefa mɛzhi iyi Ɔsidɔ kɛɛkyi gba ɔ lɔ wu le. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Tatayi kwuyengwu anukenzu ƐIasha, enzu umba ofya umbu embyimbɔyi mu Izirɛ o yi gyɔɔ tete; tete o bo uwewe mbo ofya ma mo, Onaama uwu Osiriya kɛɛkyi gba o bo wu ofya ma le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Tabɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama awu lɛɛbi o pwa iso ɛlɛ, o wo amba gyɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Akwɛyi o yimo o pyipyi Ɔzhizɔsi o wawu ma mu kwuse kwɔngu, akwɛyi o to wu ɔ kawa mu ikperembe iyi lowa undu bɔkɔ o mbo kwuse mbo ma ndu. Ɔ gyite kaa lɔ bɔ wu ewo la ta mɛzhi, <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />uwu ba a zɛ meka mba a kama iyawu.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onzu Uwufo Uwu E Yi Kwundu Ungwura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Omaki 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mu kwuse ungwu Okapanawu mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili, akwɛyi Ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mbo, e le mu enzu ɛzu izɔma. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu enzu ɛzu izɔma, akwɛyi izele i yi mbo mo kwuwongu e siso laa idomo. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Onzu uwufo uwu e yi kwundu ungwura e yi mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama mɔmɔ; akwɛyi a tara oga kpaa mu opwu uwɔkwu a zɔ tee, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;Kyakwokwo! Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti, ŋɔ gyi mbe mbaa nzu? Ŋɔ bo tee kaa ngbɛ nzu ma re? Mi yi ŋɔ: uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu ɔlɔgbulɔ Ɔkɛrikɛri uwu Ukpo le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a kpa kwundu ungwura kwɔngu ɛyi tee, &lt;&lt;Kpala kenzu mo kaa wɔma mu onzu ele!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi kwundu ungwura kwɔngu kwu yi wu kwu fya wapwu mɛzhi mu eyi mbo lɛɛbi akwɛyi kwu wɔma ma wu, ba kwu nɛ wu kanɛ mo.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Izele i yi enzu mo lɛɛbi akwɛyi o za la esu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ akwu kwuwongu mbe? Mu idomo mbala ekpasu a kpa ɛndu iyira ɛyi tee li wɔma mu ɛnwu iyi onzu ba i wɔma iyayi bi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Akwɛyi ɛza iyi Ɔzhizɔsi i fula ɛzhi ɛnyi ma lɛɛbi.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Enzu Gyɔɔ Efya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Omatiyu 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Omaki 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya laa udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama akwɛyi a ka mogba uwu Ɔsamɔ. E du anyi uwu oko uwu Ɔsamɔ tee e yi okpakyi a nɔ mɛzhi iyi ofya, akwɛyi o siso mbala Ɔzhizɔsi kaa la mbwa wu ma. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ɔzhizɔsi e fyemo akwɛyi a rima kɛlɛ mbaa wu akwɛyi a kpa ofya umbu ɔkpaki mbwɔmbu ɛyi te lu wu afyi ma. Mɔmɔɔmɔ okpakyi a lu wu afyima akwɛyi e yimo e le mbo mu kiya ingyirimo iwomo.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Kwuye ungwu ɔnu u yi mu ibomo-o, akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ɛmɛza umba efya ikikɔ ikikɔ o kamba laa Ɔzhizɔsi; e fulo mbo ewo kɛnyi kɛnyi akwɛyi efya mba lɛɛbi i bomo. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Ɛndu iyira tete i wɔma mu ɛnwu iyi enzu gyɔɔ, laa ikyakwokwo itarama tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo le loo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:41">Ɔzhizɔsi ba a kpa yi ɛyi, a nya yi ma tee li siso mo kwuwongu i yitu tee uwu gba akwu Omezaya le.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ta Anu Mu Idaba Iyi Ɛlukpalama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Omaki 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Mu eyi ilama Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ kwudu a ka ŋɔ kɛɛkyi wu mu riyi ingyifo. Enzu o le wo mu igagyima. Tabɔkɔ o ma wu, o gyite la lu mba afyima mo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Akwɛyi a zamba tee, &lt;&lt;akwu ega tee mi tanu iyi Iso iyesheshi iyi Irɛsu iyoshi iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ mu ese iyifo tete, kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba Ukpo a lɔ mi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Akwɛyi a kpakpɛɛ mu anu itama mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama iyi Azhu mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya lɛɛbi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ya Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu Umba Kwonze Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Omatiyu 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Omaki 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi a rima mu kenzu unga Risu ingyi Ɔgɛnɛsarɛ, akwɛyi uwewe e bo kɛlɛ mbaa wu ka la pwa iso iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Akwɛyi a ma ada iyi embyi iyɛri ekpepo mu kenzu unga embyi; wa yi emu ba o lu yi afyima o yi mu iya mba igbɔma. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwoda ungwu Ɔsamɔ, akwɛyi a za wu tee la gyi le turu la gba mekeka iyi risu bwɛɛ. Akwɛyi a ŋɔma mɛmi iyi kwoda e le mu enzu ɛzu izɔma.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Kwuye ungwu a mbwa enzu ɛzu izɔma, akwɛyi a za la Ɔsamɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Turu kaa gba mu riyi ingyi indomo kaa uŋɔ mbala ɛmɛza ŋa la lu fu iya yi kaa lu yi emu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Ɔsamɔ a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, ki wo ɛduma mu utu nzhii ba eyi i lama ba ki yi kiya kinyinyi mo. Tetete, kwuwongu ŋɔ so tayi awu, mi gba mi fu iya mu embyi bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Tabɔkɔ o fu iya mu embyi, o yi emu guruguru nzhii ba eya mba i le mu itarama. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Akwɛyi o ya ɛmɛza mba ma umba o yi mu kwɔda ungwu opo kwɔngu kaa lo bo lo mbwa mba ma. O bo o mbwa mba ma akwɛyi ɔ nyɔlɔ ada iyi embyi epepo yi ma nzhii ba ada iyi embyi ɛnyi i le mu idingbi.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔsamɔ Opita a ma kiya ingyi ki wo, akwɛyi a la epunu mɛzhi e kwumo mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, yimo munyi mi! Moo mi kwu onzu uwu ingbomo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Moo izele i yi wu mo, uwu mbala mba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu kwuwongu riba ingyi emu bɔkɔ o yi. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Izele i yi Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu ɛmɛ umba Ozebedi ma, umba bɔkɔ akwu ɛmɛza umba Ɔsamɔ mu emu iyimo awu tete. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Ɔsamɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ki wiyi mo; i na mu kwɔfyi ungwu ɔnɛ i sheye keyi, ŋɔ yi enzu ŋa moo akwu emu fo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />O wala ada ɛnyi ma mu embyi, o lafya laa kiya ingyinangyina mba akwɛyi o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Ɔnzɔnu uwufo Ofya ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Omatiyu 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Omaki 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu kwuse ungufo akwɛyi onzu uwufo uwu e yi ofya umbwu embyimbɔyi a ka mɔmɔ tete. Tabɔkɔ a ma Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi e ke kwumo mu idu wu laa ɛshɛku ikpama tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, gba ŋɔ nyama, ŋɔ do tee ŋɔ bo mi ofya mi mbɔlɛ ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a nda kwuwo a pwu wu afyi, akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi nyama.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Yi sɛsɛsɛ!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi mɔmɔɔmɔ ofya mbwɔmbwu u lu wu afyima.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ta wu ɔkpa tee, &lt;&lt; Ki so onzu uwunawuna mo, so kaa zɔ ɛŋɔ ma mbaa obwoshi uwu Ukpo kaa le yese ŋɔ mo; kyo kaa wo isabɔ iyi bɔkɔ Omosisi e so awu kaa enzu lo yitu tee ofya ŋa u bo o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Tetete ɛza iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛlɛ i so wu mu ifulama munamuna, akwɛyi enzu o le mu ibomo kaa lɔ pwa iso wu, ikyo kaa le bo mbo efya mba ma tete. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a walama bɛtɛɛ a ka mu riyi ingyifo kɛɛkyi wu kaa la lɛ Ukpo.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Ukpokapiya Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Omatiyu 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Omaki 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu ɛzu izɔma akwɛyi Afarisi mbala wazɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi umba bɔkɔ ɔ wɔ mu ese iyi Ogalili mbala Ozhudiya mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, o bo ɔ ŋɔma mɔmɔ tete. Ɛkpasu iyi Ɔkwu iyi e bo enzu ofya ma ba i yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Enzu umbafo o shi ukpokapiya mu ɔkyɔ, o gyi tee lo fye wu mogba kaa lo shi wu mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Tabɔkɔ o fya ɔgwuzɛ ma mo kwuwongu riba ingyi enzu, akwɛyi o yama moshi uwu kɛnu akwɛyi o sa kɛnu ma, akwɛyi o kala wu laa ɔkyɔ wu o shi wu pwa mekeka iyi enzu mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma ikwu idu lu fulo mbo akwɛyi a za la ukpokapiya awu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛza mi, ingbomo ŋɔ o gbayi o kpaŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Tabɔkɔ Afarisi mbala Wazɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi ɔ pwa tayi, akwɛyi o le mu esu isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu uwe dɛɛ bɔkɔ a wu ɔya tee! Ukpo kɛɛkyi gba e do tee a gba la ingbomo iyi enzu a kpa le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yitu iyi i yi mu egbo mbo akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi lu bi egbo ɛlɛ tee? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Iyina i kɔ mu iwomo ika: isomo tee, &lt;Ingbomo ŋɔ ɔ gbayi ɔ kpa ŋa&gt; naa isomo tee,&lt;Yimo kaa le mu luzɛ ŋa?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Mi gyi tee la lu yitu tee Umɛ uwu Onzu e yi idomo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ iyi a gba la ingbomo iyi enzu a kpa mba.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a za la ukpokapiya awu tee, &lt;&lt;Yimo, to ɔkyɔ ŋɔ ma kaa so mogba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Mɔmɔɔmɔ e yimo la eyi mbo e to ɔkyɔ wu ma akwɛyi a ka mogba laa Ukpo iduma. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Izele i wo mbo mo gyɔɔ! Iyi i wo mbo mo akwɛyi ɔ du Ukpo ma laa isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Kinzu ki ma apula iyi izele ɔnɛnɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ya Olevi Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Omatiyu 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Omaki 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ kwudu akwɛyi a ma onzu uwufo u na Oba uwɛzhi uwu ɔ ya wu tee Olevi mu riyi ingyi ɛduma wu. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Bo kaa mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Akwɛyi Olevi e yimo a lafya laa kiya ingyinangyina akwɛyi a mbwalu wu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Akwɛyi Olevi e wo odumudumu uwakwuu laa Ɔzhizɔsi mogba wu. Riba ingyɛkwuu ingyi wa na Oba uwɛzhi mbala enzu umbafo ɔ kpala ɛlu mbaa ewiri irimo mbala mba. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Afarisi mbala Wa zɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi umba bɔkɔ o yi kyaa mbala mba mɔmɔ awu ba o le mu anu izɔma akwɛyi o yo Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu ri lu wo mbala enzu wa na Oba uwɛzhi mbala &lt;enzu umba ingbomo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba o yi ɔkpara uwu ɛnwu o yi ugɔ uwu onzu uwepwu mo, enzu umba o yi ɔkpara uwu ɛnwu mo gba o gagyi onzu uwepwu le. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Imi mi bo tee la mi ya enzu watoto ma kaa lo tamɛzhi mo, enzu wa wo ira gba mi bo kwuwo mbo le kaa lɔ kwu ira mba ɔsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Yo Ɔzhizɔsi Kwuyo Mekeka Iyi Kenyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Omatiyu 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Omaki 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Enzu umbafo o za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Wa vɔngɔ kiya umba Ɔzhɔnu o wo kenyo iyi ɔkpɔ mbala Ukpo ilɛma, tatayi gba Wa vɔngɔ kiya umba Afarisi o wo le tete; umba ŋa ba ɔ ma mu apula irimo mbala iwomo bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lu do tee lu wo agboga umba bɔkɔ o bo mu odumudumu uwu oko itomo kaa lo ri kiya kwuyengwu ɔnu uwu okopo e yi mbala mba mo? I yi tayi mo ndiiǃ <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma bɔkɔ o to ɔnu uwu okopo mo munyi mbo, mu afyi ɛnyi gba o wo kenyo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu aa tara kukokpayi mu ɔkpayi uwepo kaa la kpa mu ɔkpayi uwekyi mo. Moo gba e wo tayi, ɔkpayi uwepo awu a tara wu ma shaa, moo kukokpayi ungwepo kwɔngu ba ku masa ma mbala okpayi uwekyi awu mo. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Tatayi onzu ee fu embyi umba inyima umbepo mu ɔgya uwekyi mo, moo gba e wo tayi, embyi umba inyima umbepo mbamba ɔ sa ɔgya awu ma, akwɛyi embyi umba inyima umbepo mbamba o fu mo shaa, ɔgya awu ba e tutumo. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Embyi umba inyima umbepo o fu mbo mu ɔgya uwepo! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Onzu gba e wo embyi umba inyima umbekyi a gba a nyama te le wo umbepo mo, kwuwongu aa zɔ tee, &lt;mbekyi o shoshi ɔ ka umbepo mo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Mekeka Iyi Kwɔfyi Ungwu Ɛnwu Igbomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Omatiyu 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Omaki 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungufo Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu ikakama mu itu iyi ewiri iyifo akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu ɔ mu imuma iyi ewiri, o firi yi mo mu ewo akwɛyi o kwu. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Akwɛyi Afarisi umbafo o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi lu wo kiya ingyi Ɛrama i nyama tee lo wo ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lu du wa yi dɛ mo re, kiya ingyi Odevidi mbala enzu wu o wo kwuyengwu lonzu lu wo mbo mo awu? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />E fye mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo, e to kwoburodi ungwu bɔkɔ Ɛrama nzu i zɔ tee ebwoshi umba Ukpo kɛɛkyi gba o ri le, e ri akwɛyi e shi enzu umba o yi mbala wu o ri tete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ uwu Onzu akwu Ɔkwu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onzu Uwufo Uwu Kwuwo Wu Kwu Kpokapiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Omatiyu 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Omaki 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungufo kpɔ, Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama mbaa ɛzu izɔma. Onzu uwufo uwu kwuwo wu ungwungyi kwu kpo kapiya ba e yi mɔmɔ tete. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Wa zɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi umbafo mbala Afarisi umbafo ba o yi mu kwuyi igagyi ma kaa lo yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ɔ bɔ wu eyi kaa lo ma shii ee bo onzu ele ofya ma Ɔnu uwu Kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yitu iyi egbo mbo lɛɛbi akwɛyi a za la onzu awu tee, &lt;&lt;Yimo kaa bi rima mu keyi te.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi e yimo a rima. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Mii yo yi kwuyo mɛɛ: iyina bɔkɔ Ɛrama nzu i zɔ tee lo wo Ɔnu uwu Kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo? Lo wo iyeshi nana lo wo iyi ira ŋa? Lo sa kwunyɔ ma nana lɔ ngbɛ ngwu ma ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />E yese mbo lɛɛbi; akwɛyi a za la onzu awu tee, &lt;&lt; Nda kwuwo ŋɔ ma shaa.&gt;&gt; E wo tayi akwɛyi kwuwo kwu gba gɛlɛ iya ngwu.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Amba o wo Wa zɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala Afarisi mo gyɔɔ akwɛyi o le mu amasa ikama mbala esu iyi kiya ingyi o wo Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ŋa Wa zɛ ilɔ Wewo La Wepo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Omatiyu 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Omaki 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mu afyi ɛnyi Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ kwudu a ya mu Lɔwa kaa laa lɛ Ukpo akwɛyi e to utu ngyɔɔ mu Ukpo ilɛma. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama, akwɛyi a ya Wavɔngɔkiya wu ma akwɛyi a ŋa wewo la wepo akwɛyi e kpo mbo ɛnyi tee wa zɛ ilɔ. Ɛnyi mba akwu: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Ɔsamɔ (uwu e kpo wu ɛnyi tee Opita awu) mbala Anduru umanyi wu; mbala Ozhemisi, mbala Ɔzhɔnu, mbala Ofilipu, mbala Obatalomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />mbala Omatiyu, mbala Otoma, mbala Ozhemisi umɛ uwu Alufiyɔ, mbala Ɔsamɔ (uwu o ya wu tee Ɔzilɔtu awu), <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />mbala Ozhudasi umɛ uwu Ozhemisi, mbala Ozhudasi Isikariyɔ uwu bɔkɔ a ba kwu u to Ɔzhizɔsi a yama awu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛzu A Gba E Bo Enzu Efya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Omatiyu 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi a kalama e bo mɛzhi mbala wa zɛ ilɔ wu, akwɛyi a ri mu kizɛ ri dandanda mbala riba ingyɛkwu ingyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu. Riba ingyɛkwu ingyi enzu umba ɔ wɔ mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbala ese iyi Otaya mbala Ɔsidɔ iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kenzu unga risu awu i yi mɔmɔ tete; <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />o bo te kaa lo pwa iso wu, kaa le kyo le bo mbo efya mba ma tete. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ɛndu iyira, o wa yi mba ma tete. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Uwewe a gyi te la pwu Ɔzhizɔsi afyi kwuwongu ekpasu i yi mu iwɔma mu ɛnwu wu akwɛyi i bo enzu efya mba ma lɛɛbi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔnyɛ Mbala Ubwugyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Omatiyu 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yese Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi a zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Ɔnyɛ akwu uwayi lunyi ayirewa; moo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Irɛsu iyi Ukpo akwu iyayi!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwayi lunyi umba lu yi lonzu kekelele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">moo ubwu e do yi mo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Ɔnyɛ akwu uwayi lunyi umba lu yi mu oga ilomo kekelele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">moo lu nyɔngɔma memowu!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwayi kwuyengwu enzu o wo anya yi, o towo yi mo, o kpayi ari, akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee lunyi lu kwu enzu umbira kwuwongu Umɛ uwu Onzu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Kwuye ungwu o wo yi tayi la lu mwɔnyɛ, la lu komo moo o sheyi rigbɛ ingyɛkwuu moshi. Moo tatayi gba asɔkwu mba o wo anukenzu umba Ukpo le tete.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛkuu i rigbo yi lunyi umba lu yi kwuwo kekelele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">moo ɔnyɛ uwayi lu mu wu-a!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi lunyi umba lu yi ubwu duduu kekelele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">moo lu kpo lonzu memowu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi lunyi umba lu nyɔngɔma kekelele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">moo lu wo ubugyi lu lo oga memowu!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi lunyi umba bɔkɔ enzu ɔ pwɔ yi ma; moo tatayi gba asɔkwu mba o koko ɔ pwɔ anukenzu umba angba ma le tete.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idɛnyi Iyi Agewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Omatiyu 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7.12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />&lt;&lt;Mi so yi lunyi umba lu ye mi mu ipwama: La lu pwu idɛnyi iyi agewa yi, enzu umba bɔkɔ ɔ gyi yi mo ba la lu wo mbo iyeshi, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />umba bɔkɔ o ta yi kenzu unga ira, la lu ta mba kenzu unga eshi, umba bɔkɔ o wo yi ira, la lu lɛ mba Ukpo uwu eshi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Gba onzu a kpa ŋa afyi mu kwɔngba kwunyi, shi wu ungufo tete; gba onzu a na ŋa ɔriga uwakwu ma, ki nyi wu ɔmu ma mo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a nda ŋa kiya ki nyi wu ma mo, tatayi, gba onzu e to ŋɔ kiya ma, ki gba ki yo wu kwuyo ngyi fo. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Kyamate uŋɔ ŋɔ gyi tee lo wo ŋɔ awu, gba uŋɔ wo enzu le tete.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Gba lu pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu umba o pwu idɛnyi yi kɛɛkyi, ba rigbɛ yi akwu ingyi na? Enzu umba ingbomo lala o pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu umba o pwu idɛnyi mba le tete! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Gba lu wo iyeshi la umba o wo yi iyeshi kɛɛkyi, ba rigbɛ yi akwu kwuwongumbe? Enzu umba ingbomo lala o wo ɛlɛ tete! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Gba lu lo enzu kwɔkpa umba lu fulo eyi tee o wayi ngwu ma kɛɛkyi, ba rigbɛ yi akwu kwuwongumbe? Enzu umba ingbomo lala o lo enzu umba ingbomo kwɔkpa tete la eyi ifulomo tee ɔ wangu mba ma lɛɛbi! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Lunyi, la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi agewa yi, la lu wo mbo iyeshi; la lu lo mbo kwɔkpa la lu fulo eyi te o wa yi ngwu ma mo. Ɛlɛ ii shi yi rigbɛ ingyɛkwu, akwɛyi luu kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo edego ala. Moo uwu akwu u wo iyeshi la enzu umba o yi ingbede mo mbala enzu umbira. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />La lu kwu enzu wa ma inyashi iyi enzu kyamate Ete yi tayi.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">La lu Zɔ Enzu Ombwu Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Omatiyu 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />&lt;&lt;La lu zɔ enzu ombu mo, Ukpo ba a zɔ yi ombu mo; la lu tutu onzu mo mo, Ukpo ba e tutu yi mo mo; la lu gba yi lu kpa enzu, Ukpo ba a gba yi a kpa yi tete. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />La lu shi enzu kiya, akwɛyi Ukpo ba e shi yi tete. Mu omudu uweshi, uwu o kpa wu ewo sha sha, o wo wu akpa, a nyɔlɔma nzhii ba a za la ifumo gba o mondo ŋɔ le. Omudu uwu ŋɔ mondo laa enzu ma wu, ma wu gba Ukpo e mondo ŋɔ le tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu upeyi e do tee e yi upi laa upeyi tete mo; moo gba e wo tayi, wepepo mbo o fumo mu kwuvɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Umɛ uwu omakarata a ka omale wu ma mo; tetete umɛ uwu omakarata uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a mbwa ivɔngɔma ma, e yi kyamate omale wu tete.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />&lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ŋɔ yese kwɔsɛ mu kwuyi ungwu umɛnɛ ŋɔ, ba ŋɔ ma kwutu ungwu kwuwɛyi ungwu kwu yi mu kwuyi ŋɔ mo? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ŋɔ wo la ŋɔ za la umɛnɛ ŋɔ tee, &lt;Umɛnɛ mi, bo ka la mi waŋa la kwɔsɛ ma mu kwuyi,&gt; munɛ ba ŋɔ fa la kwutu ungwu kwuwɛyi mu kwuyi ŋɔ imama? Uŋɔ umwangba ele! Wa la kwutu ungwu kwuwɛyi ungwu kwu yi mu kwuyi ŋɔ ma dɛ, akwɛyi ŋɔ ma kwɔsɛ mu kwuyi ungwu umɛnɛ ŋɔ gede gede.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwɛyi Mbala Imwuma Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Omatiyu 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Uwɛyi uweshi u wa la imwuma iyira mo, uwɛyi uwura ba u wa la imwuma iyeshi mo. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Ɔ zɔngɔma uwɛyi uwunawuna ma mu imwuma wu. Ɔ bɛ imwuma iyi uwɛyi iyi ofigi mu uwɛyi uwu owula mo, nana ɔɔ bɛ eremi mu uwɛyi uwu ikpɛ ŋa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Onzu uweshi a wa la apula iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu akɔ wu le, onzu uwura tete a wa la apula iyira iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu akɔ wu le tete. Kiya ingyi ki yi mu akɔ le gba kenzu kaa wa ngyi le.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzu Wepo Wa Mbo Igwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Omatiyu 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />&lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi lu ya mi tee, &lt;Ɔkwu, Ɔkwu,&gt; munɛ ba lu wo kiya ingyi mi za yi tee la lu wo mo? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu e bo mbaa mi, akwɛyi a pwa iso mi ba e wo ɛduma ma yi - mi zɔ yi kiya ingyi onzu awu o masa wu mbala ngyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />E yi mate, onzu uwu a gyi te le mbo kwogba wu, akwɛyi a vu kwuvɔ fororo akwɛyi e fulo ɔla uwu kwogba mu ɔzɔ tayi. Kwuye ungwu ɔkwu u lomo u sama akwɛyi embyi o ngbɛgbu mu kwogba kwɔngu, kiya kinyinyi ki wo ngwu mo kwuwongu o mbo ngwu ɔnyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ishi onzu uwu a pwa iso mi ba e wo ɛduma ma yi mo, e yi mate onzu uwu e mbo kwogba wu mu ɛzhi shara ba a la ɔla uwu kwogba dɛ mo tayi; kwuyengwu kwokpo ungwu embyi kwu bo kwu fya mangwu, kwogba kwɔngu kwu shirimo kwu fu mu ɛzhi putuu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Umɛgba Uwu Onzu Uwakɔ Uwu Asozha Umba Oroma Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Omatiyu 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi isomo laa enzu, akwɛyi a ka mu Okapanawu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Onzu uwakɔ uwu asozha umba Oroma e yi mɔmɔ uwu bɔkɔ umɛgba wu uwu idɛnyi wu a mwɔnyɛ mo ba a nda la lukwu fo. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Tabɔkɔ onzu uwakɔ uwu asozha ele a pwa ɛza iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi a lɔ enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu umbafo tee lo so munyi wu, kaa lo kpa wu ɛshɛku kaa le bo le bo ofya umbwu umɛgba wu ma. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />O bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi o kpa wu ɛshɛku gyɔɔ o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele e domo tee lo mbwa wu ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />E pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu nzu akwɛyi e mbo nzu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a kama mbala mba. Tabɔkɔ a nda laa kwogba fo akwɛyi onzu uwakɔ uwu asozha awu a lɔ ɛmɛza wu kaa lo za laa Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, ki lo ɛŋɔ inyashi shaa mo moo mi domo tee kaa fye mogba mi mo, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />imi ba mi domo tee la mi bo munyi ŋɔ mafyi mi mo. Siso byi, akwɛyi ofya umbwu umɛgba mi u bomo. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Imi tete mi yi watekeyi mu kadu mi, asozha umbafo ba o yi mu izhikembo mi tete. Gba mi za laa ele tee, &lt;Sheyimo!&gt; ba e sheyimo; nana gba mi za laa awu tee, &lt;Bo!&gt; ba a nyɔ; mi za laa unye mi tee, &lt;Wo ngyɛlɛ!&gt; ba e wo ngyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa ɛlɛ, i shi wu kenzu iyama; tabɔkɔ e geleyi a ma riba ingyi enzu umba o mbwalu wu, akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La mi so yi, mu Izirɛ lala mi di fya ikwu idu fulo ɛlɛ tee dɛ mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o lɔ mba ma awu, o gbama o ka mogba uwu onzu uwakɔ uwu asozha awu akwɛyi o du unye awu tee ofya wu u bo-o.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Yi Umɛ Uwu Oko U kpo ɔnu Ma Ma Mu Lukwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Kwuye bwɛ mu izhikembo iyi ɛnyi, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mu kwuse kwunyi ungwu bɔkɔ o ya ngwu tee Oneni awu, akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu mbala enzu riba o kama mbala wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Tabɔkɔ a nda la kenzugu unga ɔbɛ unga kwuse fo, kyaa ba o yi mu ukpɛzhi uwu onzu i wɔ kwudu, akwu umɛ ɛnyi uwu anyi wu, ba akwu oko u kpo ɔnu ma. Riba ingyi enzu ingyɛkwu ba o wɔ mu kwuse o mbwalu wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a ma oko awu, a ma eyembembyi wu akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki lo oga mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Akwɛyi a ka pwu afyi mu amukwu, akwɛyi enzu umba o shi ukpɛzhi awu o rima. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Umaǃ Mi za ŋa te yimo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Akwɛyi ukpɛzhi uwu onzu ele e yimo a ŋɔma akwɛyi e le mu isisomo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu e shi anyi wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Iyi i wo mbo lɛɛbi akwɛyi ɔ du Ukpo ma. Ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Anukenzu uwakwu a wɔ mekeka nzu!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ukpo e bo kaa la sa enzu wu ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Ɛza iyi kiya ngyɛlɛ ingyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo le i fulama munamuna mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya mbala ese iyi i fula yi ma lɛɛbi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alɔgbulɔ Umba Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Omatiyu 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhɔnu o so wu kiya ingyi ki wo lɛɛbi, akwɛyi a ya wepo mbo mo, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />akwɛyi a lɔ mba ma mbaa Ɔkwu kaa lo yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu Ɔzhɔnu a zɔ tee a nyɔ lee, naa la ki fulo eyi iyi onzu awa ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Kwuye ungwu enzu mbɔlɛ o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhɔnu u wo Obatisima a lɔ nzu ma munyi ŋɔ kaa la ki yo ŋɔ tee, uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ ki yi mu eyifulomo tee a nyɔ le nana la ki fulo eyi mu onzu awa ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu pwa gba ba Ɔzhizɔsi e bo enzu riba efya ma le, ofya umbu okpakyi mbala ɛndu iyira, akwɛyi a gba e shi wapeyi riba ɛbɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Akwɛyi a gba a lɔ alɔgbulɔ mbamba ma tee, &lt;&lt;La lu so kaa lu so Ɔzhɔnu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu ma mbala ingyi lu pwa: Wapeyi o fya ɛbɛ ma, wa mu alɛ ma o gba la luzɛ, enzu umba o yi ofya umbu embyimbɔyi u bomo, wa salu o pwama, enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo, o gba laa iyimo, ilɔ iyesheshi ɛlɛ ba o ye yi mu anu itama laa. ayirewa. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi egbo epo mami mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Mizhikembo iyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ɔzhɔnu o fulomo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu iso iyi Ɔzhɔnu isomo laa riba ingyi enzu ngyɛngyi tee: &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu lu ka mbaa Ɔzhɔnu mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara awu, kimbe bɔkɔ lu gyi tee la lu ma? Anga iyi ɔsɛ iyi bɔkɔ kwokpo kwu ye yi mu akpa iwomo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Akwu kimbe bɔkɔ lu wɔ kwudu kaa la lu ma? Lu ka tee ka la lu ma onzu uwu bɔkɔ e lo ekpayi iyi abwa? Aayimo! Enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo ekpayi iyi abwa mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o ri ugyɔ, akwu mu agba iyi asu gba o yi le! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />La lu so mi, kimbe bɔkɔ lu wɔ kwudu kaa la lu ma? Anukenzu re? Ee, mi za yi tee onzu uwu lu ma awu, a ka anukenzu ma.<verse eid="LUK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Moo Ɔzhɔnu gba kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo kwu siso mawu tee: &lt;Ukpo a zɔ tee, mi lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ mi ma e to keyi la ŋa kaa la wu ŋɔ ɔgwuzɛ ma.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi gyite laa mi so yi tee enzu umba bɔkɔ ekokpayi ɔ mba lɛɛbi, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka Ɔzhɔnu ma e yi mo. Tetete onzu umbwambwa mu irɛsu iyi Ukpo lala a ka Ɔzhɔnu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Enzu lɛɛbi ikyo wa na oba uwɛzhi, o pwa wu; akwɛyi o zɔngɔma te ɔgwuze uwu Ukpo akwu ongbulolo, kwuwongu Ɔzhɔnu gba e wo mbo obatisima le <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Afarisi mbala wa zɔ Ɛrɛma ba o towo iso iyi Ukpo mo akwɛyi ɔ nyama te Ɔzhɔnu le wo mbo obatisima mo.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Ɔzhizɔsi e so wu mu isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba kwushi kwɔlɛ mi manda ba mbala kimbe? O yi mate kimbe te? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />O yi mate ɛmɛshɛri umba o ŋɔma mu rishi akwɛyi o ya esu mo tee: &lt;Ki so yi amwu iyi okopo itomo, ba lu komo mo! Ki so yi amwu iyi lukwu, ba lu lo oga mo!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ɔzhɔnu u wo obitisima e bo, e ri kiya mo ba e wo embyi umba imwuma iyi uwɛyi uwu oboriyo mo, akwɛyi lu zɔ tee, &lt;E yi kwundu ungwura!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Umɛ uwu Onzu e bo, e ri e wo akwɛyi lu zɔ tee, &lt;Lo yese onzu ele! Akwu u ri kwuri ungwu ubwu mbala u wo atɛ, umɛza uwu wa na oba uwɛzhi mbala enzu umba ingbomo!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Tetete, enzu umba ɔ nyama laa ilukwu iyi Ukpo ba ɔ zɔ yi tee akwu ongbulolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E fye Mogba Uwu Ɔsayimɔ Ofarisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Ɔnu uwufo Ofarisi ukpɛnyi a lɔ laa Ɔzhizɔsi kaa le bo le ri kiya ingyi onoyo mbala wu, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a kama mogba uwu Ofarisi ele a ka ŋɔma kaa le ri kiya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Okokpayi ɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi meka iyi ingbomo e yi mu kwuse kwɔngu. Tabɔkɔ a pwa tee Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu kiya irimo mu mogba uwu Ofarisi ele, akwɛyi e bo laa ɔgya uwu anyi umba umbwɔ ferere <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />akwɛyi a rima mbaa alɛ iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mizhikembo wu, laa oga ilomo, e fu ɛnyɛ mu alɛ wu akwɛyi a wuyi ma mu inyi wu, a kpa yi idu akwɛyi a la yi anyi umba umbwɔ ferere mbamba.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Tabɔkɔ Ofarisi ele a ma tayi, akwɛyi e le mu isomo mu egbo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba Onzu ele lakwu anukenzu uwu ngboro, ba le be yitu iyi okokpayi uwu e yewu mu afyi ipwu ma le; tee okokpayi ele akwu onzu uwu ingbomo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔsayimɔ, mi yi iso iyi mi gyi tee la mi so ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:40">Akwɛyi Ɔsayimɔ a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Omale, so mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ta wu kwoso tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu wepo o ra laa akpa iyi onzu u lo akpa ɛnyi.&gt;&gt; Ukpɛnyi a ra laa kwɔkpa ungwu ederi ɛlɔ iyi esiliva, uwufo ba uwo ɛkpɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Wepepo mbo o yi eduwo iyi o wa akpa ɛlɛ ma mo, akwɛyi onzu ele a lu yi mba afyima wepepo mbo. Mu imama yi, uwuna meka mba bɔkɔ a gyi onzu u lo akpa le a ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Ɔsayimɔ a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi ma tee onzu uwu kwokpa wu kwu ka le awu.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ so kyaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e shi eyi mbaa oko ele akwɛyi a za la Ɔsayimɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ ma oko ele? Mi bo mogba ŋa, ba ŋɔ shi mi embyi kaa mi gbɔ alɛ mi ma mo, uwu ba a gbɔ alɛ mi ma mu ɛnyɛ wu akwɛyi a wu yi ma mu inyi wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ŋɔ kpami idu kaa bwa mi ma ɔnyɛnyɛ mo, oko ele ba ta mi fye mogba ŋa le gba e yi mu alɛ mi iwuma le. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ŋɔ shi mi anyi kaa mi ngbɛ mu reshi mi mo, oko ele le ba a ngbɛ mi anyi umba umbwɔ ferere malɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la mi so yi tee, ingbomo wu iyi riba ɛlɛ o gba yi o kpa wu oo, kwuwongu a zɔ idɛnyi gyɔɔ. Moo onzu uwu o gbayi o kpa wu bwɛɛ a zɔ idɛnyi bwɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa oko awu tee, &lt;&lt;O gba laa ingbomo ŋɔ o kpa ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Akwɛyi agboga umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kiya irimo mbala wu mɔmɔ o le mu isisomo mbala esu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu uwe dɛ, bɔkɔ a gba laa ingbomo a kpa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za laa oko awu tee, &lt;&lt;Ikwidufulo ŋɔ i sa ŋa ma-a; somo moloto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="ms">Eko Umba Bɔkɔ O Fye Ɔzhizɔsi Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo laa wepo mbamba o gɔma mu ese iyɛku mbala iyɛri, mu anu itama iyi Ilɔ Iyesheshi iyi Irɛsu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />eko umbafo tete umba bɔkɔ a wa mba laa ɛndu iyira ma a gba e bo mbo efya ma o mbwalu wu: Omeri (uwu o ya wu tee Omagadali), uwu bɔkɔ eyo umbeyi werewo o wɔma ma wu awu; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Ozhuwana, oko uwu Okuza uwu bɔkɔ akwu u bɔ eyi mu apula iyi Ɛrɔdu; Osuzana; mbala eko umbafo guruguru umba bɔkɔ o ra laa kiya ingyi ewo mbo o mbwama laa Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kwɔba Ungwu Onzu U somo Mu Utu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Omatiyu 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Omaki 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Kwuye ungwu enzu riba o wɔ mu ese ese o bo o kpala ɛlu mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi a ba mba kwoba tee: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Ɔnu uwufo onzu uwufo a ka mbaa isomo mu utu. Tabɔkɔ e le mu eyi iyi ewiri itomo, akwɛyi iyifo i fu mu ɔgwuzɛ, akwɛyi o kpa yi ata akwɛyi afyi ba o koyimo. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Iyifo i fu mu ɔzɔ, kwuyengwu i wɔma, akwɛyi i shirima kwuwongu oloto u yi mo. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Eyi iyifo i fu mɛmi iyi awula, i bulɔma mbala awula ɛlɛ kya akwɛyi awula i riyimo. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Eyi iyifo ba i fu mɛzhi iyesheshi; i bulɔma akwɛyi kwɔmbu ugwunangwuna kwu wa la eyi uwo ekpuwo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso ɛlɛ i somo akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi alu iyi ipwama ba la pwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iluma Iyi Aba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Omatiyu 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Omaki 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Akwɛyi Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o yo kwuyo ungwu iluma iyi kwoba kwɔlɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;O nyayima ka la lu yitu iyi kwunvyeru ungwu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo, umbafo ba mi so mbo mu aba, kaa gba o yese mo lala o ma mo, ɔ ngbɛɛ alu lala ɔ zɔngɔma mo.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lu Kwoba Ungwu Onzu U Somo Mu Utu Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Omatiyu 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Omaki 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />&lt;&lt;Iluma iyi kwoba kwɔlɛ gba i ŋɔ le: Eyi iyi ewiri akwu iso iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Eyi iyi ewiri iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu ɔgwuzɛ awu akwu enzu umba o pwa iso iyi Ukpo; akwɛyi onzu uwoyi a wa laa iso ɛnyi ma mu egbo mbo kaa lo kwu idu lu fulo kaa lo fya isama ma mo. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu ɔzɔ awu akwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o na iso ɛnyi ma la ɔnyɛ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o pwa yi. Ɔbulɛ ɔ bɔ akpa mo; o kwu idu lu fulo iyi kwuye bwɛɛ akwɛyi kwuyengwu ipwama i du mbo, akwɛyi o gba kembo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu awula akwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa; ɔbulɛ idu gidigidi mbala ekweyi iyi apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mbala ugyɔ i nya mba ma kaa lɔ bulɔma kaa lɔ wa laa imuma iyeshi mo. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ishi eyi iyi i fu mu ɛzhi iyesheshi akwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso ɛnyi akwɛyi o ra yi kpakiri mu egbo mbo, o yi idu nzhii ba o wa laa imuma iyesheshi.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kambu Unga Ɔyi Mu Ɛmi Iyi Kwɔbulɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Omaki 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a byi kambu ɔyi akwɛyi e kpo ngo kiya nana e shi ngo mu ubu uwu kwukodo e yi mo. E fulo ngo mu kana unga ɔyi kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o fye mogba lo ma ɛbɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ki nvyemo oo ta ngyi kwudu ndunduu, tatayi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o nvye ngyi mo oo wa ngyi kwudu gedegede.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu ngbɛndu mu iso iyi lu pwa; moo onzu uwu e yi kiya o kyo wu ngyi mo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi kiya kinyinyi mo ba ingyi bɔkɔ a ma tee e yi ngyi awu lala oo na wu ngyi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyi wu Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Ɛmanyi wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Omatiyu 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Omaki 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Akwɛyi anyi wu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala ɛmanyi wu o ka tee kaa lo ma wu, ba o turu o gba wu kego mo kwuwongu riba ingyi enzu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Akwɛyi onzu uwufo o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ ŋɔ mbala ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ o rima mu kwudu o gyi tee lo ma ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba lɛɛbi opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ mi mbala ɛmɛnɛ mi gba akwu umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso iyi Ukpo akwɛyi o mbwalu yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Kpaa Kwokpo Ɛyi Akwɛyi Kwu Gbo ndii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Omatiyu 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Omaki 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La ki sama ki so mu ɛsɛ ɛnyi iyi risu.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o fye mu kwoda o fulomo. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Tabɔkɔ o sheyimo akwɛyi ondo u to Ɔzhizɔsi mo. Kporo ba ombirikizhi e yimo mu risu, akwɛyi kwoda kwu le mu inyɔlɔma laa embyi, akwɛyi o ndomo zhigaa.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o ka o nyi wu eyi mo, o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, Adakwogba! Ki ŋi kpɛdɔ-ɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo a kpa kwokpo kwɔngu mbala agba iyi embyi ɛnyi ɛyi; kwokpo kwu gbomo akwɛyi kizɛ ki gbo ndii. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ikwidufulo yi i yi muna?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Iyi mbala izele i wo mbo mo, akwɛyi o yo esu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu uwe? A kpa kwokpo mbala agba iyi embyi ɛyi ba i lowu mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi a ralaa Ɛndu Iyira Ma Mu Ɛnwu Iyi Onzu Uwufo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Omatiyu 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Omaki 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu ɔ zɛ mu embyi o ka mu ɛzhi iyi Ogerasa, iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu ɛsɛnyi iyi risu ingyi Ogalili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔma mu kwoda, akwɛyi onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ e yi eyo iyeyi a wɔ mu kwuse e kpolo wu. I to kwuye e bɔkɔ onzu ele e lo ekpayi mɛnwu mo ba a ŋɔ mogba mo, mu agariwu gba a ŋɔ le. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Tabɔkɔ a ma Ɔzhizɔsi, a tara ikyakwokwo akwɛyi a ta mɛzhi mu idu wu, a wanu mu opwu uwɔkwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba ŋɔ ngyi mbala mi, Ɔzhizɔsi, Umɛ uwu Ukpo edego-ala? Mi kpa ŋa ɛshɛku tee ki lo mi inyashi mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />E siso ɛlɛ kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi a kpa kwundu ungwu ira ɛyi kaa la ku wɔma ku shi ɛnwu iyi onzu le-e. Ku koko ku yi wu wɔwɔ, ba o lo wu ɛyɛ mewo mbala alɛ, o gbo wu mo, tetete a zɛ ɛyɛ ɛnyi ma akwɛyi kwundu kwu rawuma kwu kawa mu ɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;O ya ŋa tee?&gt;&gt; A gba wu opwu tee &lt;&lt;O ya mi tee &lt;riba,&gt;&gt;&gt; kwuwongu eyombeyi riba i yi mawu. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Eyombeyi ɛnyi i kpa Ɔzhizɔsi ɛshɛku kaa le fu mbo mu kwuvɔ ungwu indomo ngwu kwu yi ibɔma mo.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Uzhi riba uwu erusu ba o yi mu irimo kɛlɛ mbala mba mu odudu mɔmɔ. Akwɛyi ɛndu iyira ɛnyi i nda Ɔzhizɔsi kwoya tee le shi mbo kaa lo fye mu uzhi uwu erusu ɔwu, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a nya mba ma tee lo fye. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />I wɔ kwudu mu onzu awu akwɛyi i fye mu uzhi uwu erusu ɔwu. Uzhi uwu erusu ɔwu ndii u kpɛdɔma tabakɔ erusu mbamba o solomo o fu mu risu akwɛyi embyi o ka mba ma.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Enzu wa pya erusu mbamba o ma kiya ingyi ki wo, akwɛyi o rɛnya o fu oga mu kwuse kwɔngu mbala itu. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Enzu o wɔ kwudu kaa lo ma kiya ingyi ki wo, akwɛyi tabɔkɔ o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, o du onzu uwu bɔkɔ eyombeyi i wɔma ma wu awu, a ŋɔma mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, laa ekpayi mɛnwu, egbo wu i gbama mogba-a; akwɛyi iyi i wombo mo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o ma iyi bɔkɔ i wo le, o ba enzu ɛza iyi onzu uwu e yi eyombeyi awu o wawu yi ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Akwɛyi enzu umba ɛzhi ɛnyi lɛɛbi o za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee la pyama ka shi mbo, kwuwongu iyi iyɛku i wo mbo mo. Akwɛyi e fye mu kwoda a kama.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ eyombeyi i wɔma i shi wu awu a kpa Ɔzhizɔsi ɛshɛku a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi rimo mbala ŋa.&gt;&gt; Ɔzhizɔsi ba a nya wu ma mo, a lu wu a gbama akwɛyi a za wu tee, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;Gba ka sheyimo mogba kaa ba ɛza laa enzu kiya ingyɛkwu ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo ŋɔ le.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi onzu ele a kama a ka e so mu kwuse ndii kiya ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo wu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umɛ Okokpayi Uwu Ozhayirusu Mbala Okokpayi Uwu A Pwafyi Mu Ɔriga Uwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Omatiyu 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Omaki 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a gbama a ka mu ɛsɛnyi iyi risu, enzu o bwa wu ma, kwuwongu lɛɛbi mba uwu gba o rigbo wu le. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Akwɛyi onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu tee Ɔzhariyɔ, utokeyi mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu e bo e kwumo mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi a kpawu ɛshɛku tee le so mogba wu, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwuwongu umɛ wu okokpayi ukpɛnyi kɛɛkyi uwu e yi wu, uwu lɔri luwo la lopo, a ŋe kpo wu mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e sheyimo, enzu riba o mbwalu wu ba o kpawa fyifyi munamuna. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Oko uwufo ba e yi mɔmɔ uwu bɔkɔ e yi ofya umbu ɛzhi ifumo umbwu lɔri luwo la lopo; a ngbɛ kiya ingyi kwuwo wu mo lɛɛbi mbaa walepu igagyima ba a fya onzu uwu bɔkɔ e do te e bo wu ofya mbwɔmbwu ma mo.<verse eid="LUK 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />A zɛ mekeka iyi riba ingyi enzu akwɛyi a ka mu izhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, a pwu wu afyi mu ɛtu iyi ɔriga wu, akwɛyi mu kwotota kwɔngu ɛnzhi wu ɔ zɛma.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe bɔkɔ a pwumi afyi?&gt;&gt; Onzu uwunawuna a zɔma, akwɛyi Opita a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, enzu o yi riba ba o ye ŋɔ mu ikpama fyifyi le kɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo a pwumi afyi, moo mi pwa kwuyengwu ekpasu i wɔma mu ɛnwu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Tabɔkɔ oko ele a ma tee o dawuma-a, akwɛyi a wɔ kwudu laa ipwulama e ke kpombaa mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. Mu eyi iyi enzu mbamba lɛɛbi, e so kiya ingyi ki shi bɔkɔ uwu a pwu wu afyi mbala ewo iyi bɔkɔ ofya wu u bomo mu kwotota. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ mi, ikwu idu lu fulo ŋɔ i bo ŋɔ ofya ma-a. Somo moloto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ɔzhizɔsi a rala opwu uwu iso mbala oko awu bɛnɛ, akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ a wɔ mu kwogba ungwu Ozhariyusu akwɛyi a za laa Ozhariyusu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ ŋɔ e kpomoo; ki loo Omale inyashi shaa mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa ɛlɛ a za laa Ozhariyusu tee, ki riyi mo uŋɔ kwu idu fulo bi akwɛyi a gba lakwunyɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ e bo mu kwogba ungwu Ozhariyusu e shi uwewe tee le fyemo mbala wu mo, Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu mbala Ozhemisi mbala ada uwu umɛ mbala ɛnɛ uwu umɛ kɛɛkyi gba a nya mba ma tee lo fyemo le. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Enzu umba o yi mɔmɔ lɛɛbi o le mu oga ilomo mbala obobyi iwomo kwuwongu umɛ awu. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu lafya la oga ilomo; umɛ ele e kpomo mo-ondo gba e yi mu ikpolomo le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Enzu mbamba lɛɛbi ba ɔ nyɔngɔ wu ma, moo o yitu tee umɛ awu e kpomoo. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi wu mu kwuwo akwɛyi a ya wu ma mu opwu uwɔkwuu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ mi, yimo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ɛndu wu igbama akwɛyi e yimo kɛlɛlɛ. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee lo shiwu kiya ingyirimo kaa le ri. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Izele i yi anyi wu mbala ete wu mo, Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za mba tee lo so onzu ɛnyɛnyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki wo le mo.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lɔ Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu Wewo La Wepo Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Omatiyu 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Omaki 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi a ya Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo la wepo ma, a kpala mba ɛlu akwɛyi e shi mbo ekpasu mbala idomo kaa lo ralaa eyo iyira ma, kaa lo bo efya ma. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Akwɛyi a lɔ mba ma tee lo so lo tanu iyi Irɛsu iyi Ukpo, lo bo enzu efya ma. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />A za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu za laa kiya kinyinyi mu luzɛ yi ndɔlɛ mo: la lu za laa upi mo, la lu za laa kwolamba mo, la lu za laa kiya ingyirimo mo, la lu za laa eduwo mo, ba la lu za laa origa uwufo mo. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Kwogba ungwunanguna bɔkɔ lu fye ba o nayi ewo epepo, la lu ŋɔ mɔmɔ nzhii ba kwɔfyi ungwu lu bu fulomo mu kwuse kwɔngu; <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />munamuna bɔkɔ enzu o na yi ewo epepo mo, la lu bulɔ kwumburu ungwu alɛ yi ma kwuyengwu lu lafya la kwuse kwɔngu, kaa lakwu izɔgɔ tee o na yi mo kwuyengwu lu bo munyi mbo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu mbamba o lu wu afyima o ka mu ese-ese, o tanu iyi Ilɔ iyi esheshi iyi Ukpo, o gba o bo enzu efya ma muna muna.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubwu Uwu Ɛrɔdu E Fomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Omatiyu 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Omaki 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Tabɔkɔ Ɛrɔdu Ɔsu uwakɔ uwu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili a pwa iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu iwomo lɛɛbi, akwɛyi a ta aka gyɔɔ kwuwongu bɔkɔ enzu umbafo o zɔ tee Ɔzhɔnu uwo obatisima o gbawu laa iyimo mu kwuvɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Umbafo ba o zɔ tee Elazha a gba a wɔ kwudu, umbafo kpɔ o zɔ tee anukenzu uwufo uwekyi gba a gba laa iyimo le. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Akwɛyi Ɛrɔdu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhɔnu mi shi o kpolowu kwoshi mo-o; onzu ele akwu uwe bɔkɔ mi pwa apula ɛlɛ mekeka wu le?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi e le mu iwomo nzhii tee la ma Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fye Enzu Edubu Ɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Omatiyu 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Omaki 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ɔzhɔnu 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Wa zɛ ilɔ mbamba o gbama akwɛyi o so Ɔzhizɔsi iyi bɔkɔ umba o wo lɛɛbi. Akwɛyi a kwu mba ma o ka mu kwuse ungwu o ya ngwu tee Ɔbɛsayida, <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Tabɔkɔ enzu o pwa yi akwɛyi o mbwalu wu mɔmɔ. A na mba ma akwɛyi e so mbo iso iyi Irɛsu iyi Ukpo, akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o mwɔnyɛ mo e bo mbo efya ma.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Kwuye ungwu ɔnu u selemo, wa zɛ ilɔ wewo la wepo mbamba o bo mba Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Shi enzu mbɔlɛ kaa lo so mu ese iyɛri mbala alagba ɛlɛ kaa lo gagyi kiya ingyirimo mbala riyi ingyi inɔma moo munɛ ki ga fɔrɔ ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi la lu shi mbo kiya kaa lo ri.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki yi eburedi ɛlɔ mbala emu wepo bi, ishi ba ŋɔ ŋi fye enzu mbɔlɛ lɛɛbi, de ba ki bi ya kiya ingyirimo loo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Enzu anzɔnu mate edubu ɛlɔ tee gba o yi mɔmɔ le.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu shi mbo lo ŋɔma uzhi uwɛkpɛlɔ uwɛkpɛlɔ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o wo tayi akwɛyi onzu uwunawuna a ŋɔma, <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e to eburedi ɛlɔ mbala emu wepo mbamba, e yi eyefaa e yese moshi, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi akwɛyi a mu yi ma e shi Wavɔngɔkiya wu kaa lo ka yi enzu mbamba. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Enzu lɛɛbi o ri ba ubwu e do mbo mo, Wavɔngɔkiya wu o kpala ebwebwede iyi bɔkɔ ishimo ɛlu mu lubiri luwo la lopo.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita E So Gedegede Tee Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu Okrasi Le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Omatiyu 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Omaki 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu Ukpo ilɛma kɛɛkyi wu akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo munyi wu akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu o so tee mi kwu uwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Umbafo o zɔ tee ŋɔ kwu Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima. &lt;&lt;Umbafo ɔ zɔ tee ŋɔ kwu Elazha, umbafo ba o zɔ tee anukenzu ɛnyi uwekyi a gba a nyi eyimo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi kɔ lu zɔ tee mi kwu uwe?&gt;&gt; Opita a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ kwu Okrasi uwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso Meka Iyi Inyashi Wu Mbala Lukwu Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Omatiyu 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Omaki 8.30—9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yi Wavɔngɔkiya wu mu alu iyɛkɔkɔ tee lo so uwewe iso ɛlɛ mo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />E kyo a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ uwu Onzu a ma inyashi gyɔɔ akwɛyi enzu umbakɔ, ebwoshi umbakɔ, mbala wa zɔ Ɛrɛma iyi Omosisi o towo wu mo akwɛyi ɔ ngbɛ wu ma. Tetete ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwɔla o gba wu laa iyimo mu kwuvɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Akwɛyi a za mba lɛɛbi tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu a gyi tee la mbwalu mi, mega e towo ɛnwu wu ma akwɛyi e to kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu wu kwɔfyi kwɔfyi kaa la mbwalu mi. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu a gyi tee laa sa kwunyɔ wu ma, kwu tomo, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ kwunyɔ wu kwu tomo kwuwo mi, ba a sangwu ma. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Kimbe bɔkɔ akwu esheshi yi kaa onzu le ri kwule ungwu kwudu kwɔlɛ ma lɛɛbi, ba kwunyɔ wu kwu tomo? I yi mo ndii! <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu e wo lovya iyi imbwalu mi mbala rɛnu mi, Umɛ uwu Onzu e wo lovya wu tetee kwuyengwu a ba nyɔ mu inzumbɛku wu mbala inzumbɛku iyi Ada mbala iyi alɔgbulɔ wakɛrikɛri. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mi so yi ongbulolo tee, umbafo umba o ri munɛ o ma Irɛsu iyi Ukpo dɛ gba o bo kpomo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Vindɔma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Omatiyu 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Omaki 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />I yi mate afyi ɛranda tee mu izhikembo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e siso ɛlɛ, akwɛyi e to Opita, Ɔzhɔnu mbala Ozhemisi o ka mu kadu unga Lɔwa kaa lo lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu Ukpo ilɛma, akwɛyi ureyi wu u vindɔma, ekpayi wu i vindɔma i ŋɔ purɛtɛtɛ mate imingɔma iyi kawu tayi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Enzu wepo ɔ wɔ kporo akwɛyi o le mu iso isomo mbala wu. Enzu mbɔlɛ akwu Omosisi mbala Elazha, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />bɔkɔ ɔ wɔ mu inzumbɛku iyi oshi akwɛyi o siso mbala Ɔzhizɔsi meka iyi lukwu undu bɔkɔ e kpo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kaa laa nyɔlɔ iyi Ukpo a gyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Opita mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu ondo u yi mbo mo gyɔɔ, kwuyengwu ba o nyeyimo mu ondo, o ma Ɔzhizɔsi mu inzumbɛku wu mbala enzu wepo umba bɔkɔ o ri mbala wu. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Tabɔkɔ enzu mbamba o lafya laa Ɔzhizɔsi o sheyimo, akwɛyi Opita a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada kwogba, ishoshi bɔkɔ ki yi munɛ le! Ki la ɛnu ɛla, kwunyi akwu ungwaŋa, kwunyi akwu ungwu Omosisi ungufo ba akwu ungwu Elazha.&gt;&gt; (Uwu ba e yitu shɛ kiya ingyi e yi mu isomo mo.) <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu iso ɛlɛ isomo bɛnɛ, akwɛyi kwɔmu kwu wɔ kwu koko mbo mo; akwɛyi iyi i wo Wavɔngɔkiya mo, kwuwongu kwɔmu kwɔngu kwu koko mbo mo. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Akwɛyi opwu u wɔ mu kwɔmu kwɔngu akwɛyi u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu Umɛ mi, uwu bɔkɔ mi ŋa - la lu pwa iso wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Tabɔkɔ opwu ɔwu u lafyima laa iso isomo, akwɛyi o ma Ɔzhizɔsi tee a ri kɛɛkyi wu ŋa. Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu ba o shi apula iyi i wo le laa ɛmba, o so onzu ɛnyɛnyi te kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o ma kwuye kwɔngu mo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Umɛshɛri Ɔnzɔnu Ofya Umbu Ɛndu Iyira Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Omatiyu 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Omaki 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Mu eyi i lama, kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu wala mbamba o kalama mu Lɔwa, akwɛyi riba ingyi enzu o bo du wu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Onzu uwufo mɛmi iyi riba ingyi enzu mbamba e to opwu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya! Mi-i kpa ŋa ɛshɛku, shɔɔkɔ yese umɛ mi - ukpɛnyi kɛɛkyi uwu mi yi wu le! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Kwundu ungufo kwu koko kwu fye mawu akwɛyi a byi ikyakwokwo iyi ɔkpɔ akwɛyi aa wa la kwɔnzhɛ mu kenzu; kwu lu wu afyima efya mo ba kwuu nɛ wu kanɛ iyɔkpɔɔ! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mi kpa Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa ɛshɛku tee lo ra ngwu ma ba ɔ fɔma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi enzu umba ɔyi uwura ɔlɛ bɔkɔ lu yi ikwu idu fulo mo le! &lt;&lt;Mi ŋɔ mbala yi nzhii ba kwuyengwu na? Kwuye te bɔkɔ mi to kaa la mi yidu mbala yi?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a za laa onzu awu tee, &lt;&lt;Bo laa umɛ ŋɔ awu munɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ umɛ awu e yi mu inyɔma akwɛyi kwundu ungwura kwɔngu kwu yi wu kwu fya wu mɛzhi laa ipwulama. Ɔzhizɔsi ba a kpa kwundu ungwura kwɔngu ɛyi, e bo umɛ awu ofya ma akwɛyi a gba wu e shi ete wu. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Izele i yi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ lɛɛbi mo kwuwongu imbulama iyi ekpasu iyi Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Ɔzhizɔsi A Gba E Siso Kpɔ Mekeka Iyi Lukwu Wu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Omatiyu 17.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Omaki 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Enzu o degbo mu kenzu iyama bɛnɛ mu apula lɛɛbi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iwomo, akwɛyi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />&lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛ alu mamari mu kiya ingyi mi gyi tee la mi so yi ele! O to Umɛ uwu Onzu o shi enzu umba o yi idomo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu ba o zɔngɔma yi ma mo. O nvye yi mbo mo kaa lo zɔngɔma yi ma mo, umba ba o riyi kaa lo yo wu kwuyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwe Ba A Ka Le?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Omatiyu 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Omaki 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Kaambu ka wɔ meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee uwe bɔkɔ a ka meka mba. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi egbo mbo awu akwɛyi e to umɛshɛri uwɛri uwufo, e shiwu a rima kɛlɛ mbala wu, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a na umɛshɛri uwɛri ele kwuwo mi, Imi gba a na mi le; onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a na mi, a na onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi le. Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ a nyɛma a ka le meka yi uwu gba a ka le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Onzu Uwunawuna Uwu Akwu Ogewa yi Mo Akwu Uwayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Omaki 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu e to opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, ki ma onzu uwufo e yi mu ɛndu iyira irama mu ɛnyi ŋɔ, ba ki nyiwu ma, moo e yi mbala nzu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu nyiwu ma mo,&gt;&gt; moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu ogewa yi mo akwu uwayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzu Umba Kwuse Ungwɛri Ungwufo Mu Osamariya O towo Ɔzhizɔsi Inama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Tabɔkɔ kwuye kwu ndama fo ungwu o to Ɔzhizɔsi o rewo moshi, Ɔzhizɔsi ba e shi egbo wu tee e re mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Akwɛyi a lɔ alɔgbulɔ lo to keyi lo fye mu kwuse kwukpɛnyi ungufo mu Osamariya kaa lo nɔngɔ ingyinangyina ma lo she wu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Enzu umba kwuse kwɔngu ba o na wu mo kwuwongu a zɛ e sheye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Kwuye ungwu Wavɔngɔkiya wu Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu o ma tayi, akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, ŋɔ gyi tee la ki ya ɔyi ma moshi kaa lu bo mɛzhi ka lu pwu mbo mo re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e fulo biri akwɛyi a kpa mba ɛyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o kama mu kwuse kwowa.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyi Bɔkɔ I Bi Du Wambwalu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Omatiyu 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu luzɛ mu ɔgwuzɛ, onzu uwufo a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi mbwalu ŋɔ muna muna bɔkɔ ŋɔ ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lɔngbɔga lu yi ɛbwu mba, afyi umba oshi o yi igwu mbo, Umɛ uwu Onzu ba e yi mɔgɔ uwu bɔkɔ e lo reshi wu mo.<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za la onzu awa tee, &lt;&lt;Mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt; Onzu awu ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada kwogba, mi ri mi byi pwu ada mi ma dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Shi ɛkpɛzhi lo so lo pwu ɛkpɛzhi mba ma. Uŋɔ ba so kaa tanu iyi Irɛsu iyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Onzu uwufo kpɔ a gba a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada kwogba, mi mbwalu ŋɔ, shi mi kaa mi so mi wo agba mi ungbo dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi kwuwo mu ɔbwa te a gbama akwɛyi a ma mu eyi igelemo mu kembo, e do ɛduma iyi Irɛsu iyi Ukpo iwomo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lɔ Enzu Uwo Ekperewo laa Wepo Mbamba Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ Ɔkwu a ŋa enzu uwekperewo la wepo mbafo akwɛyi a lɔ mba ma wepo wepo tee lo to keyi la wu lo so mu ese iyɛku mbala iyɛri mbaa bɔkɔ uwu a gyi tee le so. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛduma iyi ewiri ilɔma i yi gyɔɔ, enzu umba ɛduma ba o yi gyɔɔ mo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu nda ɔkwu uwu utu kaa la lɔ enzu umba ɛduma le fu mu utu wu. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />La lu so! Imi mi lɔ yi ma kyamate ilɔ tayi meka iyi lɔngbɔga. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />La lu to kwolamba naa kwongara naa ekpoyata mo; ba la lu ngbɛ kwuye gyɔɔ mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma mu ɔgwuzɛ mo. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />&lt;&lt;Kwɔgba ungwunanguna bɔkɔ lu fye, la lu ta ɔlɛ dɛ, la lu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt; Oloto lu fye mu kwogba kwɔlɛ loo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Gba onzu uwu a gyi oloto e yi mu kwogba kwɔngu, ɛnyi igbɛlɛma yi iyi oloto li yi mbala wu; gba akwu tayi mo, ba ɛnyi igbɛlɛma yi iyi oloto li gba li du yi. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />La lu ŋɔ mu kwogba kwɔngu kaa la lu ri, la lu wo kiya ingyinangyina bɔkɔ o shi yi, moo onzu uwu ɛduma e do rigbɛ wu ma. La lu kpa ɛvyɛ mu agba agba mo.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Gba lu fye mu kwuse ba o na yi ma, kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o shi yi la lu ri, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ofya mɔmɔ la lu bo mbu mo akwɛyi lu za mba tee, &lt;Irɛsu iyi Ukpo i bo kɛlɛ mbala yi-e.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Gba lu fye mu kwuse ba o na yi mo, la lu so mu ɛgwuzɛ iyi kwuse kwɔngu kaa la lu zɔ tee, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />&lt;Kwumburu ungwu kwuse yi ungwu kwu kpo mu alɛ nzu lala ki bulɔ ngwu ma ki kpo yi ngwu. Tetete la lu yitu tee Irɛsu iyi Ukpo i bo kɛlɛ mbala yi-e!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Imi la mi so yi kpeke tee Ɔnu uwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ombwu Izɔma Ukpo a ma inyashi iyi Ɔsɔdɔmu aa ka kwuse kwɔngu ma!<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ese Iyi Bɔkɔ I Tamɛzhi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Omatiyu 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />&lt;&lt;Gbetu ŋɔ, Okorazi! Gbetu ŋɔ tete Ɔbɛsayida! Gba ɛduma iyi kenzu iyama iyi bɔkɔ o wo ma ŋa le gba lo wo yi mu Otaya mbala Ɔsidɔ, enzu mɔmɔ lo bo ŋɔma, o kpo ashɔgiri mbala kwulɔ mu ɛnwu kaa li zɔ tee o kwu ira mba ɔsu ngba didiri ee! <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ɔnu uwu Ombwu Izɔma Ukpo a ma inyashi iyi Otaya mbala Ɔsidɔ a ka yi ma. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Uŋɔ kɔ Okapanawu? Ŋɔ mate o to ŋɔ o fulo moshi re? Ayi mo, o to ŋɔ ɔ ta mu aleku!<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu a pwa iso yi, iso mi gba a pwa le; onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e towo yi mo, Imi gba e towo mi mo le; onzu uwunawuna uwu ba e towo mi mo, e towo onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi ma le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Igbama Iyi Enzu Uwo Ekperewo Laa Wepo Mbamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Enzu uwo ekperewo laa wepo mbamba o gbama laa ɔnyɛ uwakwuu. Akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, eyo umbeyi lala o ta nzu mɛzhi tabɔkɔ ki ya ɛnyi ŋɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi ma onzu uwoyi tee a kalama moshi a tama kyamate imingɔma iyi kawu tayi.<verse eid="LUK 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />La lu pwa! Mi shi yi idomo kaa la lu kpa ata mu akwu mbala ana kaa ekpasu iyi onzu uwoyi awu la lu shiri yi mo lɛɛbi; kiya kinyinyi tee ki wo yi mo. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Tetete la lu mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu ɛndu iyira i ta yi mɛzhi mo; la lu mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu o ka ɛnyi ma moshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi A Mwɔnyɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Omatiyu 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16">13.16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:17">17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi Ɔzhizɔsi a nyɔlɔma mbala ɔnyɛ akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, Ɔkwu uwoshi mbala ɛzhi! Mi ngbede kwuwongu ŋɔ nvye apula ɛlɛ ma laa enzu umba amasa mbala wayitu, ba ŋɔ wu yi ma laa umba bɔkɔ o yi yitu mo. Ee, Ada, ɛlɛ i she ŋɔ woshi gba ŋɔ wo yi tayi le.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />&lt;&lt;Ada mi e lo mi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mɔwu-o. Onzu uwu e yitu Umɛ le e yi mo Ada kɛɛkyi gba e yitu le, onzu uwu ba e yitu Ada e yi mo Umɛ kɛɛkyi mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ Umɛ a ŋa tee laa zɔ wu ma laa mba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e geleyi e yese Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi e so mbo wɛrɛrɛ tee, ɔnyɛ akwu uwayi lunyi umba bɔkɔ eyi yi i ma apula iyi ɛlɛ! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Mi gyi tee lami so yi tee anukenzu mbala asu riba riba o gyi tee lo ma kiya ingyi lu yi mu imama le ba o ma mo, o gyi tee lo pwa iyi lu yi mu ipwama le ba o pwa mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwoba Ungwu Onzu Uweshi uwu Osamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Kwuye kwunyi onzu uwufo uwu e yi iyitu iyi Ɛrama iyi Omosisi e yimo kaa la pwa Ɔzhizɔsi ma. E yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Omale, mi wo tee bɔkɔ mi fya kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔ ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe bɔkɔ o ka mu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi? Ŋɔ lunyi tee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Onzu awu a gba wu opwu tee: Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;&lt;Pwu idɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ukpo ŋɔ mu akɔ ŋɔ lɛɛbi mbala idu iyi anana ŋa lɛɛbi mbala ekpasu ŋɔ lɛɛbi mbala egbo ŋɔ lɛɛbi;&gt; ka gba, &lt;Pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu unukpaŋa ta ɛnwu ŋɔ tayi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ gba opwu mamari,&gt;&gt; so kaa wo tayi akwɛyi ŋɔ yi kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Omale uwu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi awu ba a gyi tee laa zɔ tee uwu e yi ingbomo mo, akwɛyi e yo Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe ba akwu unukpa mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo a wɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ e sheye mu Ozheriko akwɛyi e fye mɔwu uwu awɛlɔ, o lu wu ekpayi ma, o kpa wu ɛmwu akwɛyi o kama kyamba, o lu wu afyima mate ukpɛzhi tayi. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Obwoshi uwu Ukpo uwufo a zɛ mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔwu tete; akwɛyi tee bɔkɔ a ma onzu awu, akwɛyi a zɛ mɛmba a kama iya wu. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Tatayi gba onzu uwu ɛdɔ iyi Olevi tee bɔkɔ e bo mu riyi ngyɛngyi akwɛyi a ma onzu awu, a zɛ mɛmba a kama iya wu. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Onzu uwu Osamariya uwufo ba e yi mu luzɛ mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔwu tete akwɛyi e bo mbaa bɔkɔ onzu ele e yi, akwɛyi tabɔkɔ a ma wu, inyashi wu i wowu mo. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />A ka munyi wu, a la wu anyi mbala epu mu efya wu akwɛyi a ma yi kukokpayi; akwɛyi e to onzu awu e fulo mu ɔzɛki uwawu, akwɛyi a ka wu mu riyoga akwɛyi e yese mbaa wu. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Mu eyi i lama a wa laa esepo epo iyi esiliva e shi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a bɔ eyi mu riyoga awu akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;Yese mbaa wu, &lt;kwuyengwu mi gbama, mi wa ŋa kwɔkpa ungwu bɔkɔ kwu kyomo ma.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Imbwama yi, Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu wala mbɔlɛ uwu na bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma tee akwu unukpa uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e fye mu ewo iyi awɛlɔ mbɔlɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Omale uwu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi ele a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu a ma inyashi wu awu.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ tete so kaa wo tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ke Gboga Laa Omata mbala Omeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yi mu luzɛ, akwɛyi o bo mu kwuse ungufo mbaa bɔkɔ okokpayi uwu o ya wu tee Omata awu a lɔ la wu tee le bo le gbo wu riyi oga. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />E yi umɛnɛ okokpayi o ya wu tee Omeri, uwu a ŋɔma mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi e shi alu mu iso iyi e so. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Omata ba e shi egbo wu mbaa kiya ingyirimo iwomo. Amba o wo wu mo akwɛyi e bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, ŋɔ fu eyi laa umɛnɛ mi a lu mi afyima ba mi yi mu ɛduma iwomo kɛɛkyɛkyi mi? Za wu kaa le bo la mbwa mi ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ɔkwu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Omata, Omata! Ŋɔ wo idu gidigidi mu apula riba riba ŋɔ gama, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />kiya kikpɛnyi gba o yi ugɔ ngyi le. Omeri ba a mulɛ ingyi bɔkɔ ri koshi, o do wu ngyi inama mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="ms">Ezɔ Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Mekeka Iyi Ukpo Ilɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Omatiyu 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu Ukpo ilɛma mu riyi ngyifo. Tabɔkɔ a mbwama, akwɛyi onzu ukpɛnyi meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, zɔ nzu Ukpo ilɛma, kyamate Ɔzhɔnu a zɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu lu lɛ Ukpo, la lu zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;Ada:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Ɛnyi ŋɔ li fya iduma ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Irɛsu ŋɔ li bo.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Shi nzu kiya ingyirimo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:3">ingyi ɔnɛ mbala ingyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:3">kwɔfyi kwɔfyi.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Gba laa ingbomo nzu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">kpa nzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">mate bɔkɔ kinzu ki gba laa ingbomo iyi enzu ki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:4">kpa mba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Ki shi nzu la ki fye mɛmi iyi ipwama iyɛkɔkɔ mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ ka mu kwogba ungwu umɛza ŋa mutu uwɔkɔɔ akwɛyi ŋɔ za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛza mi, shɔɔkɔ lo mi kwɔkpa ungwu eburedi ela nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Umɛza mi uwufo uwu a wɔ luzɛ a ŋamima mogba mi kekelele, Imi ba mi yi kiya ingyirimo ingyi mi shi wu mo!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi umɛza ŋa awu a gba ŋa opwu mɛmi mɛzawu tee, &lt;Ki wo mi egbo ngɛrɛngɛrɛ mo! Mi koko riku mo-o, ɛmɛ mi ba o yi mbala mi mu kwugodo-o. Mi do tee mi yimo kaa la mi shi ŋɔ kiya kikpikpɛnyi tee mo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />La mi so yi, gba e yi egbo iyi bɔkɔ e shi wu kiya ingyirimo kwuwongu bɔkɔ akwu umɛza wu le mo lala, tetete kwuwongu ɛngɛrɛngɛrɛ iyi onzu ele, e yimo e to e shi wu mate bɔkɔ a gyi awu kwuwongu e wo lovya iyi indama mo.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ mi za yi tee: La lu nda akwɛyi o shi yi; lu gagyi lu fya; la lu la kwuwo mu riku, o wu yi ngyi ma. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu a nda o shi wu, onzu uwunawuna uwu a gagyi a fyama; onzu uwunawuna uwu a la kwuwo mu riku, o wawu riku mo. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Lunyi umba ada, uwe mekeka yi bɔkɔ umɛ wu a nda wu umu ba e to ɔkwu e shi wu? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Nana a nda kwɔshi ba e to ena e shi wu? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Lunyi enzu umbira mbɔlɛ lala lu yitu iyi lu shi ɛmɛ yi rɛshi ingyi esheshi, i bi gyi Eteyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi moshi, e to Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi enzu umba bɔkɔ o nda wu mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Ɔbɛzɛbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Omatiyu 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Omaki 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu kwundu ungwura ungwu u tukenzu irima; akwɛyi tabɔkɔ kwundu ungwura kwɔngu kwu wɔma, akwɛyi onzu ele e le mu iso isomo. Riba ingyi enzu mbamba o ya kenzu, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />enzu umbafo mba ba ɔ zɔ tee, akwu mu ekpasu iyi ɔbɛzɛbu, ɔsu uwu eyo umbeyi gba e ye mbo mu irima le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Umbafo ba o gyite lo kpawu kuda akwɛyi o za wu tee le wo apula iyi amɛ kaa li zɔ tee Ukpo a nyama la wu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yitu iyi egbo mbo akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛsu iyi bɔkɔ i ka epo akwɛyi i wo anya iyi esu i kpɛdɔma; tatayi kwogba ungwu kwu ka epo akwɛyi kwu wo anya iyi esu kwu kpomo. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Gba ɛsu iyi onzu uwoyi i ka epo akwɛyi i wo anya iyi esu i wo te ba ɛsu wu irima? Lu zɔ tee mi ralaa eyo iyi eyi ma mu ekpasu iyi Ɔbɛzɛbu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Gba mi ralaa eyo iyi eyi ma mu ekpasu iyi Ɔbɛzɛbu, mu ekpasu iyi uwe bɔkɔ wa mbwalu yi o rayima? Wambwalu yi o zɔ yi ombu mu ɛlɛ! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Gba akwu mu ekpasu iyi Ukpo gba mi ralaa eyo iyi eyi ma le, de ba ɛlɛ i zɔ tee Irɛsu iyi Ukpo i bo munyi yi-e.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Gba onzu uwu ekpasu a rima mbala ewulo iyi ewa wu, ee gbo kwogba wu ma akwɛyi apula iyi kwogba wu i shi kyoo. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Gba onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka wu ekpasu ma ba a wa wu laa ewa akwɛyi a bi wu ma, aa na ewulo iyi ewa wu iyi bɔkɔ onzu awu e fulo idu ma yi awu ma, akwɛyi a ka apula iyi bɔkɔ akwu awu ma.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mbala mi mo akwu ogewa mi; onzu uwu bɔkɔ a mbwa mi ma mu ɛlu ikpalama mo de ba e ye yi mu i kpashaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Igbama Iyi Kwundu Ungwura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Omatiyu 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />&lt;&lt;Gba kwundu ungwura kwu wɔma mu ɛnwu iyi onzu kwuu kpɛvyɛ mbaa bɔkɔ embyi o yi mo kaa la kwu fya kizɛ ingyi ɛnwu igbomo. Gba kwu fya mo, akwɛyi kwuu za laa ɛngwu tee, &lt;Mii gba mi re mu kwogba mi ungwu bɔkɔ mi wɔ awu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Kwuye ungwu kwu gbama akwɛyi kwu du kwogba kwɔngu te o vyɛ ngwu ma sɛsɛsɛ, <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />akwɛyi kwuu wɔ kwudu kwuu ngye la ɛndu iyi ira erewo iyifo iyi bɔkɔ i ka yi ira ma akwɛyi ii ŋɔ mɔmɔ. Imbwama iyi onzu awu ii ka ira la iyi kwonze.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔnyɛ Ongbulolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e siso ɛlɛ, akwɛyi okokpayi uwufo a wa laa opwu uwɔkwuu mu riba ngyɛngyi tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔnyɛ lakwu uwu Oko uwu bɔkɔ a mba ŋa ba e yi ŋɔ awu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;A kwu tayi mo, umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso iyi Ukpo ba o mbwalu yi gba o yi ɔnyɛ le!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɛzɔ Unga Amɛ Igagyima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Omatiyu 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Tabɔkɔ riba ingyi enzu ri le mu ikyomo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi e le mu isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ akwu enzu umbira! O gagyi kɛzɔ unga amɛ, tetete ba o shi mbo ikpikpɛnyi mo, ba tee unga Ozhona lo. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kyamate Ozhona ba akwu kɛzɔ e shi enzu umba Ɔninɛvɛ awu, tegba Umɛ uwu Onzu aakwu kɛzɔ e shi enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ le. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Ɔnu uwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ombwu Izɔma, Omakazhiya uwu Osheba a rima a ngbɛ enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ ombu uwoyi, a wɔ ngbaa mu ɛzhi wu iyi indama i bo tee la pwa ɛzɔ iyi ilukwu iyi Ɔsɔlɔmɔ; Imi ba mi so yi tee, onzu uwu a ka Ɔsɔlɔmɔ ma e yi munɛ! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ombwu Izɔma enzu umba Ɔninɛvɛ o rima akwɛyi o za yi tee lunyi lu wo ɔnyɛ mo, moo mba ɔ kwu ira mba ɔsu kwuyengwu o pwa anu itama iyi Ozhona; Imi ba mi so yi tee, onzu uwu a ka Ozhona ma e yi munɛ!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbɛ iyi Ɛnwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Omatiyu 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22">6.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:23">23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />I yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a byi kambwu ɔyi ba e shi ngo mu riyi ingyi invyemo mo, nana mu ubwu uwu kwugodo mo. E fulo ngo mu kana unga ɔyi kaa onzu uwu bɔ e yi mu ifyemo la ma ɛbɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Eyi ŋɔ gba akwu ɛbɛ iyi ɛnwu ŋɔ le, gba eyi ŋɔ i shoshi, ɛnwu ŋɔ ngyɔɔ akwu ɛbɛ; gba eyi ŋɔ i shoshi mo, ɛnwu lɛɛbi i yi mu ipwu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu ngbɛndu kaa ɛbɛ iyi i yi ma yi ele li vindɔ ipwu mo. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Gba ɛnwu yi ngyɔɔ akwu ɛbɛ, ba i yi kwuko ungwu kwu yi mu ipwu mo, ɛnwu lɛɛbi akwu ɛbɛ, kyamate ɛbɛ iyi kambu unga ɔyi i fu ma yi tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ta Afarisi Mbala Wa Zɔ Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi Undu Kwudu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Omatiyu 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Omaki 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso isomo, akwɛyi Ofarisi ɛnyi a lɔ la wu tee le bo le ri kiya mbala wu; akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fyemo akwɛyi a ŋɔma kaa le ri kiya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ofarisi awu ba a ma tee Ɔzhizɔsi e shishi kwuwo mo dɛ kaa le ri kiya le mo, akwɛyi i shi wu kenzu iyama. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Akwɛyi Ɔkwu a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi Afarisi lu gbɔ kwudu ungwu kaatu mbala kagɔ, mɛmi ba lu nyɔlɔma laa ekweyi mbala ira. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Lunyi efyo mbɔlɛ! Akwu Ukpo uwu e wo ɛmi le gba ba e wo kwudu le tete mo re? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />La lu ralaa kiya ingyi ki yi mɛmi iyi kaatu mbala ago la lu shi ayirewa akwɛyi ingyinangyina ki wulu yi ma. <verse eid="LUK 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />&lt;&lt;Gbetu yi lunyi Afarisi! Lunyi lu to kwukpɛnyi meka iyi uwo iyi apula iyi ɔsɔ mate, imadu, okwonu mbala epu iyɛri iyɛri iyi utu yi lu ka laa Ukpo lunyi ba lu lafya laa ongbulolo mbala idɛnyi iyi Ukpo. La lu wo apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mbala iyifo ɛnyi tete.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />&lt;&lt;Gbetu yi lunyi Afarisi! Lunyi lu gyi iŋɔma mu lɔgyi undu lu shi iŋɔma lu ka mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama mbala ɛnyi igbɛlɛma mu rishi.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />&lt;&lt;Gbetu yi! Lunyi lu yi mate agariwu iyi bɔkɔ o wo yi kɛzɔ mo, enzu o zɛ ma yi ba o yitu mo tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Akwɛyi u zɔ ɛzu iyi Ɛrama iyi Omosisi ukpɛnyi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Omale, ta ŋɔ yi mu ɛlɛ isomo le, ŋɔ ye nzu mu ari ipemo tetee!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Gbetu yi tete lunyi wazɔ ɛzu iyi Ɛrama iyi Omosisi! Lu nɔngɔ ewulo iyi ɔlu laa enzu iyi i kɔ mu ishimo, lunyi ba lu la ɛfyi ma yi kaa la lu mbwamba ma mu ewulo ɛnyi itomo mo.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />&lt;&lt;Gbetu yi! Lu mbo agariwu iyesheshi laa anukenzu umba Ukpo anukenzu umba bɔkɔ asɔkwu yi ɔ ngbɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ i zɔ tee lunyi lu nyama laa iyi bɔkɔ asɔkwu yi o wo awu; asɔkwu yi ɔ ngbɛ anukenzu ma, akwɛyi lunyi ba lu mbo mbo agariwu. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Ukpo a zɔ ilukwu wu akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;Mi lɔ mba laa anukenzu mbala wa zɛ ilɔ; umbafo mbo o ngbɛ mba ma umbafo ba o lo mbo inyashi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ o ngbɛ mba ombu uwoyi kwuwongu anukenzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ ɔ ngbɛ ngbaa mu iyemo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />i na mu lukwu undu Ɛbɛlu i so mu lukwu undu Ozakaraya, uwu bɔkɔ o ngbɛ wu ma mu kwudɛka ungwu kwumbu ungwu isabɔ mbala Riyi ingyi Ɔkɛrikɛri. Ee, mi so yi, enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ o ngbɛ mba ombu uwoyi kwuwo mbo lɛɛbi.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />&lt;&lt;Gbetu yi lunyi wazɔ ɛzu iyi Ɛrama iyi Omosisi! Anu iyi kwogba ungwu iyitu lu to yi mo; Lunyi lu fyemo mo, ba lu se ɔgwuzɛ ma laa umba bɔkɔ o yi mu iwomo kaa lo fyemo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya laa riyi ngyɛngyi, akwɛyi Afarisi mbala wa zɔ ɛzu iyi Ɛrama iyi Omosisi o le wo mu ikpafyifyi mu eyo iyomo iyi apula guruguru, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />ɔ gyi tee lo kpa wu kuda kaa lo yi wu mo mu iso iyi bɔkɔ e be so.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="ms">Iyemalu Mɛka Iyi Angba Imwuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26">Omatiyu 10.26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Tabɔkɔ enzu riba gyɔɔ o kpala ɛlu ba o le mu esu ata ikpama, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e siso mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu keyi dɛ, a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu gbo ɛnwu yi ma mbaa ɛzɔ iyi Afarisi - iyi bɔkɔ akwu angba imwuma: <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o kpo ngyi ukwu bɔkɔ o wu ngyi ma mo ki yi mo naa ingyi ki nvyemo ba o yitu ngyi mo ki yi mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu so mu utu o pwa ngyi mu ɔnɔnda, ingyi bɔkɔ o kpo kenzu kwɔlu mu ugu uwɛmi o re ngyi mu kadu unga kɛnu gba o ta ngyi anu le.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Onzu Uwu Bɔkɔ I Fa Te Lɔ Wu Iyi Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Omatiyu 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Mi so yi ɛmɛza mi, la lu riyi iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ngbɛ ɛnwu ma ba a gba e wo kiya kinyinyi ego fo. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Imi ba mi zɔ yi onzu uwu lu riyi wu: La lu riyi iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a ngbɛ ɛnwu ma akwɛyi e yi idomo iyi bɔkɔ a ta ŋa mɔyi. Mi so yi la lu riyi wu! <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Endoro walɔ o ya mba mu esepo more? Tetete Ukpo a ka la kwuleyi laa ukpuukpɛnyi te mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Inyi iyi reshi yi lala Ukpo e yitu yi. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu wiyi mo; moo lu koshi laa endoro riba riba!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Inyama Mbala Itomo Iyi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matthew 10.32,33; <ref loc="LUK 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:19">10.19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:20">20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />&lt;&lt;La mi so yi, onzu uwu a nya mi ma mu eyi iyi enzu riba, Umɛ uwu Onzu a nya wu ma mu eyi iyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ ku zɔ mi mu eyi iyi enzu ba, Umɛ uwu Onzu a zɔ ku zɔ wu tete mu eyi iyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu e siso iyira meka iyi Umɛ uwu Onzu o gba yi o kpa wu; onzu uwunawuna uwu e siso iyira meka iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba o gba yi o kpa wu mo.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />&lt;&lt;Gba o kaya mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama mu idu iyi wa to keyi mbala enzu umba idomo kaa lɔ zɔ yi ombu, idu li wo yi kpu meka iyi kiya ingyi lu bi so nana ewo iyi bɔkɔ lu bi walaa ɛnwu yi ma mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo a zɔ yi mu ata ɛnyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu so.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu U Yi Kiya Ingyi Kwuwo Orondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Akwɛyi onzu ukpɛnyi meka iyi riba ingyi enzu mbamba a za laa Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Omale, za laa umɛnɛ mi kaa la ka kiya ngyi ogu ingyi bɔkɔ ete nzu e kpo e shenzu mbala mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gbawu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛza mi, uwe bɔkɔ a rami e wo u zɔ ombu naa u ka kiya meka yi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu kaa la lu gbo ɛnwu yi mbaa ekweyi iyinayina iyi apula; moo kwunyɔ ungwu onzu kwu yi mu kiya gyɔɔ ingyi bɔkɔ e yi ngyi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba tee: &lt;&lt;Utu uwu onzu uwufo uwu e yi kwuwo, u wa laa ewiri kwudu mamari. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Akwɛyi e le mu amasa ikama laa ɛnwu tee, &lt;Mi wo tee? Mi yi riyi ingyi mi fu ewiri ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Akwɛyi a za laa ɛnwu tee, &lt;Mi yitu ingyi mi wo,&gt; mi shiri lunɛ mi ma akwɛyi mi mbo undu lu ka tee mo, mɔmɔ gba mi fu ewiri mbala apula mi lɛɛbi le. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Akwɛyi mi za laa ɛmi tee, &lt;&lt;Mwɔnyɛ! Moo ŋɔ yi apula iyesheshi gyɔɔ iyi bɔkɔ i sa ŋa igɔ iyi lɔri guruguru. Kpala ɛŋɔ, ri, wo, kaa mwɔnyɛ.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi Ukpo a za wu tee, &lt;Uŋɔ orondo ele! Mu utu ɔlɛ o na kwunyɔ ŋɔ ma; iyi ŋɔ kpala ɛlu la ɛŋɔ le ba akwiyi uwe fo?&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa kwoba kwɔlɛ ma tee, &lt;&lt;Tegba i yi le laa onzu uwunauwuna uwu bɔkɔ a kpala kiya ɛlu la ɛnwu mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ba e yi kiya ingyi kwuwo mbaa Ukpo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɛlɛ Mu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Omatiyu 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee: &lt;&lt;Kwuwogu ɔlɛ mi so yi tee, la lu taka kwuwongu kiya ingyi lu ri kaa la lu yi kwunyɔ mo nanakwuwongu ekpayi iyi lu kpo mɛnwu mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwunyɔ kwu ka kiya ingyirimo ma, ɛnwu ba i ka ekpayi ma. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />La lu yese kwɔrikakwɔmɛ: o somo mo ba o lɔ mo; o yi ala mo ba o yi lunɛ mo; Ukpo gba e fye mbo le! Lunyi lu koshi laa afyi umboshi gyɔɔ mo! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Uwe meka yi bɔkɔ e do tee e kyo kwunyɔ wu wɔzhi ma mu egbo ibyima wu? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Gba lu do tee lu wo iyɛri ɛlɛ ego mo, i wo tee bɔkɔ lu ta aka kwuwongu apula iyi ishimo?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />&lt;&lt;La lu yese mate bɔkɔ edodo i bulɔma: i wo ɛduma mo ba i fu ekpayi laa ɛyi mo. Imi ba la mi so yi, Ɔsu Ɔsɔlɔmɔ laa kiya ingyi kwuwo wu te lala ekpayi wu i shoshi mate edodo ɛlɛ mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ɔsɛ uwu bɔkɔ u tumo ɔnɛnɛ kwɔnyi ba o ma wu fo, o fu wu mɔyi, lala Ukpo e wo wu agya marimari, i bi gyi lunyi enzu? Ikwidufulo yi i ga kɛkyi ma! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />La lu shi idu yi mu kiya ingyi lu ri naa lu wo mo. La lu ta aka ngyi mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />(Ɛlɛ gba enzu wayi Ukpo mo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ o mbwalu le.) Eteyi ba e yitu tee lu yi ugɔ iyi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Lunyi ba la lu gagyi Irɛsu iyi Ukpo keyi dɛ, akwɛyi ee shi yi apula ɛlɛ tete.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kiya Ingyi Kwuwo Moshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Omatiyu 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />&lt;&lt;La lu wiyi mo, lunyi uzhi uwɛri, moo Eteyi a mwɔnyɛ tee e shi yi Ɛsu Iyoshi. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />La lu kwu apula yi lɛɛbi la lu ya yi ma kaa lu shi ayirewa. La lu gagyi ɛkpɛshɛ lɛyi iyi bɔkɔ i wuma mo, la lu shi kiya ingyi kwuwo moshi, mbaa bɔkɔ ki gyima mo, kwuwongu uwɛlɔ a nyɔ kɛlɛ mo, ɛla ba e ri yimo mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Moo mbaa kiya ingyi kwuwo ŋɔ ki yi le gba egbo ŋɔ i yi le tete.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɛgba Umba O Yi Ɛnwu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />La lu yiri okiringba yi ma iyi ɛduma iyi Ukpo iwomo, kambyɔyi yi la ka nyima mo, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />kyamate ɛmɛgba umba o rigbo adakwogba mba tee la gbama mbaa ɛnɛ iyi ɔnu uwu okopo. Kwuye ungwunanguna bɔkɔ a gbama akwɛyi a la kwuwo mu riku ba o wawu ngyi ma kɛlɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu ɛmɛgba umba bɔkɔ adakwogba mba a gbama e du mbo la reyi mu igbomo! Mi so yi ongbulolo, a lu ɔriga uwu kadu ma, e shi mbo o nɔma akwɛyi a ka laa uwewe mbo kiya ingyirimo. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu ɛmɛgba umba bɔkɔ adakwogba mba e du mbo tee o yi ɛnwu ma o rigbo wu, gba e bo mutu wɔkɔ nana mu eyifumo! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />La lu yitu tee, gba adakwogba le yitu iyi kwuyengwu uwɛlɔ a nyɔ, e be shi kaa uwɛlɔ awu le fyemo mogba wu mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Lunyi tete la lu yi ɛnwu ma kwuwongu Umɛ uwu Onzu a nyɔ kwuyengwu lu fulo eyi wu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umɛgba Uwu Kwuyi Naa Umɛgba Uwu Umbwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Omatiyu 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Opita e yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, kwoba kwɔlɛ ŋɔ ba nzu, nana la enzu lɛɛbi ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ɔkwu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe ba akwu onzu u bɔ eyi uwu kwuyi, uwu ilukwu? Onzu uwu bɔkɔ adakwogba wu e to wu a bɔ kwunzu kaa le yese mbaa kwɔgba wu kaa le shi ɛmɛgba wu umbafo mbamba kiya ingyirimo mbo mu kwuyengwu kwu kpo gba akwu onzu u bɔ eyi uwu kwuyi mbala ilukwu le. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umɛgba uwu bɔkɔ adakwogba wu a gbama e du wu mu ɛduma iwomo marimari! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Mi so yi ongbulolo, adakwogba wu e to wu a bɔ kwunzu ungwu apula wu ndii. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ɔbulɛ ŋa gba umɛgba awu a za la ɛnwu wu tee, &lt;Adakwogba mi e to kwuye dɛ gba a gbama le,&gt; akwɛyi e le mu ɛmɛgba anzɔnu mbala ekokpayi mbamba ɛmu ikpama, ba e ri, e wo embyi o yi wu mo, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />adakwogba awu a gbama ɔnu uwu bɔkɔ umɛgba awu e fulo eyi wu mo mbala mu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ e yitu ngwu mo. Adakwogba wu e kpolo wu kpɔkpɔ mu ɛmu ibyima ba ee shi wu mu riyi mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa mo.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />&lt;&lt;Umɛgba uwu bɔkɔ e yitu iyi kiya ingyi adakwogba wu a ngyi ba e yi ɛnwu ma kaa le wo ngyi mo, o byi wu ɛmu iyɛkɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Umɛgba uwu e yitu kiya ingyi adakwogba wu a gyi tee le wo mo, akwɛyi e wo kiya ingyi ɛmu ikpama, o kpa wu ɛmu bwɛɛ. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ o shi wu kiya gyɔɔ, o yo wu kwuyo ungwu apula gyɔɔ munyi wu; onzu uwu bɔkɔ o kwu o lo wu mɔwu gyɔɔ, o gagyi munyi wu gyɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi Gba E Bo Laa Ikama Le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Omatiyu 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />&lt;&lt;Mi bo tee kaa la mi lo kwudu kwɔlɛ ɔyi, lo lo ngwu ɔyi-e lala a ba kwami ɔnyɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />O ŋɔ wo mi obatisima, egbo mi ba i nɔma mo nzhii ba o mbwama dɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Lu mate mi bo la iŋɔma iyi oloto mu kwudu kwɔlɛ re? Ayi mo, akwu iŋɔma iyi oloto mo, ikama gba mi bo yi le. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />I na mu kwuye kwɔlɛ i sheye keyi, enzu walɔ umba kwogba kwunyi o ka epo, wala o shi wepo eyi, wepo ba o shi wala eyi mu ɛnwu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ada e shi umɛ wu ɔnzɔnu eyi, umɛ ɔnzɔnu ba e shi ete wu eyi; ɛnɛ e shi umɛ wu okokpayi eyi, umɛ okokpayi ba e shi anyi wu eyi; anyɔnu e shi oko uwu umɛ wu eyi, oko uwu umɛ ba e shi anyɔnu wu eyi mu ɛnwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Izɔngɔma Iyi Kwuye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2">Omatiyu 16.2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a za laa enzu kpɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Gba lu ma tee Ukpo iyomo mu ɔnu uwu kwoto, kɛlɛlɛ lu zɔ tee, Ukpo a ŋe tumo, ba e tumo kego. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Gba kwokpo kwu tumo mu kwuko ungwu ɔnu uwu kwoto, lu zɔ tee, kizɛ ki ŋi kpala ɔyi, ba i wo tayi kego. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Lunyi enzu wamwangba mbɔlɛ! Lu yitu iyi iluma iyi iyimo iyi ɛzhi mbala oshi; I wo tee bɔkɔ lu yitu iyi iluma iyi kwuye kwɔlɛ mo le?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Lomesu Mbala U Lo Ɛwa Ŋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25">Omatiyu 5.25</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:26">26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />&lt;&lt;I wo tee bɔkɔ lu za lɛyi ongbulolo uwu kiya ingyi i fate la lu wo? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Gba onzu e lo ewa ŋa mu ɔkwɔtu tabɔkɔ ŋɔ sheyimo mbala wu mbaa u zɔ ombu, kyakpɔ kaa lomesu mbala wu mu ɔgwuzɛ dɛ gba lu bu so mu ɔkwɔtu le. Moo gba ŋɔ wo tayi mo, e pyipyi ŋɔ e re mbaa u zɔ ombu, uzombu ba aa ra ŋa ee shi odakari, akwɛyi odakari ba e to ŋɔ aa ta mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Mi so ŋɔ, ŋɔ wɔ kwudu mo nzhii ba ŋɔ mbwa ekpa ŋa iwama dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">La lu Kwu Ira Yi Ɔsu Moo Ba Lu Kpɛdɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu enzu umbafo umba o yi mɔmɔ o ba Ɔzhizɔsi ɛza iyi enzu umba Ogalili umba bɔkɔ Opayileti a ngbɛ mba ma kwuyengwu o yi mu isabɔ iwomo laa Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ enzu mbɔlɛ o ngbɛ mba ma tayi, mu imama yi ingbomo mbo i ka ingbomo iyi enzu umba Ogalili mbanambana ma re? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Mi gyite la mi za yi tee akwu tayi mo ndii! Gba lu kwu ira yi ɔsu mo, lunyi tete lu kpɛdɔma mate umba tayi. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Nana enzu wewo la waranda umba bɔkɔ o kpomo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ otowa mu Osilo e shiri e kpo mbo akwɛyi a ngbɛ mba ma awu kɔ! Mu imama yi ingbomo mbo i ka ingbomo iyi enzu mbanambana ma umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ re? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Mi gyite la mi za yi tee, akwu tayi mo ndii! Gba lu kwu ira yi ɔsu mo, lunyi tete lu kpɛdɔma mate umba tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kwɔba Ungwu Uwɛyi Uwu Oboriyo Uwu Bɔkɔ U Muma Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo e gwu uwɛyi uwu oboriyo mu utu wu. Akwɛyi a ka tee la bɛ imuma wu, ba a fya kiya kinyinyi mo. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Akwɛyi a za la onzu u bɔ eyi mu utu ɔnwu tee, &lt;Ata ɛlɛ akwu iyi ɔla bɔkɔ mi bo mbaa imuma iyi uwɛyi ɔlɛ ibɛma ba mi fya kiya kinyinyi mo. Kpolo wu mo! Kuwongwu kwuwongumbe u to kizɛ gbodogbodo shaa te?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Onzu u bɔ eyi mu utu awu ba a gba opwu tee, &lt;Adakwogba, &lt;shiwobi kari ka kpɛnyi kaa la mi bɔ wu eyi kyo akwɛyi mi fu wu emi iyi ɛmu mu undu wu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Gba u muma kari ungafo, ba ishoshi, gba akwu tayi mo, ba ŋɔ kpolo wu mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Oko Ukpokapiya Ofya Ma Mu Kwɔfyi Ungwu Ɛnwu Igbomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungufo tee, Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu ɛzu izɔma mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Oko uwufo uwu bɔkɔ kwundu ungwura kwu ta wu ofya nzhii ba lɔri luwo la loranda. E ndumo kpɛkpɛ wu ba e do iyimo faa mo. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a ma wu, a ya wu ma tee le bo keyi akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Oko ele, ofya ŋa u bomo-o!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />E fulo wu ewo wu akwɛyi e yimo a rima mɔmɔɔmɔ, akwɛyi a du Ukpo ma.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />U to keyi uwu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama ba amba o wo wu kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi e bo onzu ofya ma ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo, akwɛyi a za la enzu tee, &lt;&lt;Afyi ɛrɛnyi gba akwiyi ɛduma i womo le. La lu bo lo bo yi ofya ma mu afyi ɛnyi mo akwu ɔnu wu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ɔkwu ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi wamwu angba mbɔlɛ! Lunyi lu vuvu endo yi ma naa azɛki yi ma mu uri lu ka mba mbaa embyi iwomo ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Oko ele akwu umɛ uwu Aburamu, uwu bɔkɔ onzu uwoyi a mawu ma lɔri luwo la loranda; ishoshi tee lo bo wu ofya ma ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so iso ɛlɛ, agewa wu kpɛkpɛmba lovya lu wo mbo mo, enzu umba bɔkɔ o gyirima awu ba o mwɔnyɛ mu apula iyi izele iyi bɔkɔ e yi mu iwomo awu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Kwuyi Ungwu Omusita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Omatiyu 13.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Omaki 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Irɛsu iyi Ukpo i yi tee? Mi masa yi mbala mbe? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />I yi mate kwuyi ungwu omusita ungwu bɔkɔ onzu a ka e so mu utu wu. Kwu bulɔma kwu kwu uwɛyi, akwɛyi afyi umba oshi o kpo mu ende ngwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kwɔba Ungwu Otutu Owuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Omatiyu 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba e yo kwuyo kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mi masa Irɛsu iyi Ukpo mbala mbe? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />I yi mate otutu owuna uwu bɔkɔ okokpayi e to a vyi wu ma mbala etasa ɛla iyi umbwu nzhii ba i fye mɛsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kenzugwu Kambwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13">Omatiyu 7.13</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e to ɔgwuzɛ e sheye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, akwɛyi a zɛ mu ese iyɛku mbala iyɛri laa enzu ɛzu izɔma. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Akwɛyi onzu uwufo e yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, enzu umba bɔkɔ o fya isama o yi kɛkyi bi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;La lu kpapyi ka la lu zɛ mu kenzugwu kambwe, kwuwongu umbafo gyɔɔ, o gyakpɔ tee lo fye mo ba o fɔma. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Gba ada uwu kwogba e yimo e koko riku mo dɛ, lu ri mu kwudu mu kwuwo ilama mu riku lu zɔ tee, &lt;Ada, shɔɔkɔ wanzu riku mo nɛ!&gt; uwu ba a gba yi opwu tee, &lt;Mi yi mbaa bɔkɔ lu wɔ mo!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi lunyi lu gbawu opwu tee, &lt;Kinzu ki ri ba ki wo mbala ŋa, ŋɔ zɔ ɛzu mu ese nzu tete!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Uwu ba a za mba kpɔ tee, &lt;Mi yi mbaa bɔkɔ lu wɔ mo. La lu zɛ gbo minyi mi, lunyi enzu umbira mbɔlɛ!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ lu bu ma Aburamu mbala Aziki mbala Ɔzhɛkɔbu mbala anukenzu umbu Ukpo lɛɛbi mu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo, lunyi ba o toyo pyo mu kwudu, kwuye kwɔngu gba lu lɔga mbala ɛnyi ila mesu le! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Enzu o wɔ mu ɔnu kwoto mbala ononoyo, okanga uwu ɔnu kwoto mbala okanga uwu ononoyo, o ŋɔma mbaa odumudumu uwu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />La lu yitu yi tee, enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wambwambwa le kekelele, umba gba akwu wayemo le, umba bɔkɔ akwu wayemo le kekelele ba umba gba akwu wambwama le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idɛnyi Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Iyi Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Omatiyu 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu kya akwɛyi Afarisi umbafo o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;Lafya la kizɛ ngyɛlɛ kaa so munyawa, moo Ɛrɔdu a gyi tee la ngbɛ ŋɔ ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu so kaa la lu za la kangboga kanga tee: ɔnɛ mbala kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ mi ralaa ɛndu iyi ira ma, mi bo enzu ofya ma, ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ngwola ba mi mbwa ɛduma mi ma.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Tetete, ɔnɛ mbala kwɔnyikwɔlɛ mbala kwoyile kwɔle mi sheyimo la luzɛ mi; moo i shoshi tee lɔ ngbɛ anukenzu uwu Ukpo ma munamuna mo gba akwu mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mo.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />&lt;&lt;Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, Ɔzhɛrusalɛ! Ŋɔ ngbɛ anukenzu umba Ukpo ma, alɔgbulɔ umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a lɔmba munyi ŋɔ ba ŋɔ to mbo ekyi! Izhɛvɔ bɔkɔ mi gyikpɔ tee la mi kpala ɛmɛ ŋɔ ɛlu, kyamate ɛnu a kpala ɛmɛ wu ɛlu mu ekowo wu, ba lu nya mi ma mo! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />La lu yese, Ɔtɛpu yi o lu wu yi afyima-a. Gba mi so yi ele, lu gba lu ma mi fo nzhii ba ɔnuwu lu bu zɔ tee, &lt;Esheshi akwiyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu inyɔma mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Onzu Uwufo Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo kwukpɛnyi, Ɔzhizɔsi a ka te e ri kiya mogba uwu u to keyi uwu Afarisi uwufo; enzu ba o yewu mu eyi ibɔma. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ alɛ wu mbala ewo wu i nyɛma e bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo Afarisi mbala wa zɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛrama nzu i nyama tee lo bo onzu ofya ma ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo nana i nyima ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Enzu mbɔlɛ ba o gba wu opwu mo. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e towu, e bo wu ofya ma akwɛyi a za wu tee lakwuluzɛ wu.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Gba onzu ukpenyi e yi umɛshɛri naa e yi ɔzɛki uwu bɔkɔ a ta mu ɔbwuga ɔnu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo, e yimo kpara a wa wu ma mo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Enzu mbamba ba o yi opwu uwu o gbawu mu kwuyo kwɔlɛ mo.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ki To Ɛŋɔ Te Ŋɔ Kwu Kiya Kinyinyi Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma tee agboga ɔ mulɛ riyi ingyi inzumbɛku, akwɛyi a ba mba kwoba kwɔlɛ tee: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />&lt;&lt;Gba onzu a lɔ la ŋa tee bo mbaa odumudumu uwu oko itomo, ki to riyi ingyi iŋɔma ingyi inzumbɛku mo. Igboshimo onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka ŋa inzumbɛku ma o lɔ la wu tete. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Gba akwu tayi, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ la yi awu a nyɔ akwɛyi a za ŋa tee, &lt;Shi onzu ele kagyi ŋɔ.&gt; Akwɛyi lovya lu wo ŋɔ mo, akwɛyi ŋɔ bi to kagyi unga kembo. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Gba ba ɔ lɔ la ŋa mbaa odumudumu, to kagyi unga kembo, kaa kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ɔkwu uwu odumudumu e bo, a za ŋa tee, &lt;Umɛza mi, bo ka ŋɔma mu riyi ingyesheshi.&gt; Akwɛyi agboga umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ o shi ŋɔ igba iyɛkuu. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to ɛnwu e fulo kadu, o kala wu ma; onzu uwu a gyi ɛnwu ma ba o fulo wu mu kadu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa onzu uwu a lɔ laa wu awu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ lɔ laa enzu mbaa kiya irimo ingyi ɔnɔnda naa ingyi onoyo, ki lɔ laa ɛmɛza ŋa mo, naa ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ naa enzu umba kwɔmba ŋa, naa wanɔkpa ŋa umba o yi kwuwo mo, kwuwongu gba ŋɔ wo tayi, umba o gba ɔ lɔ la ŋa tete akwɛyi o waŋa kwusa ungwu kiya ingyi ŋɔ wo mbo. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Gba ŋɔ ŋi lɔ laa enzu mbaa odumudumu, lɔ laa ayirewa, wa mu alɛ ma, umba kinyɛ mbala epeyi; <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />akwɛyi ŋɔ fya esheshi ma kwuwongu enzu mbɔlɛ o do ŋɔ kwusa iwama mo. Ukpo gba a waŋa kwusa le ɔnu uwu bɔkɔ enzu umba ototo o bo yimo mu kwuvɔ awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Odumudumu Uwakwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Omatiyu 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso isomo, akwɛyi onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu kiya irimo mbala wu, a pwa iso ɛlɛ, a za laa Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu e be ri kiya mu odumudumu uwu Ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo e wo odumudumu uwakwu akwɛyi a lɔ laa enzu guruguru. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Tabɔkɔ kwuyengwu odumudumu kwu wo mo, akwɛyi a lɔ umɛgba wu kaa la za laa agboga wu tee, &lt;La lu bo ŋa, moo o mbwa ingyinangyina ma-a!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />&lt;&lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ lɛɛbi ba o le mu opwu ishimo kɛnyi kɛnyi. Onzu uwu kwonze a za laa umɛgba awu tee, &lt;Mi ya utu afyi ɛlɛ, mi ri mi bi yese wu mo dɛ; shɔɔkɔ ki wo amba mo moo mi ba mo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />&lt;&lt;Uwufo ba a zɔ tee, &lt;Mi ya endo wewo umba egba afyi ɛlɛ, mi ri mi bi pwa mba ma dɛ; shɔɔkɔ ki wo amba mo moo mi ba mo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />&lt;&lt;Uwufo kpɔ a zɔ tee, &lt;Mi to oko afyi ɛlɛ, kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi fya kapa mi nyɔ mo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />&lt;&lt;Umɛgba ele a gba yi e so adakwogba wu lɛɛbi. Amba o wo adakwogba wu ma akwɛyi a za laa umɛgba wu awu tee, &lt;Gyakpɔ wɔ kwudu kaa so mu ɛgwuzɛ mbala agbulɔ iyi kwuse, kaa ngye laa ayirewa, wa mu alɛ ma, epeyi mbala umba kinyɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />I to kwuye mo akwɛyi umɛgba awu a gbama akwɛyi a za laa ada kwogba wu tee, &lt;Ada kwogba, iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ lɔ mi mi wo ye-e, riyi ba ri shimo kpɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Akwɛyi ada kwogba ele a za laa umɛgba awu tee, &lt;So mu ɛgwuzɛ iyɛku mbala iyɛri, kaa za laa enzu tee lo bo, kaa kwogba mi lakwu nyɔlɔma. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Mi so yi, enzu umba bɔkɔ mi lɔ la mba kenze awu lɛɛbi, onzu ukpukpɛnyi mba e kyo mu odumudumu mi ele mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rigbɛ Ingyi Onzu U mbwalu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37">Omatiyu 10.37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:38">38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Ɔnu uwufo enzu gyɔɔ o yi mu luzɛ mbala Ɔzhizɔsi, e gele eyi munyi mbo akwɛyi a za mba tee, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />&lt;&lt;Gba onzu uwu bɔkɔ a nyɔ minyi mi kaa lakwu u vɔngɔ kiya mi ba e towo ete wu mbala anyi wu ma mo, naa oko wu mbala ɛmɛ wu, naa ɛmanyi wu anzɔnu mbala ɛmanyi wu eko, i kyo kwunyɔ wu ma tete mo, e domo tee akwu u vɔngɔ kiya mi mo. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Onzu uwu e to kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu wu ma kaa la mbwalu mi mo, e do tee akwu u vɔngɔ kiya mi mo.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Gba onzu meka yi a gyi tee le mbo kwogba ungwu oshi ba a ŋɔma e lo eduwo wu mesu kaa la ma shi i do wu ɛduma imbwama lɛɛbi dɛ mo? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Gba e wo tayi mo, a fala ugu awu imbwama mizhikembo iyi a ka kwosa; akwɛyi onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ma ngwu a nyɔngɔ wu ma. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Ɔzɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele e ye kambwu iyi kwogba imbomo ba a fangwa laa imbwama.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Gba ɔsu uwu e yi asozha edubu uwo e sheye mbaa ewa itomo mbala ɔsu uwufo uwu e yi asozha edubu uwo ekpepo, a ŋɔma e yese yi mo dɛ kaa la ma shi asozha wu edubu uwo mbɔlɛ o do ewa itomo mbala ɔsu uwu asozha edubu uwo ekpepo ele. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Gba e do tee e to ewa ɛlɛ ma mo, tabɔkɔ enzu mbamba o ndama bɛnɛ, a lɔ alɔgbulɔ mbaa ɔsu uwufo awu kaa lo lomesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa yi tee, &lt;&lt;Tatayi onzu uwunawuna meka yi uwu bɔkɔ a lafya laa kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ e yi ngyi mo, e do tee akwu u vɔngɔ kiya mi mo.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Otopwa Uwumbwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Omatiyu 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Omaki 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />&lt;&lt;Otopwa akwu kiya ingyeshi, tetete gba e bo rɛnu ma, kiya ingyi o wo wu kaa la gba laa rɛnu ma ki yi mo. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />O fu wu mo moo e sheshi tee lo fu wu mu utu naa kwoza fo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, onzu uwu e yi alu iyi ipwama ba la pwa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">&lt;&lt; Onzu uwu eyi alu iyi ipwama, la pwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Ilɔ Uwu E Tomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Omatiyu 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Ɔnu uwufo wana Oba uwɛzhi guruguru mbala enzu umba ingbomo o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi kaa lo pwa ɛzu izɔma wu, <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />akwɛyi Afarisi mbala wazɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi o le mu anu izɔma tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele a na enzu umba ingbomo ba a gba e ri kiya mbala mba bi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba kwɔlɛ tee: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />&lt;&lt;Gba onzu ukpɛnyi yi e yi ilɔ o deri akwɛyi ukpenyi mba e tomo. Onzu ele a lafya laa uwekperendo laa werendo mu ɔsɛ akwɛyi a ba gagyi ukpɛnyi ele nzhii ba e fye wu mo dɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Gba e fye wu mo, laa ɔnyɛ e fulo wu mu esuwo wu <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />akwɛyi e re wu mogba. A ya ɛmɛza wu ma mbala wanɔkpawu akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;La lu bo kaa lu mwɔnyɛ mbala mi moo ilɔ mi uwu bɔkɔ e tomo awu mi fye wu mo-o!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Tatayi, mi so yi, ɔnyɛ uwakwu uwu e yi moshi kwuwongu onzu ɛnyi uwu ingbomo uwu bɔkɔ a ta mɛzhi a ka uwu enzu uwekperendo laa werendo umba ototo umba bɔkɔ o yi ugɔ uwu itamɛzhi mo.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Eduwo Iyi I Tomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />&lt;&lt;Nana mate okokpayi e yi esuwo iyi esiliva akwɛyi kwukpɛnyi kwu ta wu ma--oko ele e wo tee? A ta kambu ɔyi, a vyɛ kwogba wu ma akwɛyi e yesemo munamuna nzhii ba e fye ngwu mo. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Gba e fye ngwu mo, a ya emoko wu ma mbala wanɔkpa wu akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;La lu bo kaa lu mwɔnyɛ mbala mi moo kwosiliva kwukpɛnyi mi ungwu kwu tami ma le mi fye ngwu mo-o.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Mi so yi ele, tee gba ii yi le, alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo ɔ mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu onzu uwu ingbomo ɛnyi uwu a ta mɛzhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Umɛ Uwu E Tomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo e yi ɛmɛ wepo. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Umɛ uwɛri awu a za laa eto wu tee, &lt;Ada, shi mi ogbo uwami uwu apula ŋa kekelele.&gt; Akwɛyi ete mbo a ka mba apula wu ma. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />&lt;Kwuye bwɛ akwɛyi umɛ uwɛri ele akwu apula ma lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyawu, akwɛyi e to ɔgwuzɛ wu a ka mu kwuse ungwu indama. Mɔmɔ gba e tutu eduwo wu ma mu apula iyi umbwa iwomo le. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Tabɔkɔ a mbwa kiya ingyinangyina wu ingbɛma, akwɛyi lonzu ndɔkwu lu fye mu ɛzhi ɛnyi lɛɛbi, akwɛyi e yi kiya kinyinyi fo. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Akwɛyi a ka gagyi ɛduma mbaa onzu uwufo uwu kusɛ kwɔngu, uwu ba e shi wu ɛduma mu utu uwu erusu ifyemo. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />A gyikpɔɔ tee le ri kiya ingyi bɔkɔ erusu o yi mu irimo awu, ba a fya onzu uwu e shi wu mo. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ egbo wu i gbama, akwɛyi a za lɛnwu wu tee, &lt;Ɛmɛgba lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma la ada lala, o ri kiya o shimo, Imi ba mi yi munɛ lonzu lu ngbɛ mi ma! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Mi yimo mi gba mi re mbaa adami akwɛyi mii za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, mi ngbo Ukpo mo, mi ngbo ŋɔ mo tete. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Mi fate lo ya mi tee umɛ ŋɔ fo; wo mi mate onzu uwu ɛduma ŋa ukpɛnyi tayi.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Akwɛyi e yimo a ka mbaa ete wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">&lt;&lt;Tabɔkɔ ete wu a ma wu shaaru tee e yi mu inyɔma; akwɛyi inyashi wu i wo wu mo, a rɛnya a ma umɛ wu ele gbamu akwɛyi a kpa wu idu. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi umɛ ele a za la ete wu tee, &lt;Ada, mi ngbo Ukpo mo, mi ngbo ŋɔ mo tete. Mi fa te lo ya mi tee umɛ ŋɔ fo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ete wu ba a ya ɛmɛgba wu ma akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;La lu gyakpɔ! La lu bo la origa uwu bɔkɔ e sheshi a ka le la lu lo wu. La lu lo wu karika mu ɛfyi wu mbala ekpoyata mu alɛ wu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />La lu bo la endo uwakwu la lu ngbɛ wu ma. La ki wo odumudumu la ki mwɔnyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Moo umɛ mi ele e kpomo, ba a gba la kwunyɔ; e tomo ba o gba o ma wu-o.&gt; Akwɛyi o le mu odumudumu iwomo.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Kwuye kwɔngu umɛ uwakɔ ba e yi mu utu. Tabɔkɔ e bo kɛlɛ mbala kwogba, akwɛyi a pwa anu iyi anga mbala eko. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Akwɛyi a ya umɛgba ukpenyi ma akwɛyi e yo wu tee, &lt;Kimbe ba ki yi mu iwomo munɛ?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Akwɛyi umɛgba awu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;Umɛnɛ ŋɔ a gbama e bo mogba-a, ada ŋa ba a ngbɛ wu endo uwakwu kwuwongu umɛnɛ ŋɔ a gbama moloto mbala okpara uwɛmu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />&lt;&lt;Umɛ uwakɔ ele e wo amba akwɛyi e towu ifyemo mogba; eto wu a wɔ kwudu akwɛyi a kpawu ɛshɛku tee le fyemo mogba. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Uwu ba a gba ete wu opwu tee, &lt;Ada yese! Lɔri ndɔlɛ gyɔɔ undu mi ye ŋɔ mu ɛduma iwomo mate unye tayi ba mi ye ŋɔ mu ilomo. Ŋɔ shi mi mbe dɛ-ɛ? Ɔniyi te ŋɔ di shi mi umɛ uwɛmu te la mi ngbɛ ma kaa la mi mwɔnyɛ mbala ɛmɛza mi mo! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Umɛ ŋɔ ele uwu bɔkɔ a ka ngbɛ kiya ŋa ɛdɔ ma mbala wato kaya ba a gbama mogba, akwɛyi ŋɔ ngbɛ wu endo uwakwu!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ete wu ba a za wu tee, &lt;Umɛ mi,&gt; &lt;uŋɔ ŋɔ yi mbala mi munɛ kwuyengwunanguna, kiya ingyinangyina bɔkɔ mi yi ngyi akwu ingyaŋa. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ishoshi tee la ki mwɔnyɛ la ki yi ubwu uruwu, moo umɛnɛ ŋɔ ele e kpomo akwɛyi a gba lakwunyɔ; e tomo ba o gba o fye wu mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu U bɔ Eyi Mu Kiya Umwuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu kwuwo uwufo e yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a bɔ eyi mu kiya wu. Onzu uwu kwuwo ele a ŋɔ te akwɛyi o kawu laa iso tee onzu u bɔ eyi mu kiya wu awu e yi mu kiya wu ɛdɔ ingbɛma, <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />akwɛyi a ya wu ma e yo wu tee, &lt;Kimbe ba mi yi mu ipwama mu reshi ŋɔ te? So mi ewo iyi ŋɔ yi mu iwomo mbala kiya mi, moo ŋɔ kwu u bɔ eyi mu kiya mi fo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Akwɛyi u bɔ eyi mu kiya ele a za la ɛnwu tee, &lt;Mi wo tee kekelele bɔkɔ adakwogba mi a ŋa ramima mu ɛduma mi le? Mi yi ekpasu iyi egba mo, Imi ba mi wo lovya undu kwoya indama. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Mi yitu kiya ingyi mi wo! Akwɛyi gba o ra mi ma mu ɛduma munɛ, mi yi ɛmɛza umba bɔkɔ o na mi mu agba mba.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Akwɛyi a ya enzu ma lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o kwo laa kwokpa ungwu ada kwogba awu. E yo onzu uwu kwonze tee, &lt;Ŋɔ kwo laa kwokpa ungwu ada kwogba mi ungwu ɛvɔ?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />&lt;&lt;A gba wu opwu tee, &lt;Egalo oderi iyi anyi umba ɔlifu.&gt; Akwɛyi u bɔ eyi mu kiya ele a za wu tee, &lt;Na kwupu, ŋɔma, ka te uwo ɛkpɛlɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />&lt;Akwɛyi e yo onzu uwopo tee, &lt; Uŋɔ kɔ kwokpa ŋa akwu ɛvɔ?&gt; A gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Eburuma odubu ukpɛnyi iyi owiti.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;U bɔ eyi mu kiya ele a za wu tee, &lt;Na kwupu, ka tee ederi eranda.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi adakwogba a pwɔ Umɛgba u rɔzawu ele ma kwuwongu kwuwoyo wu; Moo enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o yi kwuwoyɔ iwomo iyi luzɛ izɛma mbala ɛmanyi mba umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o ka enzu umba ɛbɛ ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e so wu mu isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ele, la lu fya ɛmɛza lɛnwu yi mu kiya ingyi kwuwo ingyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, kwuwongu kaa gba ki bomo, o na ŋa mu kwogba ungwɔkpɔ.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ o nyama la wu mu apula iyɛri, o nyama la wu mu apula iyɛku tete; onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo ongbulolo mu apula iyɛri mo, e wo ongbulolo mu apula iyɛku mo tete. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Gba o nyama la ŋa mu i bɔ eyi mu kiya ingyi kwuwo ingyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, uwe ba a ra la kiya ingyi kwuwo ingyi ongbulolo e lo ŋɔ mɔ wu? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Tetee, gba lu bɔ eyi ɔnyɛnyɛ mu apula iyi onzu mo, uwe ba e shi yi apula iyi afyi yi?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />&lt;&lt;Onzu ukpɛnyi akwu umɛgba uwu ada umba kwogba wepo mo; moo e towo ukpɛnyi ma akwɛyi ba a gyi uwufo, naa e lo ukpɛnyi mo akwɛyi ba a zhi uwufo mo. Ŋɔ do te ŋɔ gbo ɔya la Ukpo mbala eduwo kwuye kwunyi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɛzɔ Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Iyifo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Omatiyu 11.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Omaki 10.11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Kwuye ungwu Afarisi o pwa ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, akwɛyi o wo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuwongu umba o kpoluku undu eduwo. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;Lunyi gba lu zɔ enzu tee lu kwu watoto le; Ukpo ba e yitu iyi egbo yi. Apula iyi bɔkɔ enzu o to yi laa igba, akwu kiya kinyinyi mo umba Ukpo.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Ɛrɛma iyi Omosisi mbala ɛzɔ iyi anukenzu umbu Ukpo gba enzu o mbwalu le nzhii ba kwuyengwu Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima e bo. Ngbaa tayi awu gba iso iyeshi iyi irɛsu iyi Ukpo o ye yi mu anu itama le, onzu uwunawuna ba e yi mu i bɔ kyikyi te le fye mo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Itomo iyi oshi mbala ɛzhi i ka fulele laa kwulakyɛ ungwu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi tee li tomo. <verse eid="LUK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu a ra laa oko wu ma akwɛyi e to oko awa, a yama; onzu uwu e to oko uwu o ra wu ma, a yama tete.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onzu U Yi Kwuwo Mbala Ɔlazarɔsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />&lt;&lt;O yi Onzu uwufo mekyi uwu e yi kwuwo uwu e lo eriga iyi i ka abwa le ba e yi mu ɔnyɛ kwɔfyi kwɔfyi. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ɔyirɛwa uwufo o ya wu tee Ɔlazarɔ, uwu bɔkɔ ɛnwu lɛɛbi akwu ashinakpa. O koko bo wu o shi mu kenzugwu unga kwogba ungwu onzu uwu kwuwo ele kaa la nda kwoya, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />uwu ba a gyikpɔ tee le ri kiya ingyi irimo ingyi onzu uwu kwuwo ele e yi mu irimo akwɛyi ki fumo mɛzhi. Izu lala o bo o lɛ ashinakpa wu ma. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye kwu bo ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔlazarɔ e kpomo akwɛyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo o to wu mo o ka wu kaa la ŋɔma mbala Aburamu mu oshi. Onzu uwu kwuwo ele e kpomo tete akwɛyi o pwuwumo. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />E yi mu kwogba ungwu ɔyi mbaa bɔkɔ e yi mu inyashi imama iyɛku, e yi eyefaa akwɛyi a ma Aburamu shaaru mbala Ɔlazarɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Akwɛyi a yama, &lt;Ada Aburamu! Ma inyashi mi kaa lɔ Ɔlazarɔ kaa le lo ɛfyi wu mu embyi kaa la la mi mu ɔtunɛ le gbo mi ugbɛmbyi mo, moo mi yi mu inyashi imama mu ɔyi ɔlɛ!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Aburamu ba a za wu tee, &lt;Umɛ mi, lolo mu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ ye la kwunyɔ, ŋɔ yi kiya ingyinangyina ingyesheshi, Ɔlazarɔ ba a ma inyashi. Kekelele ɛnwu i ye wu mu igbomo munɛ-ɛ uŋɔ ba ŋɔ yi mu inyashi imama. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Akwu inyi kɛɛkyi mo, kwuvɔ ungwɔkwu kwu yi mekeka iyi kinzu mbala yi, kaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi munɛ uwu a gyi tee la sama le so munyi i wo wu mo mo, naa onzu e do mo tee a wo munyi yi a sama a nyɔ munyi nzu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Akwɛyi onzu uwu kwuwo ele a zɔ tee, &lt;Ada mi kpa ŋa ɛshɛku, ba lɔ Ɔlazarɔ kaa le so mu kwogba ungwu ada mi, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />moo mi yi ɛmɛnɛ anzɔnu walɔ mɔmɔ. Le so le so mbo tee lo gboshoshi, kaa umba tete lo bo mu kizɛ ngyi wɔnu ngyɛlɛ mo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />&lt;&lt;Aburamu ba a gba opwu tee, &lt;Ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ o yi ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala ɛzɔ iyi anukenzu umba Ukpo; umba lo shi alu mu iso mbo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Onzu uwu kwuwo ele a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;&lt;I yi tayi mo, ada Aburamu! Gba onzu uwufo a wɔ mu aleku a ka munyi mbo, o ta mɛzhi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Akwɛyi Aburamu a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba enzu mbɔlɛ o pwa iso iyi Omosisi mbala anukenzu umba Ukpo mo, onzu uwu e kpomo ba a gba laa iyimo lala o nyama laa iso wu mo.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ingbomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6">Omatiyu 18.6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Omaki 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee: &lt;&lt;Apula iyi i shi enzu o ngbomo mɛga i nyɔ, tetete gbetu akwiyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ i zɛ mawu gba i bo le! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Gba o ma wu riko mu kwɔrɔ akwɛyi o ta wu mu risu lala i kpo wu i ka iyi bɔkɔ ee shi tee ɛmɛ mbɛri mbɔlɛ tee lo ngbomo. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ la lu lu gboshoshi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">&lt;&lt;Gba umɛnɛ ŋɔ e ngbo ŋɔ mo, to wu mo, gba a ta ŋa mɛzhi, gba yi kpa wu. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Gba e ngbo ŋɔ mo izhi erewo ɔnuyi, a gba e bo munyi ŋɔ izhi erewo a zɔ tee, &lt;Mi ta mɛzhi,&gt; mɛga gba yi kpa wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ikwidufulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Wa zɛ ilɔ o za laa Ɔkwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kyo nzu ikwu idu lu fulo nzu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;Gba lu yi ikwu idu lu fulo iyɛri mate kwuyi ungwu omusita tee, lu do tee lu za laa uwɛyi uwu omuberi ɔlɛ tee, &lt;Ngbɛ bwu so kaa ta mu risu!&gt; Uwu ba u wo iyi bɔkɔ lu so awu.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɛduma Iyi Umɛgba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />&lt;&lt;Uwe mekeka yi uwu bɔkɔ e yi umɛgba uwu bɔkɔ a gba wu ma naa a pya wu ilɔ, tabɔkɔ umɛgba wu a gbama mu utu akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;bo kekelele kaa ŋɔma ka ri kiya&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ayimo ŋɔ so wu tayi mo! Ŋɔ za wu tee, &lt;Wo mi kiya ingyirimo, yi ɛnwu ŋɔ ma kaa rigbo mi kaa la mi ri, la mi wo dɛ; akwɛyi mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ ŋɔ nɔma kaa ri kiya.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />O gbɛlɛ umɛgba ɛnyi kwuwongu e wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ifate le wo? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Tatayi gba i yi le mbala yi; kwuyengwu lu mbwa kiya inginangyina ingyi o za yi tee la lu wo iwomo, la lu zɔ te, &lt;Kinzu ki kwu ɛmɛgba bi; ɛduma iya nzu gba ki wo le.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Enzu Wewo Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu luzɛ e she mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, a zɛ mu ufye uwu Osamariya mbala Ogalili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu luzɛ tee e fye mu kwuse ungwɛri ungufo, akwɛyi enzu wewo umba o yi ofya umbu embyi umbɔyi o kpolo wu. O ri shaaru, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />akwɛyi o yama kpaa tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi! Adakwogba! Ma eyembembyi nzu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma mba, akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu so kaa ebwoshi umba Ukpo lo yese yi mo.&gt;&gt; Tabɔkɔ o fulo mo akwɛyi ofya mba u bo mo.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Tabɔkɔ ukpɛnyi mekeka mba a ma te ofya wu u bomo, a lugbama laa Ukpo iduma mu opwu uwɔkwu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />A ta ɛnwu mɛzhi mu idu Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi a gbɛlɛ wu ɛnyi. Onzu ele ba akwu onzu uwu Osamariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu enzu wewo gba o bo mbo ofya ma le mo re? Werendo washimo mbamba o yi mu na? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />O fya onzu ukpɛnyi tee la gbama le gbo oya laa Ukpo mo, ugboga ele kɛɛkyi gba a gbama le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Yimo kaa kwuluzɛ ŋɔ; ikwu idu fulo ŋɔ i bo ŋɔ ofya ma-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyɔma Iyi Irɛsu Iyi Ukpo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Omatiyu 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Ɔnu uwufo Afarisi umbafo o yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo meka iyi kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Irɛsu iyi Ukpo i nyɔ. A gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Irɛsu iyi Ukpo i nyɔ mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ o mayi mo. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Onzu a zɔ tee, &lt;Yese, i ŋɔ le!&gt; naa &lt;I ŋaawu&gt;; kwuwongu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo iyi mbala yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma ungwu lunyi lu gyi tee la lu ma kwɔfyi kwunyi mu afyi iyi Umɛ uwu Onzu, ishi ba lu ma ngwu mo. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Enzu o za yi tee, &lt;Yese, a ŋaawu!&gt; naa, &lt;Yese, munɛ!&gt; La lu wɔ kwudu kaa lu gagyi yi mo <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kwɔfyi ungwu igbama ungwu Umɛ uwu Onzu kwu yi mate imingɔma iyi lɔwu tayi akwɛyi ɛbɛ i zɔ munamuna. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Uwu ba a ma wɔnu gyɔɔ dɛ akwɛyi enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ o towumo.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Matee bɔkɔ i wo mu kwuyengwu Onowa awu tatayi gba i wo le mu kwuyengwu igbama ungwu Umɛ uwu Onzu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Enzu o kpakpɛɛ mu irimo mbala iwomo, eko itomo mbala anu iyama, nzhii ba kwɔfyi ungwu bɔkɔ Onowa e fye mu kwoda, akwɛyi Ukpo e tumo uwakwu, embyi o lomo akwɛyi o ri mbo mo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />I wo mate kwuyengwu Ɔlɔtu tayi tete. Enzu o kpakpɛɛ mu irimo mbala iwomo, ewo ifulomo, apula isomo, mbala agba imbomo. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ɔnu uwu bɔkɔ Ɔlɔtu a lafya la Ɔsɔdɔmu, ɔyi mbala akurungba iyi ɔyi iwɔ mu oshi i wolo mbo mo lɛɛbi.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Tayi gba i yi le ɔnu uwu o bɔ zɔ Umɛ uwu Onzu ma awu. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Mu kwɔfyi kwɔngu, onzu uwunawuna uwu e yi mu kɛnu unga kwogba wu, la kalama tee le bo le to apula wu mogba mo; tatayi onzu uwu e yi mu utu la gba le so mogba mo. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />La lu lolo oko uwu Ɔlɔtu! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gyikpɔ tee ee gbo kwunyɔ wu ma, kwu to wu mo; onzu uwu bɔkɔ e towo kwunyɔ wu ma ba, ee gbo ungwu mo. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Imi mi so yi, mu utu uwu bɔkɔ ɛlɛ i bi wo awu, enzu wepo o yi mu ondo ikpolomo mu ɔkyɔ ukpɛnyi: o to onzu ukpɛnyi ma ba o lafya la uwufo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Eko wepo o yi mu ikpomo kyaa: o to ukpɛnyi ma ba o lafya la uwufo. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Enzu wepo o yi mu utu: o to ukpɛnyi ma ba o lafya la uwufo.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu muna ŋa, Ɔkwu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mbaa bɔkɔ abwu o yi le gba eperemi o kpala ɛlu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Oko U Kpo Ɔnu ma Mbala U Zɔ Ombwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba kwoba la Wavɔngɔkiya wu kaa la zɔ mba tee lo koko lo lɛ Ukpo, lo fɛwo mo. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />A za mba tee: &lt;&lt;Mu kwuse ungufo, o yi u zɔ ombu uwu bɔkɔ a riyi iyi Ukpo mo ba e lo enzu ma mo. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Oko u kpɔnuma uwufo e yi mu kwuse kwɔngu tete, uwu bɔkɔ e koko a ka mbaa u zɔ ombu ele a za wu tee, &lt;To mi ombu mo mbala ɔgɛwa mi!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />&lt;&lt;U zɔ ombu ele e to kwuye gbulɔlɔ a nyama mo. Akwɛyi a mbwa a za la ɛnwu tee, &lt;Imi mi yitu tee mi riyi iyi Ukpo mo ba mi lo enzu ma mo, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />tete kwuwongu bɔkɔ oko ukpɔnuma ele a lu mi afyima mo le, mi to wu ombu mo, moo ee shi ɛnwu i gbo mi mo kwuwongu i bɔ kwushi wu!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Akwɛyi Ɔkwu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu pwa iyi u zɔ ombu uwura ele a zɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ba Ukpo e to ombu mo la umba bɔkɔ a ŋa mba bɔkɔ o lo wu oga utu la ɔnu kaa la mbwamba mo? Ee towo mbo mo iyɔkpɔ re? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Imi mi so yi, efyefya gba e to mbo ombu mo le. Ishi, kwuyengwu Umɛ uwu Onzu a ba nyɔ awu, a fya wakwu idu lu fulo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Ofarisi Mbala U Na Ɔbawɛzhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba meka iyi enzu umbafo bɔkɔ o ma ɛmba tee umba akwu enzu umba ototo akwɛyi o zhi uwewe ma. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Ɔnu uwufo enzu wepo o ka mu Ɔtɛpu mbaa Ukpo ilɛma: Ukpɛnyi akwu Ofarisi, uwufo ba akwu u na Oba uwɛzhi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Ofarisi ele e yimo a rima akwɛyi a lɛ Ukpo a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo mi gbɛlɛ ŋɔ ɛnyi kwuwongu mi yi mate enzu umbafo mo; mi yi ekweyi mo, mi wɛlɔ mo, mi wo ira mo, mi yama mo. Mi ngbede mi yi mate u na oba uwɛzhi ele mo. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Mi wo kenyo izhepo mu orondo ukpɛnyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ mi fya lɛɛbi mi shi Ukpo ogbo ukpɛnyi mekeka iyi uwo.<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ishi u na Oba uwɛzhi awu ba a rima shaaru. A nyama tee e yi eyefaa e yese mu oshi mo, e lo reshi mɛzhi akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;Ukpo, ma inyashi mi, Imi mi kwu onzu uwu ingbomo!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mi gyite la mi so yi tee, u na oba uwɛzhi ele gba a ka mogba laa ɔpɛriri mu idu iyi Ukpo le, moo akwu Ofarisi awu mo. Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu a ra la ɛnwu e fulo kadu, o gba wu mɛzhi, uwu ba a gba la ɛnwu mu ɛzhi o fulo wu kadu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fulo Ɛmɛshɛri Ewo Mu Reshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Omatiyu 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Omaki 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Enzu umbafo o bo laa ɛmɛ mba mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi tee le fulo mbo ewo mu reshi. Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ma ɛlɛ, akwɛyi o kpamba ɛyi, <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a ya ɛmɛshɛri mbɔlɛ ma tee lo bo munyi wu akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu lafya laa ɛmɛshɛri lo bo mbaa mi, la lu nyi mba ma mo, moo Irɛsu iyi Ukpo akwiyi mbɔlɛ tee. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ongbulolo gba mi so yi ele! Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a na Irɛsu iyi Ukpo mate umɛshɛri a na mo, e fye ma yi gbee mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsu U Yi Kwuwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Omatiyu 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Omaki 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />U to keyi uwu Azhu uwufo e yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Uzɔ kiya uwu eshi, kimbe ba mii wo kaa la mi fya kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔ ma ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ŋɔ ya mi tee onzu uwu eshi?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu eshi e yi mo, Ukpo kɛɛkyi gba e shoshi le. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ŋɔ yi ɛrama lo: I zɔ tee, &lt;Ki yama mo, ki ngbɛ onzu mo, ki wu ɛlɔ mo, ki to izɔgɔ iyi angba mo, lomo la ada ŋa mbala Ɛnɛ ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Onzu awu ba a za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mi mbwalu yi-e ngbaa te mi kwu umɛshɛri le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyi fo ki shimo kpɔ. Ya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔ ŋɔ yi ngyi kaa shi ayirewa eduwo ɛnyi, akwɛyi ŋɔ yi kiya ingyi kwuwo moshi; akwɛyi bo kaa mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Tabɔkɔ onzu ele a pwa tayi, e wo ubwu ugyi gyɔɔ, kwuwongu akwu onzu uwu kwuwo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mawu tee ubwu wu e fomo, akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;I kɔma kaa onzu uwu e yi kwuwo le fye mu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />I ka fulele le kaa Onyakurumi le fyemo mu ɔtu uwu keyi, la ifyemo iyi onzu uwu e yi kwuwo mu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso ɛlɛ, o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ba uwe bɔkɔ e do tee a fya isama ma ngyɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyi onzu e do ngyi iwomo mo, Ukpo e do ngyi iwomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Akwɛyi Opita a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Yese! Ki lafya laa agba nzu ki mbwalu ŋɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ee mi yitu.&gt;&gt; Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu a lafya la kwogba wu naa oko wu, naa ɛmanyi wu, naa ete wu mbala anyi wu, naa ɛmɛ wu kwuwongu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />bɔkɔ a na rigbɛ gyɔɔ mu ɔyi ɔlɛ mbala kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ mu ɔyi uwu u bu nyɔ awu mo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Kwu Epa Iyi Lukwu Wu Kpɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Omatiyu 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Omaki 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Ɔzhizɔsi e to Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo la wepo a kamba mɛmba, akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu pwa! Kekelele ki sheye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbaa bɔkɔ apula iyi anukenzu o ka meka iyi Umɛ uwu Onzu awu lɛɛbi i nyɔlɔma. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Oo ra wu o shi enzu umba akwu Azhu mo, o wo wu ɛnɛ, o kpa wu ari, akwɛyi o kpo wu ɔtɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />O kpawu ikpa akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ma, ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwɔla ba a gba la iyimo la kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu ba ɔ zɔngɔma ikpikpɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ e so mbo le mo. Iluma yi invye mbo mo, o zɔngɔma iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so mbo le mo.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Upeyi U Nda Kwoya Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Omatiyu 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Omaki 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a nda la Ozheriko fo, akwɛyi a ma upeyi tee a ŋɔ mu kenzu unga ɔgwuzɛ a nda kwɔya. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Tabɔkɔ a pwa tee riba ingyi enzu o yi mu ikakama, akwɛyi e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki yi mu iwomo munɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />O za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti gba e yi mu ikakama le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Akwɛyi a ta opwu kpaa tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi, Umɛ uwu Odevidi, ma inyashi mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o to keyi o kpa wu ɛyi akwɛyi o za wu tee la kpala kenzu mo. Uwu ba a kpakpɛɛ mu opwu itarama tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ uwu Odevidi ma inyashi mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a rima akwɛyi a za mba tee, lo kawu laa onzu ele. Tabɔkɔ e bo kɛlɛ, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu kwuyo tee, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;Kimbe ba ŋɔ gyi tee la mi wo ŋɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">A gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, mi gyi tee la mi gba laa ɛbɛ imama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba laa ɛbɛ imama! Ikwidufulo ŋɔ i bo ŋɔ ofya ma-a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Mɔmɔɔmɔ onzu awu a ma ɛbɛ akwɛyi a mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi laa Ukpo iduma. Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o ma ɛlɛ, umba tete o du Ukpo ma.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Ɔzakiyɔsu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu Ozheriko akwɛyi a zɛ mekeka iyi kwuse. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Onzu ukpɛnyi e yi mɔmɔ o ya wu tee Ɔzakiyɔsu u to keyi uwu oba uwɛzhi inama, uwu ba e yi kwuwo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />A gyi tee la ma Ɔzhizɔsi, ba i wo wu mo mo kwuwongu riba ingyi enzu ri gama uwu ba akwu odari. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Akwɛyi a renya a ka keyi akwɛyi a ya mu uwɛyi uwu Osikamo ka la ma Ɔzhizɔsi, kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu inyɔma mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔwu.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e bo mu riyi ngyɛngyi, e yese mu oshi akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzakiyɔsu, kalama efyefya. Ɔnɛnɛ, mogba ŋa gba mi kpo le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Ɔzakiyɔsu a kalama efyefya akwɛyi a na wu laa ɔnyɛ uwakwuu.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Tabɔkɔ riba ingyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ o ma ɛlɛ, akwɛyi o le mu anu izɔma tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele a ka kwu ugboga uwu onzu uwu &lt;ingbomo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Akwɛyi Ɔzakiyɔsu e yimo a rima akwɛyi a za laa Ɔkwu tee, &lt;&lt;Pwa, adakwogba! Kwurizhi ungwu kiya ingyi mi yi ngyi, mi rangyi mi shi ayirewa. Gba mi na kiya ingyi uturimo kikpɛnyi mu kwuwo ungwu onzu, mi wa wu kwɔkpa ngyi ma izhendo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Isama i bo mu kwogba ngwɔlɛ ɔnɛ-ɛ, moo onzu ele akwu umɛ uwu Aburamu tete. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Umɛ uwu Onzu e bo te la gagyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o tomo kaa la sa mba ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Esepo Uwo Iyi Ogolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Omatiyu 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Tabɔkɔ enzu o yi mu iso ɛlɛ ipwama bɛnɛ, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a ba mba kwoba kwowa. A nda la Ɔzhɛrusalɛ fo akwɛyi enzu o ma te Irɛsu iyi Ukpo i nyɔ mu kwotota kwɔngu. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwakwu uwufo a lafya la kwuse wu a ka mu kwuse ungufo ungwu indama kaa lo towu ɛsu dɛ kaa la gbama le. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />A ya ɛmɛgba wu wewo ma dɛ gba e to ɔgwuzɛ uwu luzɛ wu le. E shi onzonzu kwoso ungwu ogolu kwukpɛnyi akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;La lu fulo ewo ma yi nzhii ba mi bi gbama.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />&lt;&lt;Enzu umba kwuse wu ba o gyi wu mo akwɛyi o lɔ alɔgbulɔ o mbwalu izhikembo wu kaa lɔ zɔ tee, &lt;Kinzu ki gyi tee onzu ele lakwu ɔsu nzu mo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />&lt;&lt;Tetete o towu ɛsu akwɛyi a gbama e bo mogba. Tabɔkɔ e fye mogba akwɛyi a lɔma laa ɛmɛgba wu umba bɔkɔ e shi mbo eduwo awu kaa le yo kwuyo ungwu kwule ungwu o fya. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />&lt;&lt;Umɛgba uwu kwonze e bo akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;Adakwogba, mi gba mi fya esepo iyi ogolu uwo mi kyo mu ogolu kwukpɛnyi ungwu ŋɔ shi mi awu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Adakwogba a gbɛlɛ wu ɛnyi a za wu tee, &lt;Gbɛgyɛ iyi iwomo, ŋɔ kwu umɛgba uwesheshi!&gt; Kwuwongwu ŋɔ bɔ eyi mu kiya ingyɛri awu, mi shi ŋɔ ɛsu iyi ese uwo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Umɛgba uwopo e bo akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;Adakwogba, mi gba mi fya esepo iyi ogolu ɛlɔ mi kyo mu ogolu kwukpɛnyi ungwu ŋɔ shi mi awu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Adakwogba a za wu tee, &lt;Mi shi ŋɔ ɛsu iyi ese ɛlɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Umɛgba uwufo e bo akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;Adakwogba, kwoso ungwu ogolu ŋɔ kwu ŋɔ le; mi nvye ngwumo mu kwukokpayi. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Mi wiyi ŋɔ, kwuwongu ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu a kɔma. Ŋɔ to kiya ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyaŋa mo, ŋɔ lɔ mbaa ŋɔ somo mo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Akwɛyi Adakwogba wu a za wu tee, &lt;mu ogolu kwukpɛnyi ungwu ŋɔ shi mi awu.&gt; Uŋɔ umɛgba uwu ra ele! Iso iyi kenzu ŋɔ gba mi ra yi mi zɔ ombu ŋɔ le! Uŋɔ ŋɔ yitu tee mi kwu onzu uwu a kɔma, mi to kiya ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyami mo ba mi lɔ mbaa bɔkɔ mi somo mo. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kimbe ki wo ba ŋɔ shi eduwo mi mu ugu uwu eduwo kaa kwuyengwu mi gbama, la mi na yi ma mbala kwule mo?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi a za laa umba bɔkɔ o ri kɛlɛ mbala wu awu tee, &lt;La lu na kwoso ungwu ogolu kwukpɛnyi kwɔngu ma mu kwuwo wu kaa lu shi ngwu onzu uwu e yi esepo iyi ogolu uwo awu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Umba ba o za wu tee, &lt;Adakwogba, moo ele e yi esepo iyi ogolu uwo-o mɛɛ!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Uwu ba a gbamba opwu tee, &lt;Mi gyite lami so yi tee onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi kiya, o kyo wungyi mo; onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi kiya mo, ingyi e yi ngyi bwɛɛ awu lala o na wu ngyi ma. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Kekelele enzu umbeyi mi umba bɔkɔ o gyi tee la mi kwu ɔsu mba mo awu, la lu bo mbo tee kaa lu ngbɛ mba ma mu idu mi!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fye Mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Omatiyu 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Omaki 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ɔzhɔnu 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa ɛlɛ isomo, akwɛyi e to keyi o le mu luzɛ o sheye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Tabɔkɔ a ka kɛlɛɛ mbala ese iyi Ɔbɛtifagi mbala Ɔbɛtani mu Lɔwa undu Olivu, o ya wu tee Lɔwa ungwu Olivu awu, akwɛyi a lɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu wepo ma, a za mba tee, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />&lt;&lt;La lu so mu kwuse ungwu kwu ŋɔ mu keyi yi awu; gba lu yi mu ifyemo, lu ma ɔzɛki ta o ma wu ma mɔmɔ, uwu bɔkɔ o do ya ma wu dɛ mo. La lu vuvu wu ma ka lu ka mi wu munɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Gba onzu uwunawuna e yo yi kwuyo tee, kimbe ki wo ba lu vuvu wu ma, la lu za wu tee, Adakwogba e yi ugɔ wu.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ɛmɛgba umba bɔkɔ o lɔ mba ma awu o ka mɔmɔ akwɛyi o du yi kyamate ba Ɔzhizɔsi e so mbo awu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu ɔzɛki awu ivuvuma, akwɛyi ada uwu kiya e ngyi akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ lu vuvu ɔzɛki ele ma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba e yi ugɔ wu,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />akwɛyi o to ɔzɛki awu o ka wu laa Ɔzhizɔsi. O fulo ekpayi mba mu kadu unga ɔzɛki akwɛyi o to Ɔzhizɔsi o fulo mawu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Tabɔkɔ o zɛ o sheyimo, enzu o ya ekpayi mba ma mu ɔgwuzɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Kwuye ungwu e bo kɛlɛɛ mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, mbaa bɔkɔ ɔgwuzɛ u solo u ka mbaa Lɔwa undu Olifu awu, akwɛyi riba ingyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu lɛɛbi o le mu Ukpo ɛnyi igbɛlɛma laa iduma wu mu opwu uwɔkwu kwuwongu ɛduma iyi izele iyi bɔ o ma: <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />O za la isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo le shi ɔnyɛ laa ɔsu uwu bɔkɔ e bo mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu! Oloto moshi mbala inzumbɛku akwiyi Ukpo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Akwɛyi Afarisi umbafo mɛmi iyi riba ngyɛ ngyi o za laa Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Omale, kpa Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa ɛyi kaa lo kpala kenzu mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi, gba enzu mbɔlɛ o kpala kenzu mo lala, ekyi ɛlɛ i le mu anu iwɔma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi E Loga Kwuwongwu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Matee ba e bo kɛlɛɛ mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ akwɛyi a ma kwuse kwɔngu, e loga kwuwongu, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Gba uŋɔ ele la ŋɔ yitu iyi kwɔfyi kwɔlɛ kiya ingyi ki ka ŋa la oloto! Kekelele ba ŋɔ do te ŋɔ ma yi mo! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma bɔkɔ agewa yi o mbo kwukoga o lo yi meka, o lo yi kwukpo akwɛyi o fula yi ma munamuna. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Uŋɔ mbala enzu ŋɔ lɛɛbi o ngbɛ yi ma; o lafya laa kwokyi kwukpɛnyi te mu riyi ngwu mo, kwuwongu ŋɔ zɔngɔma kwuye ungwu Ukpo e bo te kaa laa sayima mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ka Mu Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Omatiyu 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Omaki 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ɔzhɔnu 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu ɔtɛpu akwɛyi e le mu enzu umba bɔkɔ o ya apula ma irama, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;O ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu Iso iyi Ukpo tee, &lt;Ɔtɛpu mi akwu kwogba ungwu Ukpo ilɛma.&gt; Lunyi ba lu rangwu lu wo kizɛ ingyi invyemo ingyi awɛlɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kwɔfyi kwɔfyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ ɛzu mu Ɔtɛpu. Eboshi umbakɔ, mbala wazɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala wa to keyi umba enzu mbamba ba o gyi tee lɔ ngbɛ wu ma, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />umba ba o fya ɔgwuzɛ wu ma mo kwuwongu enzu lɛɛbi o ŋɔma o yi mu iso wu ipwama, o gyi tee iso wu ikpikpɛnyi te li pika mba mo.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="ms">Kwuyo Mekeka Iyi Ɛkpasu Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Omatiyu 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Omaki 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ɔnu uwufo, kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu enzu ɛzu izɔma mu Ɔtɛpu mbala anu itama iyi Iso Iyesheshi ɛlɛ, akwɛyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wazɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi, i kyo mbala enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu, o bo munyi wu, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;So nzu, ekpasu iyina bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi yi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo apula ɛlɛ le? &lt;&lt;Uwe bɔkɔ e shi ŋɔ ekpasu ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Imi tete mi yo yi kwuyo. La lu so mi, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />ekpasu iyi obatisima iwomo iyi Ɔzhɔnu wɔ mbaa Ukpo nana mbaa enzu ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Akwɛyi o le mu amasa ikama mbala esu, akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee &lt;&lt;Inyete ki so wu te? Gba ki zɔ tee, &lt;I wɔ mbaa Ukpo,&gt; e yo nzu tee, &lt;Kimbe ki wo ba lu nyama laa iso iyi Ɔzhɔnu mo?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ishi gba ki zɔ tee, &lt;Iwɔ mbaa enzu,&gt; enzu mbɔlɛ lɛɛbi o kpa nzu ekyi kwuwongu o yitu mamari tee Ɔzhɔnu akwu anukenzu uwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki yitu mbaa bɔkɔ a wɔ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Imi tete mi so yi mu ekpasu iyi na bɔkɔ mi wo apula ɛlɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Asukpo Umbira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Omatiyu 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Omaki 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba kwɔlɛ tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo a gba utu uwu ovanyi akwɛyi a ra wu e shi asukpo umbafo akwɛyi a kama iyawu mu luzɛ shaaru, e to kwuye mɔmɔ gyɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Kwuye ungwu ewiri ilɔma kwu bo akwɛyi a lɔ umɛgba wu tee le so mbaa asukpo mbamba kaa lo shi wu ogbo wu uwu imuma iyi utu. Asukpo mbamba ba o kpa wu ɛmu akwɛyi o rawu ma laa ewo iyidɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Akwɛyi ɔkwu uwu utu ɔnwu a gba a lɔ umɛgba uwufo kpɔ; uwu tete asukpo mbamba o bi wu ɛmu o kpa wu ari, akwɛyi o rawu ma laa ewo iyidɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Akwɛyi a gba a lɔ umɛgba uwɔla kpɔ; uwu tete o nɛ wu kanɛ akwɛyi o to wu o ta wu mu kwudu. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ɔkwu uwu utu ɔnwu a pwa ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a za la ɛnwu tee, &lt;Inyete mi wo te? Mi lɔ umɛ mi uwu mi pwu idɛnyi wu; mi yitu tee o lowumo!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Tabɔkɔ asukpo mbamba o ma wu, akwɛyi o so esu tee, &lt;Ele gba akwu umɛ uwu ɔkwu uwu utu le. &lt;La ki ngbɛ wu ma kaa kiya ingyi ogu wu lakwu ingyanzu!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Akwɛyi o wawu kwudu mu utu akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo tee, &lt;&lt;Mu imama yi, ɔkwu uwu utu ɔnwu e wo asukpo mbamba te? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />&lt;&lt;A nyɔ akwɛyi a ngbɛ asukpo mbamba ma akwɛyi a ralaa utu ɔnwu e shi asukpo umbafo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Kwuye ungwu enzu o pwa tayi, akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo le shi la ki ma ɛlɛ mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi a bɔ mba eyi shii akwɛyi e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe bɔkɔ akwu iluma iyi iso iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt;Tee kwokyi ungwu wa mbo ugu o towo ngwu mo tee akwu ungwu umbwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:17">gba vindɔ kwokyi ungwu kwu ra la ugu le.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a kpa mu kwokyi kwɔngu a muma kpɛrɛkpɛrɛ; gba kwokyi kwɔngu kwu ta mu onzu, kwu nya wu ma tɛrɛtɛrɛ mate umbu tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kwuyo Mekeka Iyi Ɔbawɛzhi Ishimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Omatiyu 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Omaki 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Wazɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala ebwoshi umbakɔ o kagyi ɔgwuzɛ kaa lo yi wu mo mu kwotota kwɔngu, kwuwongu o yitu tee kwuwo mbo gba a ba kwoba kwɔngu le; umba ba o wiyi iyi enzu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Akwɛyi o le wu mu igbomo, o shi enzu umbafo kaa lo bɔ wu eyi, enzu mbamba o wo kwuwoyo kyamate enzu umba kwuyi tayi. O lo mba kaa lo kpa kwoda laa Ɔzhizɔsi mu eyo iyomo kaa lo ra wu lo shi enzu umba idomo mbala Ogwomina uwu Oromu. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o lɔ mba le o yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo tee: &lt;&lt;Omale, ki yitu tee kiya ingyi ŋɔ so mbala ingyi ŋɔ zɔ akwu ongbulolo. Uŋɔ ŋɔ yi kusɛ mo, uŋɔ ŋɔ zɔ ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo mu ongbulolo. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />So nzu, Ɛrama nzu i nyima nana i nyama ŋa tee la ki shi Oba uwɛzhi laa Ɔsu uwu Oromu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yitu iyi kwukyoro mbo akwɛyi a za mba tee, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />&lt;&lt;La lu zɔ mi kwoso ungwu esiliva kwukpɛnyi. Ureyi mbala ɛnyi iyi uwe bi kpa mangwu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Ɔ gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi Ɔsu uwu Oromu&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu shi Ɔsu uwu Oromu ingyi akwu ingyi Ɔsu uwu Oromu, la lu shi Ukpo ingyi akwu ingyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Mɔmɔ leyi iyi enzu gedegede o fawa laa iyimo mu iso wu. Opwu i gbama wu i shi mbo kenzu iyama akwɛyi o kpala kenzu mbo mo.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Iyimo Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Omatiyu 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Omaki 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Akwɛyi Asadusi umbafo, umba bɔkɔ o zɔ tee iyimo mu kwuvɔ i yi mo, o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi la kwuyo. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />O yo wu tee &lt;&lt;Omale, Omosisi a ka nzu ɛrama tee, &lt;Gba umanyi uwu onzu e kpomo e shi oko, oko awu ba e yi ɛmɛ mo, umanyi wu e to oko awu ma mɛga kaa la mba ɛmɛ la umanyi wu uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo awu. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ɛmɛnɛ werewo o yi munɛ. Uwakɔ e to oko akwɛyi e kpomo, oko ele ba a mba wu umɛ dɛ mo. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Akwɛyi umɛnɛ uwopo e to oko awu, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />umɛnɛ uwɔla tete, tayi gba i wo le nzhii umba ɛmɛnɛ werewo mbamba o kpomo, ba o shi ɛmɛ mbala oko awu mo. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Mu imbwama yi oko ele e kpomo tete. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Kekelele ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu iyimo mu kwuvɔ, oko ele akwu oko uwu uwe mekeka mba? Moo lɛɛbi mba o towu akwu oko mbo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o to eko, o ya o anu, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a nya mba ma tee lo yimo mu kwuvɔ akwɛyi o kyo mu ɔyi uwu bu nyɔ awu o to oko mo ba o ya anu mo. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />O yi mate alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo tayi ba o kpomo mo. O kwu ɛmɛ umbu Ukpo, kwuwongu o yimo mu kwuvɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Omosisi lala a zɔ gedegede tee umba bɔkɔ o kpomo o yimo. Mu ɛza iyi ɛzhi ingbarara ipwumo, e siso meka iyi Ɔkwu tee, &lt; uwu gba akwu Ukpo uwu Aburamu, Ukpo uwu Aziki, mbala Ukpo uwu Ɔzhɛkɔbu le.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Uwu akwu Ukpo uwu enzu wareyi, moo akwu uwu ɛkpɛzhi mo, moo munyi wu enzu lɛɛbi o ye la reyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Wazɔ Ɛrɛma iyi Omosisi umbafo o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;uzɔ kiya ŋɔ gba opwu ɔnyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Akwɛyi onzu ɛnyɛnyi te e yo wu kwuyo fo.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Ɔmɛzaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Omatiyu 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Omaki 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;I wo tee bɔkɔ o zɔ tee Omezaya akwu umɛ uwu Odevidi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Moo Odevidi mafyi wu e so mu Kwokpo ungwu Amu tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;Ɔkwu a za laa Ɔkwu mi tee:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Ŋɔma munɛ mu kwuwo ungwungyi mi<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />kaa la mi ralaa agewa ŋa la mi wo mbo kagyi unga alɛ ifulomo ŋɔ dɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Odevidi a ya wu tee &lt;Ɔkwu&gt;; i wo te ba Ɔmɛzaya akwu umɛ Odevidi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi E Yi Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu Mu Alu Mekeka Iyi Wazɔ Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Omatiyu 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Omaki 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Tabɔkɔ enzu lɛɛbi o yi mu alu ingbɛma munyi wu, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;La lu gbɛndu mbala wazɔ Ɛrama, umba o gyi ifulama mu ɛriga iyɛkwu, o gyi tee enzu lo gbɛlɛ mba ɛnyi mu rishi; o gyi kizɛ ingyi iŋɔma ingyeshi mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpala ma, mbala riyi ingyi inzumbɛku mbaa odumudumu iwomo; <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />o wo eko wakpanuma ma iri mu agba mba, akwɛyi o to kwuye gbulɔlɔ mu Ukpo ilɛma kaa lo ma mba! Enzu mbɔlɛ wɔnu imama mba u ka le lɛɛbi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="ms">Rɛshi Iwomo Ingyi Oko U kpo ɔnu Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Omaki 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yi eyefaa akwɛyi a ma enzu umba o yi kwuwo o yi mu eduwo ilomo mu kakyɔ unga Ɔtɛpu, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />akwɛyi a ma oko ukpɔnuma ukpɛnyi uwu akwu ɔyirewa a ta anini wu epo mu kakyɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee oko ukpɔnuma ɔyirewa ele a ta kiya ingyi ki ka ingyi uwewe mo. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Enzu mbɔlɛ lɛɛbi o to mu kiya kɛ gyɔɔ mba gba o shi le; oko ele ba e to ingyi e yi ngyi ndii meka iyi rewa wu gba e shi le.<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso Mekeka Iyi Ishirimo Iyi Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Omatiyu 24.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Omaki 13.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu umbafo o za laa iso isomo meka iyi bɔkɔ Ɔtɛpu o wo wu ari mu ekyi ireyi mbala rɛshi ingyi enzu o ka laa Ukpo. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Apula iyi lu ma yi ele lɛɛbi, kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma, bɔkɔ kwoki kwukpukpɛnyi tee o shigwobi mu kadu ungufo mo; kwoki ungwunanguna o shiri ngwu mo o fu mɛzhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ovyo Mbala Inyashi Ilomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Omatiyu 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Omaki 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Akwɛyi o yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Omale,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwuna bɔkɔ ɛlɛ i bi wo? Kimbe ba akwu kɛzɔ unga kwuyengwu kiya ngyɛlɛ ki bi wo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu; onzu le kyoro yi mo mo. Moo enzu gyɔɔ o nyɔ mu ɛnyi mi, akwɛyi oo zɔ tee, &lt;Imi gba mi kwu uwu le&lt; ba, &lt;Kwuye kwu bo-o!&gt; Lunyi la lu mbwalu mba mo. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Kwuye ungwu lu pwa akpa iyi ewa mbala ovyo, la lu wiyi mo; moo apula ɛlɛ te i wo keyi mega dɛ, inyi ba i zɔ tee akwu ibomo iyi kwuye mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />E so wu mu isomo tee, Ɛzhi iyifo i wa laa ewa i fu laa iyifo; ekeshi umbafo o wa laa ewa o fu laa umbafo. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Ɛzhi i nya giri iyɛkɔkɔ, lonzu mbala efya mu kizɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ, apula iyi i lo iyi i wo mbala lɔzɔ ndɔkwu moshi.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />&lt;&lt;O yi yimo akwɛyi o lo yi inyashi; o kwuyi o re mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama kaa lo ngbɛ yi ombu uwoyi kaa lo fu yi mu ugu ugyi; o nya yi mu idu iyi asu mbala wa to keyi kwuwongu ɛnyi mi dɛ gba ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i bi wo le. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ɛlɛ ba akwa yi kapa unga lu so mbo Iso Iyesheshi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, la lu bɔ ɛyi kepo mu idu te lu wo idu kpu mu ewo iyi lu bu gbɔ ɛyi ma mo, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />kwuwongu mi shi yi iso mbala ilukwu iyi bɔkɔ enzu umba rɛnu yi o do tee o towo yimo mo ba o ri kambwu ma yi mo. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Umbeteyi mbala umbanyiyi, ɛmanyi yi, enzu umba kwɔmba yi, mbala ɛmɛza yi o to yi o yama akwɛyi o ngbɛ mbafo yi ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Enzu lɛɛbi o wo anya yi kwuwo mi. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Kwunyi ungwu reshi yi kwukpukpɛnyi te ba kwu tomo mo. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />La lu rima ngiri akwɛyi lu sa ɛyi ma.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso Mɛka Iyi Ishirimo Iyi Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Omatiyu 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Omaki 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu lu ma asozha o lo Ɔzhɛrusalɛ meka, lunyi la lu yitu tee imbwama ngwu i nda fo. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Kwuye kwɔngu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ozhudiya lo renya lo so mu edudu; enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwuse ba lo wɔ kwudu, enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwudu awu ba lo fye mu kwuse fo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Moo kwuye kwɔlɛ akwu &lt;Kwuye ungwu Inyashi ilomo,&gt; kaa Iso iyi Ukpo iyi o ka lɛɛbi mu kwokpo li nyɔlɔma. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Inyashi iyɛku akwiyi eko umba rifo mbala eko umba o ra laa ɛmɛ mu kwuwo kwuye kwɔngu! Moo wɔnu umbɔku u ŋu fye mu ɛzhi ɛlɛ, akwɛyi amba umba Ukpo o fu mu enzu mbɔlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Umbafo o ngbɛ mba ma mu ukpandɛrɛ, akwɛyi umbafo mba ba o yi mbo mo akwu enye mu ɛzhi ewa; akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o kpa Ɔzhɛrusalɛ alɛ nzhii ba kwuye mbo kwu nyɔlɔma.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Igbama Iyi Umɛ Onzu</para>
  <para style="r">(Omatiyu 24:29-31; Omaki 13:24-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />&lt;&lt;Lɔzɔ undu lu liyi lu wɔ mu ɔnu, ɔvya mbala elovyo. Mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ba enzu o fye mu iyi iwuma iyi anu iyi risu mbala agba iyi embyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Enzu o zɛ ɛnyɔ ma kwuwongu iyi iyi kiya ingyi ki bi wo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, moo apula iyoshi o wo yi akpa.<verse eid="LUK 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Akwɛyi o ma Umɛ uwu Onzu te e yi mu inyɔma mu amu laa ekpasu iyɛku mbala inzumbɛku wu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Kwuye ungwu apula ɛlɛ i le mu iwomo, la lu yi ɛnwu yi ma moo isama yi inda fo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kiya Ingyi Ɔ Vɔngɔ Mu Uwɛyi Uwu Oboriyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Omatiyu 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Omaki 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba tee: &lt;&lt; La lu yese uwɛyi uwu oboriyo mbala ɛwɛyi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Kwuye ungwu i le mu epu itumo, lu yitu tee iwo i nda fo. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Tayi gba i yi le, kwuyengwu lu ma apula ɛlɛ tee i yi mu iwomo, la lu yitu tee Ɛsu Irimo iyi Ukpo i nda fo.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />&lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee, enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ o kpomo ndii dɛ gba apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i bi wo le mo. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Oshi mbala ɛzhi i bomo, iso mi ba i bomo gbee mo.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="ms">La lu Gbo Ɛyi Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />&lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu kaa la lu tutu kwuye yi ma mu odumudumu iwomo mbala atɛ iwomo mbala egbo igigidi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, moo kwɔfyi kwɔngu kwu bi yi yi mo kporo <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />kyamate kwuda tayi mo. Moo kwu nyɔ mu enzu lɛɛbi munamuna umba o yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />La lu ngbɛndu la lu lɛ Ukpo kaa la lu vuluma mu i yi bi wo le lɛɛbi, kaa lu fya ekpasu iyi irima mu idu iyi Umɛ uwu Onzu kego.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kwɔfyi kwɔfyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ ɛzu mu Ɔtɛpu, mu onoyo ba a ka mu Lɔwa undu Olifu. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Enzu lɛɛbi o ka munyi wu mu kwoto mu kwoto kaa lo pwa iso wu mu Ɔtɛpu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Amasa Ikama Kaa Lɔ Ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Omatiyu 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Omaki 14.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ɔzhɔnu 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Kwuye ungwu Odumudumu uwu Oburedi uwu e yi Otutu mo uwu o ya wu tee Odumudumu uwu Ikalama awu ba kwu nda fo. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Eboshi umbakɔ mbala wazɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi o yi mu ɔgwuzɛ igagyima uwu o yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo, umba ba o wiyi iyi enzu, kwuwo kwɔlɛ, o le mu ɔgwuzɛ igagyima kaa lɔ ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi ma kyokyokyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ozhuda A Nyama Te A Ya Ɔzhizɔsi Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Omatiyu 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10">Omaki 14.10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Akwɛyi Onzu uwoyi e fye mu egbo iyi Ozhuda uwu o ya wu tee Isikariyɔ awu, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ukpɛnyi meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la wepo awu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Akwɛyi Ozhuda a ka mbaa ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa to keyi umba Ɔtɛpu igbomo kaa la zɔ mba ɔgwuzɛ uwu ɔ zɛ kaa le to Ɔzhizɔsi la ya ma. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Ɔ mwɔnyɛ gyɔɔ akwɛyi ɔ nyama tee o shi wu eduwo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ozhuda a nyama, akwɛyi e le mu ɔgwuzɛ igagyima uwu wa rala Ɔzhizɔsi we shi mbo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ enzu o yi mbala wu mo.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E yɛnwu ma Kaa Le Ri Kiya Ingyirimo Ingyi Odumudumu Uwu Ikalama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Omatiyu 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Omaki 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ɔzhɔnu 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Akwɛyi kwɔfyi ungwu Odumudumu uwu Oburedi uwu e yi otutu mo kwu bo ungwu bɔkɔ ɔ ngbɛ ilɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lɔ Opita mbala Ɔzhɔnu ma, a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu so ka la lu wo kiya ingyirimo ingyi Odumudumu uwu ikalama ka la ki ri mbala esu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Umba ba o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Muna bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi te la ki wo kiya ingyirimo ngyɛngyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Gba lu yi mu ifyemo mu kwuse, lu kpolo onzu ukpɛnyi uwu a za la kudu ungwu embi. La lu mbwalu wu mu kwogba ungwu bɔkɔ e fye, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />akwɛyi lu za la ɔkwu uwu kwogba te: &lt;Omale a zɔ te ugu e yi muna uwu bɔkɔ Imi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya mi ki ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi Odumudumu uwu ikalama?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ɔkwu uwu kwogba awu e to yi e reye mu kadu mu ugwu uwoshi akwɛyi a zɔ yi ugu uwakwu, uwu a nɔngɔ e she yi. La lu nɔngɔ ingyinangyina mɔmɔ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />O kama mɔmɔ akwɛyi o du yi kyamate bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so mbo tayi, akwɛyi o wo kiya ingyirimo ingyi Odumudumu uwu Ikalama.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kiya Ingyirimo Ingyi Onoyo Ingyi Ɔkwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Omatiyu 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Omaki 14.22-26</ref>; 1 Ɔkɔrɛtiya 11.23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Tabɔkɔ kwuye kwu wo mo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala wa zɛ ilɔ wu ɔ ŋɔma kaa lo ri kiya. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Mi gyi kpɔɔ te la mi ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi Odumudumu uwu Ikalama mbala yi keyi dɛ kaa la mi bi ma wɔnu le! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Imi mi so yi, mi gba mi ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi Odumudumu uwu Ikalama ele fo nzhii ba kwuyengwu i fya iluma mu kwuyengwu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e to ago iyi embyi ma, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi akwɛyi a za la wa zɛ ilɔ tee, &lt;La lu to ago iyi embyi ma kaa la lu ka esu. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />La mi so yi, mi gba mi wo owanyi ele fo nzhii ba kwuyengwu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo i bo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Akwɛyi e to kwumuzhi ungwu kwoburedi, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi, a mu ngu ma, akwɛyi e shi mbo akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ akwu ɛnwu mi iyi mi shi yi, la lu koko lu wo ɛlɛ kaa la lu lolo mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Tatayi, mizhikembo iyi o mbwa kiya ingyi onoyo irimo akwɛyi e to ago ɛlɛ e shi mbo akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ago ɛlɛ akwu kenzu igyirima ungepo unga Ukpo unga o kokongomo mu ɛnzhi mi umba mi fu mbo mo kwuwo yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Lunyi la lu yese de! Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ba ya mi ma le e yi mu kiya irimo mbala mi munɛ! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Umɛ uwu Onzu e kpomo kyamate bɔkɔ Ukpo a zɔ awu, tete gbetu akwiyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ya wu ma&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Akwɛyi wa zɛ ilɔ o le mu esu kwuyo iyomo, uwe meka mba ba e wo kiya ngyɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kaambu Mɛka Iyi Onzu Uwu A Ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o le mu kaambu irimo mbala esu tee uwe ba a ka meka mba. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Asu umba enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Ukpo mo, o zɔ enzu mba idomo, wa to keyi mba ba o gyi tee enzu lo zɔ tee mba akwu &lt;Ɛmɛza umba Enzu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za mba tee lunyi ba la lu yi mate umba mo. Onzu uka meka yi ba le yi mate umɛshɛri te, u to keyi ba le yi mate umɛgba tayi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Uwe ba a ka, uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma akwɛyi o ka la kiya kaa le ri naa onzu uwu bɔkɔ a kawu laa kiya ingyirimo ŋa? Akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma akwɛyi o ka wu laa kiya ingyirimo. Imi ba mi yi meka yi kyamate onzu uwu e wo ɛduma la enzu tayi.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Lunyi gba lu rima mbala mi le kwuyengwu imondomo mi. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Imi mi shi yi kapa kaa la lu ri ɛsu kyamate Ada mi e shi mi tayi. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Lu ri, lu wo mbala mi mu kagɔ kakpɛnyi mu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo, akwɛyi lu ŋɔma mu ukpa uwu ɛsu, akwɛyi lu zɔ ombu uwu ese uwo la epo iyi Izirɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Kwepa Tee Opita A Zɔ Kwu zɔ Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Omatiyu 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Omaki 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ɔzhɔnu 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ya Ɔsamɔ ma tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔsamɔ, Ɔsamɔ! Ngbɛ kwɔlu kaa pwa! Onzu uwoyi a nda kwoya kaa lo shi kapa kaa la pwa yi ma lɛɛbi, kaa la ka enzu umbira ma mbaa enzu umba esheshi kyamate ɔnɛgba bɔkɔ a ka eyi iyi owiti ma mbala asɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Imi ba mi nda Ukpo kwoya kwuwo ŋɔ Ɔsamɔ, kaa ikwu idu lu fulo ŋɔ li fɔma mo. Kwuye ungwu ŋɔ gba ŋɔ bo munyimi, ka ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ ɛnwu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Opita a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, mi nyama kaa mi somo mbala ŋa mu ugu ugyi kaa la mi kpomo mbala ŋa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Opita, mi so ŋɔɔ, ɔnɛnɛ ŋɔ zɔ kwu zɔ mi izhɛla dɛ gba okwuru e tɛyi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kakyɔ, Kwongara Mbala Ukpandɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo Wavɔngɔkiya wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu mi lɔ yi ma bɔkɔ lu za laa kakyɔ, kwongara, naa ekpoyata mo awu, kiya ki nyɛ yi ma re?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ayimo&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;kekelele, onzu uwu e yi kakyɔ naa kwongara ba la za ngwu; onzu uwu e yi ukpandɛrɛ mo ba ya origa wu ma kaa la ya ukpɛnyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Moo mi gyite la mi so yi tee, akwu mɛga o nyɔlɔ iyi bɔkɔ iso iyi Ukpo i so mu reshi mi tee, &lt;O kyo wu mbala enzu umba ingbomo.&gt; Ee, kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o ka mu reshi mi ki bo mbaa inyɔlɔma-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, yese ikpandɛrɛ epo i ŋɛlɛ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Akwɛyi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;I kpokya tayi ŋa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lɛ Ukpo Mu Lɔwa Undu Olifu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Omatiyu 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Omaki 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya la kwuse kwɔngu a ka mu Lɔwa undu Olifu mate ba e koko e wo awu, akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o mbwalu wu. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Tabɔkɔ o kama mɔmɔ, akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu lɛ Ukpo kaa la lu tamakwuyengwu imondomo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Akwɛyi e turumo bwɛ a ka keyi kyamate indama iyi i to kwokyi pyo tee, akwɛyi a bɔ epunu mɛzhi akwɛyi a lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />A zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, gba ŋɔ nyama, to ago iyi wɔnu ɛlɛ ma munyi mi. Tetete, lakwu iyi bɔkɔ mi gyi le gba li wo le mo, lakwu iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi le gba li wo le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a wɔ moshi e bo munyi wu akwɛyi e kyo wu ekpasu ma. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Kwuye kwɔngu e yi mu wɔnu umbɔkwu akwɛyi e yirimo mu Ukpo ilɛma iyɛkɔkɔ; anu wu ba o kalama o fu mɛzhi kyamate eri iyi ɛnzhi tayi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa Ukpo ilɛma ma, akwɛyi a gba a ka mbaa Wavɔngɔkiya wu, ba e du mbo mu ondo ikpolomo kwuwongu ubwu ugyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo ba lu kpondo? La lu yimo kaa lu lɛ Ukpo kaa la lu tamakwuyengwu imondomo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">O yi Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Omatiyu 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Omaki 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Ɔzhɔnu 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iso isomo bɛnɛ akwɛyi enzu riba o bo munyi wu, Ozhuda, ukpɛnyi meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la wepo, gba e to mbo keshi keyi le. E bo kɛlɛ mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi kaa la kpawu idu. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ozhuda, ŋɔ to Umɛ uwu Onzu ŋɔ yama mu idu ikpama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Kwuye ungwu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu o ma kiya ingyi ki ŋi wo, akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada kwogba, la ki wa la ikpandɛrɛ nzu kaa la ki lo mu ilama re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Akwɛyi ukpɛnyi mekeka mba e kpolo kwɔlu ungwu unye uwu Oboshi Uwakɔ ma.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;I kpokya tayi ŋa!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a pwu afyi mu kwɔlu ungwu onzu awu akwɛyi e bo wu ofya ma.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo ebwoshi umbakɔ, mbala wa to keyi umba o gbo Ɔtɛpu, mbala enzu umbakɔ, umba bɔkɔ o bo kaa lo yi wu mo tee, &lt;&lt;Lu wɔ la ikpandɛrɛ mbala ipyi kyamate mi kwu uwɛlɔ? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Kwɔfyi kwɔfyi mi yi mbala yi mu Ɔtɛpu, lunyi ba lu yi mi mo. Kekelele gba akwu kwuye yi le, ungwu bɔkɔ ipwu irɛsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita A Zɔma Te E Yi Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57">Omatiyu 26.57</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Omaki 14.53</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Ɔzhɔnu 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Akwɛyi o yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo akwɛyi o kawa mogba uwu Oboshi Uwakɔ; Opita ba a mbwalu shaaru mu izhikembo. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />O kpala ɔyi mu odida akwɛyi Opita e kyo a ŋɔma mbala enzu umba o yi mu ɔyi ivyemo mɔmɔ awu tete. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Tabɔkɔ umɛgba umesheko a ma Opita a ŋɔma umba ɔyi mɔmɔ akwɛyi a bɔ wu eyeshii akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele tete e yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Opita ba a zɔma, a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Oko ele, Imi lala mi yi wu mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Kwuye bwɛɛ onzu awa a ma Opita akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu onzu ukpɛnyi meka mba tete!&gt;&gt; Opita ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Uma, mi yi mbala mba mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Mizhikembo iyi awa ikpɛnyi tee, akwɛyi onzu uwufo e bo a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imulo iyi munɛ mo ndii, onzu ele e yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi, moo akwu onzu uwu Ogalili tete!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Opita ba a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Uma, mi yi kiya ingyi ŋɔ yi mu isomo mo!&gt;&gt; Tabɔkɔ e yi mu iso isomo tayi akwɛyi okwuru e tɛyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Ɔkwu e fulo biri e yese Opita, akwɛyi Opita e lolo iso iyi ba Ɔkwu e so wu awu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ zɔ kwu zɔ mi izhɛla dɛ gba okwuru e tɛyi mutu ɔlɛ le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Akwɛyi Opita a wɔ kwudu akwɛyi e loga iyɛkɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Wo Ɔzhizɔsi Ɛnɛ, O Kpawu Ɛmwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67">Omatiyu 26.67</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:68">68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Omaki 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Ɔzhizɔsi igbomo awu o le wo mu ɛnɛ iwomo mbala ɛmwu ikpama. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />O ma wu eyi mo akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Za nzu, uwe a kpa ŋa afyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Akwɛyi o kyo o so wu iso iyi ira gyɔɔ, laa ari ikpama.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Ka Laa Ɔzhizɔsi Mu Udaba Uwu Enzu Umbakɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Omatiyu 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Omaki 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Ɔzhɔnu 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Tabɔkɔ eyi ilama, akwɛyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wazɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi, o kpolo esu, akwɛyi o ka laa Ɔzhizɔsi mu udaba mba. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Omezaya le? So nzu ŋa nɛ.&gt;&gt; Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba mi so yi, lu ŋu nyama la iso mi mo; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />gba mi gba mi yo yi kwuyo, lu ŋu gba mi opwu mo. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ina mu kekelele i shekeyi Umɛ uwu Onzu a ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu Ukpo Edego Ala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Akwɛyi lɛɛbi mba o yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Inyete ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo ŋa mo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Matee ba lo so awu, akwu mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Akwɛyi o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ki gagyi izɔgɔ iyifo shaafo! Ki pwa yi mu kenzu wu o lo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">O Ka Laa Ɔzhizɔsi Midu Iyi Opayileti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Omatiyu 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Omaki 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Ɔzhɔnu 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Akwɛyi enzu umba o kpala ɛlu mɔmɔ lɛɛbi o to Ɔzhizɔsi o kawa midu iyi Opayileti. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Akwɛyi o mwolo wu, ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ki du onzu ele e yi mu enzu nzu itutumo. A za mba tee lo shi Oba uwɛzhi laa Osiza mo. A gba a zɔ tee uwu gba wakwu Omezaya, Ɔsu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Akwɛyi Opayileti e yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu ɔsu uwu Azhu lee?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee, i yi mate ŋɔ so awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Akwɛyi Opayileti a za laa ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu mbamba tee, &lt;&lt;Mi fya kwuyi ungwu mi ngbɛ onzu ele ombu uwoyi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Enzu mbamba ba o kpakpɛɛ mu isomo tee, &lt;&lt;A ta enzu ovyo mu Ozhudiya lɛɛbi mu ɛzu wu izɔma. E ye mu Ogalili nzhii ba e bo munɛ-ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="ms">O Ka Laa Ɔzhizɔsi Midu Iyi Ɛrɔdu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Opayileti a pwa ɛlɛ, akwɛyi e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu onzu uwu Ogalili re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Tabɔkɔ Opayileti a pwa tee Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ mu ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kwuwo ungwu Ɛrɔdu, a lɔ wu laa Ɛrɔdu, uwu e yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kwuye kwɔngu.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɛrɔdu a ma Ɔzhizɔsi, a mwɔnyɛ gyɔɔ, kwuwongu a pwa ɛza wu akwɛyi a gyi tee la ma wu kwuboo. E yi mu eyifulomo kaa la kiya ingyi kenzu iyama ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi e be wo. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Ɛrɔdu e yo Ɔzhizɔsi eyo gyɔɔ, Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu mo. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Eboshi umbakɔ mbala wazɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi o wɔ kwudu o bo mu keyi akwɛyi o mwilo iyɛkuu mu reshi ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Akwɛyi Ɛrɔdu mbala asozha wu o le mu Ɔzhizɔsi ɛnɛ iwomo la izhima; akwɛyi o lo wu ɛkiri uwesheshi akwɛyi o gba wu o ka laa Opayileti. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Mɔnu mawu Ɛrɔdu mbala Opayileti okwu ɛmɛza; moo mekyekyi umba akwu agewa umbesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔ Ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi Ombwu Uwu Lukwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Omatiyu 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Omaki 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Ɔzhɔnu 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Akwɛyi Opayileti a ya ebwoshi umbakɔ ma, mbala wa to keyi mbala enzu lɛɛbi, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lu ka mi la onzu ele tee uwu gba e lo enzu atiti kaa lo wo ovyo mu kwuse le. Imi ba mi yo wu kwuyo leyi yi-e, ba mi fya kwuyi ungwu ira iyi bɔkɔ lu zɔ tee e wo mo. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Ɛrɔdu tete a fya kiya ingyi ira ingyi onzu ele e wo mo gba a gbawu a ka nzu le. Onzu ele e wo kiya kyinyinyi ingyi ki do lukwu mo mo. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi kpa wu ikpa bi akwɛyi mi lu wu afyima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Mu Odumudumu uwu Ikalama mba uwunawuna akwu mega kaa Opayileti la walaa onzu ukpɛnyi uwu enzu ɔ gyi mu ugu ugyi kaa le shi mbo.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Lɛɛbi mba ba o wo anu mu opwu ukpɛnyi tee, &lt;&lt;Lɔ ngbɛ wu ma! Lanzu afyima laa Obarabasi! <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Obarabasi o ta wu mu ugu ugyi kwuwongu a ta ovyo mu kwuse mbala enzu ingbɛma.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Opayileti ba a gyi tee la lafya laa Ɔzhizɔsi, kwuwo kwɔlɛ a kpa mba ɛshɛku kpɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Umba ba o kpakpɛɛ mu uzhi iwomo tee, &lt;&lt;Lo ngbɛ wu ma! Lo ngbɛ wu ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Opayileti a gba e so ungwɔla kpɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Ira iyina ba e wo? Imi mi ma kiya kikpikpɛnyi ingyi bɔkɔ e wo bɔkɔ ki do lukwu mo mo! Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi kpawu ikpa akwɛyi mi lu wu afyima kaa le sheyimo iyawu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Enzu ba o kpakpɛɛ mu uzhi iwomo mu opwu uwɔkwu tee, lo ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi ma akwɛyi uzhi mba u na kizɛ ma lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Opayileti a nya mba ma akwɛyi e wo iyi bɔkɔ umba o gyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />A lafya la onzu uwu bɔkɔ o ta wu mu ugu ugyi kwuwongu ovyo iwomo mu kwuse mbala enzu ingbɛma, uwu bɔkɔ umba o nda kwoya wu awu, akwɛyi a ralaa Ɔzhizɔsi e shi mbo kaa lo wo iyi bɔkɔ ɔ gyi.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Bɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Iba Mu Kwuwɛyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Omatiyu 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Omaki 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ɔzhɔnu 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Tabɔkɔ asozha o za laa Ɔzhizɔsi o sheyimo, akwɛyi kpolo onzu uwufo uwu o ya wu tee Ɔsamɔ uwu Osarini, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu i fye mu kwuse. O yi wu akwɛyi o to kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu kwɔngu o fulo wu kaa la mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mizhikembo.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Enzu riba o mbwalu wu, i kyo mbala ekokpayi umba bɔkɔ o za laa oga ilomo mbala ubugyi iwomo kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Ɔzhizɔsi e geleyi e yese mbo akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Eko umba Ɔzhɛrusalɛ! La lu loga kwuwo mi mo, la lu loga kwuwongu ɛyi mbala ɛmɛ yi. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Moo kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma bɔkɔ enzu o zɔ tee, &lt;Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu eko edogyi, umba bɔkɔ o do mba ma dɛ mo, umba bɔkɔ o do yi ɛmɛ dɛ mo!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu enzu o za laa lɔwa tee, &lt;Shirimo kaa kpo ma nzu!&gt; O gba o za laa edudu tee, &lt;La lu nvye nzu mo!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Moo gba enzu o wo apula ɛlɛ te la kwuwɛyi ungwewu, kwu bu shirima ba o mbwa te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />O kwu enzu umbira wepo o kyo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi o she mbo mbaa ingbɛma tete. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Kwuye ungwu o bo mu kizɛ ingyi o ya ngyi tee &lt;&lt;Kwukɔgɔ ungwu reshi,&gt;&gt; mɔmɔ gba o kpa Ɔzhizɔsi iba mu kwuwɛyi le, mbala enzu umbira wepo mbamba, ukpɛnyi mu kwuwo ungwungyi wu, uwufo ba mu kwuwo ungwɔzu wu. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, gbayi kaa kpa mba! Moo o yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o yi mu iwomo mo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">O kwɛpa akwɛyi o ka ɛriga wu ma mbala esu. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Enzu o rima mu iyesemo, watokeyi umba Azhu ba o wo wu ɛnɛ, o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;A sa enzu umbafo ma; la sa ɛnwu ma ŋanɛ kaa la ki ma gba akwu Omezaya ngboro uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Asozha tete o wo wu ɛnɛ: o bo munyi wu akwɛyi o shi wu owanyi uwu iwuma, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ kwu ɔsu uwu Azhu ngboro, de ba sa ɛŋɔ ma ŋanɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />O ka ɛzu o kpa mu kadu wu tee: &lt;&lt;Ele gba akwu ɔsu uwu Azhu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Ukpenyi meka iyi enzu umbira umba bɔkɔ o kpa mba mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu awu a kpa wu ari a za wu tee: &lt;&lt;Akwu ŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Omezaya le mo re? Sa ɛŋɔ ma nɛ kaa sa nzu ma tete!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Onzu uwopo wu ba a kpa wu ɛyi, a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ riyi iyi Ukpo moo?&gt;&gt; Kwuwongwu rinye ŋɔ ri yi kya mbala ingya wu le gba ŋɔ kpawu ari le? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />O lo nzu inyashi kwuwongu kiya ingyira ingyi ki wo. Onzu ele ba e wo kiya ingyira kikpikpɛnyi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Akwɛyi a za laa &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Lolo mbaa mi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ bi ŋɔma mu ɛsu irimo ŋɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so ŋɔ le tee, ɔnɛnɛ ŋɔ yi mbala mi mu Oparadasi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwu Undu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Omatiyu 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Omaki 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Ɔzhɔnu 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ina mu ɔnɔnda nzhii ba ɔnu u selemo ipwu i kpo mɛzhi ɛnyi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Ɔnu u lafya laa ilama. Okpayi uwu Ɔtɛpu a ka epo. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Ɔzhizɔsi a yama mu opwu uwɔkwuu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada! Mi ra la kwunyɔ mi mi lo ŋɔ mɔwu.&gt;&gt; Tabɔkɔ a mbwa ɛlɛ isomo, akwɛyi a ta kwunyɔ ma.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />U to keyi uwu asozha, tabɔkɔ a ma kiya ingyi ki wo akwɛyi a du Ukpo ma, a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu onzu uwu ototo kego!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Kwuye ungwu enzu umba o bo mba iyesemo o ma kiya ingyi ki wo, o lo ewo mbo mesu o kama iyamba laa ubugyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi Ɔzhizɔsi, ikyo ekokpayi umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu Ogalili o mbwalu wu, o rima shaaru mu iyesemo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipwumo Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Omatiyu 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Omaki 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ɔzhɔnu 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Mu kwuye kwɔlɛ onzu ukpɛnyi uwu o ya wu tee Ɔzhɔsɛfu, onzu uwu kwuse ungwu Arimatiya mɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya. Onzu ele akwu onzu ototo, e kyo mu udaba uwu enzu umbakɔ, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />tetete uwu a nyama mbala kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o wo le mo. Uwu a rigbo laa Ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ɔzhɛsɛfu a ka mbaa Opayileti kaa lo shi wu ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Akwɛyi a kala wu ma mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu e bo mu ɛzhi akwɛyi e wuwumo mu okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ, e shi wu a nɔma mu Ogariwu uwu a vu mu ɔzɔ uwu bɔkɔ o do ta onzu mawu dɛ mo. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Kwɔfyi kwɔngu ba akwu kwɔfyi ungwu o yi mu ɛnwu iyimo iyi kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungwu bɔkɔ kwu ndama fo.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Ekokpayi umba o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ngbaa mu Ogalili awu, o mbwalu Ɔzhɛsɛfu akwɛyi o ma Ogariwu awu mbala ewo iyi bɔkɔ o shi ɛnwu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mawu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Akwɛyi o gbama mogba o kɔ nɔngɔ apula iyi umbwɔ ferere mbala oturare.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Akwɛyi ɛnwu i gbo mbo mo mu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ɛnwu Igbomo mate ba Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i zɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="ms">Iyimo Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Omatiyu 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Omaki 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ɔzhɔnu 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu kwonze mu orondo mu kwoto mu kwoto, eko mbamba o kwu apula iyi umbwɔ ferere iyi bɔkɔ o nɔngɔ awu o ka mu ogariwu. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Akwɛyi o du tee o fya kwoki kwɔngu ma mu kenzu unga ogariwu awu, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />akwɛyi o fyemo mɛmi; ɛnwu iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi ba o ma yi mo. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Tabɔkɔ o ri mɔmɔ laa kenzu iyama iyi kiya ngyɛlɛ, akwɛyi mu kwotota o ma enzu wepo umba ekpayi mba i lemo puratata o ri kɛlɛɛ mbala mba. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ekokpayi mbamba o wiyi gyɔɔ akwɛyi o lo reshi mɛzhi, akwɛyi enzu mbamba o yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu gagyi onzu ureyi mbaa ɛkpɛzhi? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />E yi munɛ mo; e yi mo-o. La lu lolo iso iyi bɔkɔ e so yi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ e e degbo mu Ogalili awu tee: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />&lt;Mega Umɛ uwu Onzu o ra wu o shi enzu umba ingbomo, akwɛyi o kpawu iba, akwɛyi ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwɔla a gba laa iyimo.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Akwɛyi eko mbamba o lolo iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so mbo.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ eko mbamba o gbama mbaa Ogariwu, o so Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la ukpɛnyi mbala enzu umbafo, apula iyi i wo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Akwu Omeri Omagadali, mbala Ozhuwana, mbala Omeri anyi wu Ozhemisi mbala enzu umbafo umba o yi mbala mba gba o so wa zɛ ilɔ iso ɛlɛ lɛɛbi le. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Wa zɛ ilɔ mbamba ba o to tee iso iyi eko mbamba akwu iso iyumbwa, akwɛyi o nyama la yi mo. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Opita ba e yimo kpara a rɛnya a ka mu ogariwu awu; e lemo, e kpeyi akwɛyi a ma okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ awu tee o shiwu mɛmba uwidɔ. Akwɛyi a gba a kama mogba iyawu laa kenzu iyama iyi kiya ingyi ki wo le.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu Ɔgwuzɛ Uwu Ɛmawusu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12">Omaki 16.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Mu kwɔfyi kwɔngu pwa enzu wepo wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi o yi mu luzɛ o sheyi mu kwuse ungwu o ya ngwu tee ɛmawɔsu, ungwu indama ngwu mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ i yi mate emelu erewo te, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />o za laa ɛza ibama mbala esu mekeka iyi apula iyi i wo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu ɛza iyi apula ɛlɛ ibama mbala esu, kporo ba Ɔzhizɔsi mafyi wu e turu a gba mba akwɛyi a zɛ mbala mba; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />umba o mawu, ɔbulɛ o zɔngɔma wu ma mo. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba lu yi mu ɛza ngyi ibama mbala esu tabɔkɔ lu yi mu luzɛ le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Akwɛyi o rima la eyi ishishimo. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Onzu ukpɛnyi mba, uwu o ya wu tee Okilopasi awu, e yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu uŋɔ kɛɛkyi gba ŋɔ kwu ugboga mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ bɔkɔ ŋɔ yitu iyi bɔkɔ i wo mɔmɔ afyi ɛlɛ mo le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Akwɛyi e yo mbo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Apula iyina ŋa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu anukenzu, iso wu mbala iwomo wu i yi ekpasu mu idu iyi Ukpo mbala enzu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala watokeyi nzu o to wu o shi kaa lo ngbɛ wu ombu uwu lukwu akwɛyi o bɔ wu iba mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Kinzu ba ki fulo eyi tee uwu gba a sa Izirɛ ma le! Ɔnɛnɛ akwu kwɔfyi ungwola bɔkɔ kiya ngyɛlɛ ki wo. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Eko nzu umbafo o shi nzu kenzu iyama; o ka mu Ogariwu mu eyifumo, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ba o ma ukpɛzhi wu mo. O gbama o za nzu tee, umba o ma alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mu ɛbɛ umba ɔ za mba tee e yi la reyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Umbafo mu uzhi nzu o ka mu Ogariwu mɔmɔ, umba tete o du ogariwu uwidɔ kyamate eko mbamba o so.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi efyo mbɔlɛ, kimbe wo ba lu kirɛnwu iyi ikwidu fulo mu apula iyinaiyina iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o so le! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Akwu mega ka Omezaya la ma wɔnu dɛ kaa le fye mu inzumbɛku wu le mo o?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />I yo yoo mu ekpo iyi Omosisi mbala ɛzu iyi anukenzu lɛɛbi, Ɔzhizɔsi so mbo lɛɛbi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o so mu kwokpo ungwu Iso iyi Ukpo mu reshi wu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Tabɔkɔ o bo kɛlɛɛ mbala kwuse ungwu bɔkɔ o sheyimo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo kyamate a ŋa pikama tayi; <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />umba ba o kpa wu ɛshɛku tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔma mbala nzu te; moo ɔnu u bo-o, utu ba u ndafo.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi e fyemo a ŋɔ mbala mba. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Kwuye ungwu a ŋɔma kaa le ri kiya mbala mba, e to kwoburedi, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi, a mu ngwu ma akwɛyi e shi mbo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Akwɛyi eyi mbo i wuma akwɛyi o zɔngɔma wu ma, uwu ba e to ndii e shi mbo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />O yo esu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Idu nzu i wo mate ɔyi u ye yi mu ipwumo kwuyengwu e yi mu iso isomo mbala nzu mu ɔgwuzɛ bɔkɔ a ya nzu iso iyi Ukpo mo awu mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Akwɛyi o yimo kpara o gba o ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ akwɛyi o du Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la ukpɛnyi mbala enzu umba o yi mbala mba awu, o kpala esu elu mɔmɔ <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />akwɛyi o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Te gba i yi le kego! Ɔkwu e yimo-o! Uwu ba a wɔ nduu la Ɔsamɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Akwɛyi enzu wepo mbamba o so kiya ingyi ki wo mu ɔgwuzɛ, mbala ewo iyi bɔkɔ umba ɔ zɔngɔma Ɔkwu ma kwuyengwu a mu kwoburedi ma.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛnwu Ma Laa Wa vɔngɔ Kiya wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Omatiyu 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Omaki 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ɔzhɔnu 20.19-23</ref>; Ɛduma Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 1.6-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Tabɔkɔ enzu wepo mbamba o ye mbo mu iso ɛnyi isomo, akwɛyi kporo ba o gele Ɔkwu mafyi wu a rima mekeka mba akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Oloto lu yi mbala yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Iyi i wo mbo mo gyɔɔ akwɛyi le mu ipwulama, moo o ma kyamate tee umba o ma kwundu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Uwu ba e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu wiyi te? Kwuwongwu kwuwongumbe bɔkɔ lu byi egbo epepo te? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />La lu yese ewo mbala alɛ mi akwɛyi lu zɔngɔma tee akwu Imi mafyi mi gba mi ŋɔ le. La lu pwu mi afyi kaa la lu ma, moo kwundu kwu yi ɛnwu mbala ekwu, ta lu ma mi yi yi ele mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Tabɔkɔ e so ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a zɔ mba ewo wu mbala alɛ wu. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Tetete o nyama mo kwuwongu ɔnyɛ mbala izele; akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt; Lu yi kiya ingyirimo munɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Akwɛyi o to umu uwu bɔkɔ o pwuwumo o shi wu, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />akwɛyi a na e kwu meyi mbo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyi mi za yi kwuyengwu mi yi mbala yi awu gba ki ŋɔ le: apula iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu reshi mi mu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala ɛzu iyi anukenzu mbala kwokpo ungwu amu awu, akwu mega i nyɔlɔma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Akwɛyi a wu mba egbo ma kaa la zɔngɔma iso iyi Ukpo ma, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ gba o ka o shi mɛzhi le tee: Omezaya, mega a ma wɔnu akwɛyi e yi mo mu kuvɔ ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwɔla, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />akwɛyi o ra laa ɛnyi wu o tanu iyi i kwu ira ɔsu mbala i gba laa ingbomo i kpa mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi, i yo yoo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Lunyi lu kwu azɔgɔ umba apula ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Imi mafyi mi mi lɔ yi laa kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ada mi e so e shi mɛzhi. Lunyi ba la lu ŋɔ mu kwuse kwɔlɛ kaa ekpasu li wɔ moshi li fye ma yi dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O To Ɔzhizɔsi O Kawa Moshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19">Omaki 16.19</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:20">20</ref>; Ɛduma Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 1.9-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Akwɛyi a wa mba kwudu ungwu kwuse nzhii ba o ka mu kwuse ungwu Ɔbɛtani. Akwɛyi e yi ewo wu ma mu oshi akwɛyi e shi mbo esheshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Tabɔkɔ e ye mbo mu esheshi ishimo, akwɛyi a lu mba afyima akwɛyi o to wu o ka mu oshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />O gbo wu ɔya akwɛyi o gba o kama iyamba mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ laa ɔnyɛ uwakwuu. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Kwɔfyi kwɔfyi o mu Ɔtɛpu mbaa Ukpo ɛnyigbɛlɛma.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>